&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
&lt;div&gt;Puede leer la nota completa &lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.paymentmedia.com/news-5243-chile-la-tecnologa-de-pagos-detrs-de-getnet.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;en este enlace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Evertec ha desarrollado un papel importante ofreciendo toda su experiencia regional y soluciones de procesamiento adquirente.&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xD;
Para materializar este hito en el mercado de Chile, Evertec, brind&#xF3; todo su conocimiento, tecnolog&#xED;a e infraestructura en apoyo a la compa&#xF1;&#xED;a de pagos subsidiaria de Banco Santander Chile.</post_excerpt><post_date>2021-03-11 12:19:58</post_date><post_name>chile-la-tecnologia-de-pagos-detras-de-getnet</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/GetNet-1.png</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Evertec en los medios</post_category><post_tag>Chile,Evertec,Getnet</post_tag><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Chile: la tecnolog&#xED;a de pagos detr&#xE1;s de Getnet</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec reports fourth quarter and full year 2020 results</post_title><ID>23083</ID><post_content>&lt;h4&gt;Announces 2021 outlook&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;SAN JUAN, PUERTO RICO &#x2013; March 1, 2021 &#x2013; EVERTEC, Inc. (NYSE: EVTC) (&#x201C;Evertec&#x201D; or the &#x201C;Company&#x201D;) today announced results for the fourth quarter and full year ended December 31, 2020.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fourth Quarter 2020 Highlights and Recent Highlights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Revenue increased 6% to $134.2 million&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;GAAP Net Income attributable to common shareholders was $32.3 million, or $0.44 per diluted share&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Adjusted EBITDA increased 16% to $63.9 million&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Adjusted earnings per common share was $0.59, or a 23% increase&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Launched Santander Chile and Citibanamex products&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Expanding in Mexico with Mercado Libre&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Year 2020 Highlights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Revenue grew 5% to $510.6 million&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;GAAP Net Income attributable to common shareholders was $104.4 million, or $1.43 per diluted share&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Adjusted EBITDA increased 6% to $240.5 million&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Adjusted earnings per common share was $2.07, or a 6% increase&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;$21.7 million returned to shareholders through share repurchases and dividends&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mac Schuessler, President and Chief Executive Officer stated &#x201C;Despite the pandemic, we achieved record results for 2020 and delivered on significant key product implementations in Latin America for Santander Chile, Citibanamex and more recently with Mercado Libre in Mexico. We also benefited from increases in our ATH Movil and ATH Movil Business as consumers embraced a transition to digital transactions.&lt;br /&gt;Schuessler continued, &#x201C;&lt;em&gt;Looking to 2021, we expect trends with consumers, merchants and banks to drive further digitized commerce. These industry tailwinds combined with our continued focus on innovation and market expansion in Latin America, will fuel our growth both this year and beyond.&lt;/em&gt;&#x201D;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can read the complete report here: &lt;a href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/EVERTEC-REPORTS-FOURTH-QUARTER-AND-FULL-YEAR-2020-RESULTS.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;EVERTEC REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2020 RESULTS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2021-03-11 12:57:13</post_date><post_name>evertec-reports-fourth-quarter-and-full-year-2020-results</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/EVERTEC-FACILIDADES-DE-SU-SEDE-con-nuevo-logo-2.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag>2020,Earnings Report,Evertec,Fourth Quarter,Investors</post_tag><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec reports fourth quarter and full year 2020 results</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Conoce a Nuestras L&#xED;deres: Patricia Parrado</post_title><ID>23168</ID><post_content>&lt;b&gt;En Evertec, estamos comprometidos con la diversidad, equidad de g&#xE9;nero y desarrollo de las mujeres. Son rasgos claves de nuestro &#xE9;xito que nos distingue y llena de orgullo.&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;b&gt;Conoce a una de nuestras l&#xED;deres:&lt;/b&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ff6600;"&gt;PATRICIA PARRADO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt; es la gerente de Tecnolog&#xED;a de Evertec en Bogot&#xE1;.&#xD;
&#xD;
Patricia es profesional en Ingenier&#xED;a de Sistemas con una especializaci&#xF3;n en Gerencia de Mercadeo. Trabaja en Evertec desde hace 21 a&#xF1;os a trav&#xE9;s de los cuales se ha desempe&#xF1;ado&#xA0;como ingeniera de Desarrollo,&#xA0;Gerente de Desarrollo de Software, gerente Comercial, gerente de Mercadeo, gerente de Operaciones y,&#xA0;desde hace cerca de 2 a&#xF1;os, como gerente de Tecnolog&#xED;a.&#xD;
&#xD;
Patricia lidera los equipos de desarrollo y de certificaci&#xF3;n, compuestos por cerca de 70 funcionarios,&#xA0;de los cuales el 14% son mujeres.&#xA0;Su experiencia ha sido en el campo del procesamiento electr&#xF3;nico de pagos,&#xA0;en el sector financiero, grandes superficies y cajas de compensaci&#xF3;n.&#xD;
&#xD;
Le apasiona liderar equipos de trabajo y enfocar su mente, su coraz&#xF3;n y sus manos al logro de objetivos.&#xD;
&#xD;
Por Colombia, fue ganadora del premio Chairman&#x2019;s Award 2016, que otorga Evertec a los 10 mejores funcionarios&#xA0;de los pa&#xED;ses en los que tiene operaciones.&#xD;
&#xD;
En el 2020 estuvo entre las 5 finalistas al premio Globant Awards a mujeres que impactan en tecnolog&#xED;a en Colombia.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;i&gt;Estamos orgullosos de contar en Evertec con mujeres como Patricia, quienes demuestran nuestro compromiso continuo de asegurar que la diversidad y la inclusi&#xF3;n se integren en nuestras pr&#xE1;cticas y decisiones de negocio. Compromiso que nos ha llevado a ser incluidos y reconocidos, por tercera ocasi&#xF3;n, en el &lt;/i&gt;&lt;a href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/evertec-bloomberg-gei-tercer-ano/"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&#xCD;ndice de Igualdad de G&#xE9;nero de Bloomberg&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;i&gt;.&lt;/i&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>En Evertec, estamos comprometidos con la diversidad, equidad de g&#xE9;nero y desarrollo de las mujeres. Son rasgos claves de nuestro &#xE9;xito que nos distingue y llena de orgullo.&#xA0;</post_excerpt><post_date>2021-03-16 09:37:43</post_date><post_name>conoce-a-nuestras-lideres-patricia-parrado</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Mujeres-lideres-Patricia-Parrado-Portada.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Externos</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after>0</hefo_after><hefo_before>0</hefo_before><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Conoce a Nuestras L&#xED;deres: Patricia Parrado</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Meet one of our leaders: Patricia Parrado</post_title><ID>23183</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;At Evertec, we are committed to diversity, gender equality and the development of women. These are key features of our success that distinguish us and fill us with pride.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Meet one of our leaders:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;PATRICIA PARRADO&lt;/b&gt; is Evertec&#x2019;s Technology Manager in Bogota.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Patricia is a Systems Engineer with a specialization in Marketing Management. She has worked at Evertec for 21 years as a Development Engineer, Software Development Manager, Commercial Manager, Marketing Manager, Operations Manager and, for the last 2 years, as Technology Manager.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Patricia leads the development and certification teams, which consist of about 70 employees, 14% of whom are women. Her experience has been in the electronic payment processing field, in the financial sector, department stores and compensation funds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She is passionate about leading work teams and focusing her mind, heart and hands on achieving results.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She was awarded the Evertec Chairman&#x2019;s Award in 2016, representing Colombia. This award is given by Evertec to the 10 best employees in the countries where it operates.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In 2020 she was among the 5 finalists for the Globant Awards given to women who make an impact in technology in Colombia.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to have women like Patricia, at Evertec, women who demonstrate and ensure that our ongoing commitment to diversity and inclusion are integrated into our business practices and decisions. This commitment has led us to be recognized and included, for the third time in a row, in&#xA0;&lt;a href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/evertec-named-to-bloombergs-gender-equality-index-for-third-consecutive-year/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bloomberg&#x2019;s&#xA0;Gender Equality Index&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. At Evertec, we believe that diversity in our workforce is our formula for successful innovation.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>At Evertec, we are committed to diversity, gender equality and the development of women. These are key features of our success that distinguish us and fill us with pride.</post_excerpt><post_date>2021-03-16 09:37:43</post_date><post_name>meet-one-of-our-leaders-patricia-parrado</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/EN-Mujeres-lideres-Patricia-Parrado.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>External</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after>0</hefo_after><hefo_before>0</hefo_before><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Meet one of our leaders: Patricia Parrado</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Conoce a Nuestras L&#xED;deres: Carolina Hoyos</post_title><ID>23234</ID><post_content>&lt;b&gt;En Evertec, estamos comprometidos con la diversidad, equidad de g&#xE9;nero y desarrollo de las mujeres. Son rasgos claves de nuestro &#xE9;xito que nos distingue y llena de orgullo.&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;b&gt;Conoce a una de nuestras l&#xED;deres:&lt;/b&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;span style="color: #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;CAROLINA HOYOS &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;es gerente de Innovaci&#xF3;n en Evertec.&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0; &lt;/span&gt;Cuenta con m&#xE1;s de 10 a&#xF1;os de experiencia en comercio electr&#xF3;nico y ha desarrollado su carrera profesional en una industria liderada por hombres donde se ha ganado el respeto de sus colegas por su capacidad de conectar puntas y lograr que las cosas pasen.&#xD;
&#xD;
Carolina es comunicadora social de profesi&#xF3;n, especialista en Gerencia y Gestora de Innovaci&#xF3;n. Lleg&#xF3; a la compa&#xF1;&#xED;a hace 7 a&#xF1;os para desempe&#xF1;arse como consultora comercial y por el resultado de su gesti&#xF3;n y su capacidad de desarrollar los negocios con sus clientes, fue asignada desde hace 4 a&#xF1;os, a liderar el equipo de innovaci&#xF3;n en PlacetoPay haciendo de &#xE9;ste un elemento esencial del ADN de la organizaci&#xF3;n.&#xA0;&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;i&gt;Estamos orgullosos de contar en Evertec con mujeres como Carolina, quienes demuestran nuestro compromiso continuo de asegurar que la diversidad y la inclusi&#xF3;n se integren en nuestras pr&#xE1;cticas y decisiones de negocio. Compromiso que nos ha llevado a ser incluidos y reconocidos, por tercera ocasi&#xF3;n, en el &lt;/i&gt;&lt;a href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/evertec-bloomberg-gei-tercer-ano/"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&#xCD;ndice de Igualdad de G&#xE9;nero de Bloomberg&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;i&gt;.&lt;/i&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>En Evertec, estamos comprometidos con la diversidad, equidad de g&#xE9;nero y desarrollo de las mujeres. Son rasgos claves de nuestro &#xE9;xito que nos distingue y llena de orgullo.&#xA0;</post_excerpt><post_date>2021-03-18 10:24:13</post_date><post_name>conoce-a-nuestras-lideres-carolina-hoyos</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Mujeres-lideres-Carolina-Hoyos-Portada.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Externos</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after>0</hefo_after><hefo_before>0</hefo_before><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Conoce a Nuestras L&#xED;deres: Carolina Hoyos</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Meet one of our leaders: Carolina Hoyos</post_title><ID>23260</ID><post_content>&lt;b&gt;At Evertec, we are committed to diversity, gender equality and the development of women. These are key features of our success that distinguish us and fill us with pride.&lt;/b&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;b&gt;Meet one of our leaders:&lt;/b&gt;&#xD;
&lt;b&gt;CAROLINA HOYOS&lt;/b&gt;, is the Innovation Manager at Evertec. She has over 10 years of experience in e-commerce and has developed her professional career in a male-dominated industry where she has earned her colleagues&#x2019; respect for her ability to connect the dots and make things happen.&#xD;
&#xD;
Carolina is a social communicator with expertise in Management and Innovation. She joined the company 7 years ago to work as a commercial consultant. During this time, she delivered excellent results and was successful developing business with her clients, thus, four years ago, she was asked to lead the innovation team for PlacetoPay in Evertec Medellin, making it an essential element of the organization&#x2019;s DNA.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;i&gt;We are proud to have women like Carolina, at Evertec, women who demonstrate and ensure that our ongoing commitment to diversity and inclusion are integrated into our business practices and decisions. This commitment has led us to be recognized and included, for the third time in a row, in&#xA0;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;a href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/evertec-named-to-bloombergs-gender-equality-index-for-third-consecutive-year/"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Bloomberg&#x2019;s&#xA0;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Gender Equality Index&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;i&gt;. At Evertec, we believe that diversity in our workforce is our formula for successful innovation.&lt;/i&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>At Evertec, we are committed to diversity, gender equality and the development of women. These are key features of our success that distinguish us and fill us with pride.</post_excerpt><post_date>2021-03-18 10:24:13</post_date><post_name>meet-one-of-our-leaders-carolina-hoyos</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/EN-Mujeres-lideres-Carolina-Hoyos-Portada.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>External</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after>0</hefo_after><hefo_before>0</hefo_before><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Meet one of our leaders: Carolina Hoyos</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Conoce a Nuestras L&#xED;deres: Aida Medina</post_title><ID>23316</ID><post_content>&lt;b&gt;En Evertec, estamos comprometidos con la diversidad, equidad de g&#xE9;nero y desarrollo de las mujeres. Son rasgos claves de nuestro &#xE9;xito que nos distingue y llena de orgullo.&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;b&gt;Conoce a una de nuestras l&#xED;deres:&lt;/b&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;span style="color: #ff6600;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;AIDA MEDINA &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;es la gerente de Relaci&#xF3;n de Clientes de Panam&#xE1;.&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0; &lt;/span&gt;Tiene m&#xE1;s de 25 a&#xF1;os de experiencia en banca, medios de pago&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0; &lt;/span&gt;y empresas de tecnolog&#xED;a de procesamiento de informaci&#xF3;n.&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Labora desde 2014 en Evertec Panam&#xE1; y tiene la responsabilidad de la atenci&#xF3;n y la gesti&#xF3;n comercial&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0; &lt;/span&gt;de las 20 instituciones que son clientes de la empresa en el pa&#xED;s.&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0; &lt;/span&gt;Anteriormente, estuvo por 13 a&#xF1;os como gerente general en Tarjetas y Transacciones en una de las principales compa&#xF1;&#xED;as de servicios tecnol&#xF3;gicos de Venezuela y cuyos or&#xED;genes fueron&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0; &lt;/span&gt;Evertec Venezuela.&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0; &#xA0;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Tambi&#xE9;n labor&#xF3;&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0; &lt;/span&gt;en bancos venezolanos importantes&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0; &lt;/span&gt;como &lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0; &lt;/span&gt;vicepresidente de Medios de pago y&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0; &lt;/span&gt;Tarjetas de cr&#xE9;dito y como gerente&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0; &lt;/span&gt;adjunto de la Vicepresidencia de&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0; &lt;/span&gt;Medios de Pago.&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Ella es economista colegiada, egresada de la Universidad Central de Venezuela.&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
