et one of our leaders: Elena Manrara Goyco</post_title><ID>23514</ID><post_content>&lt;b&gt;At Evertec, we are committed to diversity, gender equality and the development of women. These are key features of our success that distinguish us and fill us with pride.&lt;/b&gt;&#xD;
