&lt;h3&gt;Digitalizaci&#xF3;n masiva de peque&#xF1;as y medianas empresas&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
Las Pymes est&#xE1;n m&#xE1;s interesadas que nunca en digitalizarse. Hay grandes oportunidades que se presentan en este escenario:&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Ventas en redes sociales.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Banca para Pymes.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Plataformas de compra.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Pr&#xE9;stamos y seguros.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Pagar a trav&#xE9;s de enlaces (links de pagos)&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;ERP y CRM&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
Para que esto suceda se debe crear un ecosistema y romper el ciclo del efectivo, ofreciendo soluciones f&#xE1;ciles y econ&#xF3;micas. Seg&#xFA;n el seminario de AMI, los minoristas est&#xE1;n cada vez m&#xE1;s cerca de ser proveedores de servicios para las Pymes, aumentando su participaci&#xF3;n en el mercado global.&#xD;
&lt;h3&gt;Aumenta el uso de las criptomonedas en Am&#xE9;rica Latina&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
El auge de las criptomonedas es un hecho.&#xA0;Cada vez se utilizan m&#xE1;s y se invierte m&#xE1;s en y con ellas. Las monedas virtuales conforman una de las nuevas tecnolog&#xED;as existentes. Surgen como alternativa al dinero convencional que, en &#xE9;pocas de crisis encuentran su lugar en el mundo. Adem&#xE1;s, son f&#xE1;ciles de usar y permiten realizar acciones de forma m&#xE1;s r&#xE1;pida.&#xD;
&#xD;
Pa&#xED;ses como&#xA0;&lt;strong&gt;M&#xE9;xico, Argentina, Venezuela o Brasil fomentan el uso de las monedas virtuales&#xA0;&lt;/strong&gt;porque son conscientes de sus m&#xFA;ltiples beneficios&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://es.statista.com/grafico/18425/adopcion-de-las-criptomonedas-en-el-mundo/"&gt;Statista Global Consumer Survey&lt;/a&gt;&#xA0;ha realizado una encuesta y los resultados anuncian que los pa&#xED;ses que m&#xE1;s utilizan las monedas virtuales son:&#xD;
&lt;h3&gt;Brasil&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
Uno de los pa&#xED;ses donde m&#xE1;s aumenta el uso de las criptomonedas. En la encuesta se encuentra en el segundo lugar, por detr&#xE1;s de Turqu&#xED;a. Seg&#xFA;n los resultados, el 18% de las personas que han realizado la encuesta afirman usar este nuevo sistema de pago.&#xD;
&lt;h3&gt;Colombia&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
Se encuentra en el tercer lugar de la lista y, en cuanto a pa&#xED;ses latinoamericanos, ocupa el segundo lugar. Tambi&#xE9;n est&#xE1; desarrollando una gran evoluci&#xF3;n tanto en el uso como en la inversi&#xF3;n en criptomonedas y, al igual que en Brasil, el porcentaje de personas que afirman utilizar o poseer criptomonedas asciende al 18%.&#xD;
&lt;h3&gt;Argentina&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
Se encuentra a poca distancia de los pa&#xED;ses anteriores. El motivo porque el cada vez m&#xE1;s argentinos usan este m&#xE9;todo de pago es la posibilidad de que se produzca un corralito. Es decir, a que se limite el acceso disponible al dinero en efectivo. El porcentaje de personas que afirman usar las monedas virtuales es de un 16%.&#xD;
&lt;h3&gt;M&#xE9;xico&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
En el pa&#xED;s centroamericano se comienza a desarrollar una gran evoluci&#xF3;n, sin embargo, todav&#xED;a existe mucha desinformaci&#xF3;n acerca del tema. Los mexicanos que afirman usar o invertir en criptomonedas son un 12%.&#xD;
&lt;h3&gt;Chile&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;
Se encuentra un punto por debajo de M&#xE9;xico con un 11%. El problema que existe en este pa&#xED;s es el mismo que en el mexicano. La falta de informaci&#xF3;n hace mella en la poca confianza que todav&#xED;a se genera respecto a esta nueva forma de pago. Necesitan m&#xE1;s informaciones sobre las ventajas de utilizar las criptomonedas para poder aumentar la confianza en su uso&#xD;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fuentes:&#xA0;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.semana.com/tecnologia/articulo/que-es-el-open-banking-y-que-ventajas-ofrece-para-entidades-y-usuarios/298017/#:~:text=El%20modelo%20de%20open%20banking,de%20protecci%C3%B3n%20de%20datos%20personales."&gt;Revista Semana&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://americasmi.com/"&gt;Americas Market Intelligence&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;Statista &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2021-05-20 19:48:10</post_date><post_name>los-pagos-digitales-siguen-consolidandose-en-latinoamerica-este-2021</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Banner_Los-pagos-digitales-siguen-consolida&#x301;ndose-en-Latinoame&#x301;rica-este-2021.-Conoce-aqui&#x301;-las-tendencias.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Externos</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Los pagos digitales siguen consolid&#xE1;ndose en Latinoam&#xE9;rica este 2021</title><meta_desc>No importa si tu empresa comercializa productos o servicios, todo tipo de negocio puede contar con una pasarela de pagos para vender por internet.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Poniendo en pr&#xE1;ctica la protecci&#xF3;n del planeta Tierra</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Meet one of our leaders: Ana Laura Olmos</post_title><ID>27316</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Evertec, we are committed to diversity, gender equality and the development of women. These are key features of our success that distinguish us and fill us with pride.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Meet one of our leaders:&lt;br /&gt;ANA LAURA OLMOS is Evertec's Marketing and Communications Manager for Latin America.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She has more than 14 years of experience in the electronic payments and transactional processing industry as well as in fraud prevention and security areas. She currently leads communications and marketing for the Latin American markets where Evertec operates. Ana Laura has been recognized for her leadership and ability to always integrate local needs with the corporate objectives to better serve both internal and external clients.In her current role, Ana Laura manages a team distributed throughout the region in charge of positioning Evertec in Latin America by developing communications, participating and organizing events that allow sharing of Evertec's knowledge and experience in the payments business.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Before taking on her current role, she served as Communications and Marketing Manager at PayGroup, a company acquired by Evertec in 2017. Prior to that, she served as content editor for local publications in Uruguay. Ana Laura also participates as a mentor in the women's edition &#x201C;Despegate&#x201D; program, organized by CEDU (Chamber of the Digital Economy of Uruguay), which seeks to empower small and medium businesses by matching them with experts and business leaders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She completed a master&#x2019;s degree in Communications Management from the University of Montevideo, and has a Bachelor of Science in Social Communication from the Catholic University of Uruguay.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are proud to have women like Ana Laura, at Evertec, women who demonstrate and ensure that our ongoing commitment to diversity and inclusion are integrated into our business practices and decisions. This commitment has led us to be recognized and included, for the third time in a row, in &lt;a href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/evertec-named-to-bloombergs-gender-equality-index-for-third-consecutive-year/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bloomberg&#x2019;s Gender Equality Index&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. At Evertec, we believe that diversity in our workforce is our formula for successful innovation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2021-05-28 11:02:24</post_date><post_name>meet-one-of-our-leaders-ana-laura-olmos</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/EN-Mujeres-lideres-Ana-Laura-Olmos-Portada.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>External</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Meet one of our leaders: Ana Laura Olmos</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Conoce a nuestras l&#xED;deres: Ana Laura Olmos</post_title><ID>27336</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En Evertec, estamos comprometidos con la diversidad, equidad de g&#xE9;nero y desarrollo de las mujeres. Son rasgos claves de nuestro &#xE9;xito que nos distingue y llena de orgullo.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Conoce a una de nuestras l&#xED;deres:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ANA LAURA OLMOS&lt;/strong&gt; es la gerente de Comunicaciones y Mercadeo para Am&#xE9;rica Latina de Evertec.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Posee m&#xE1;s de 14 a&#xF1;os de experiencia en la industria de pagos electr&#xF3;nicos y procesamiento de transacciones, prevenci&#xF3;n de fraude y seguridad, liderando las comunicaciones y mercadeo en los diferentes mercados de Latinoam&#xE9;rica donde Evertec opera. Ana Laura se ha destacado en su liderazgo y en su capacidad de integrar siempre lo local con lo corporativo para servir mejor a clientes internos y externos.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;En su rol actual, Ana Laura maneja un equipo distribuido por la regi&#xF3;n gestionando las estrategias de comunicaciones y mercadeo para dar a conocer y posicionar a Evertec en Latinoam&#xE9;rica, as&#xED; como participar y organizar eventos que permitan compartir el conocimiento y experiencia de Evertec en el negocio.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Antes de ocupar su rol actual, ejerci&#xF3; como gerente de Comunicaciones y mercadeo en PayGroup, empresa adquirida por Evertec en 2017. Previo a esto se desempe&#xF1;&#xF3; como editora de contenidos en publicaciones locales de Uruguay. Ana Laura tambi&#xE9;n participa como mentora del programa &#x201C;Despegate&#x201D; edici&#xF3;n mujeres, organizado por CEDU (C&#xE1;mara de la Econom&#xED;a Digital del Uruguay), en la que se busca potenciar a las pymes relacion&#xE1;ndolas con expertas y l&#xED;deres de negocio.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Realiz&#xF3; estudios de Maestr&#xED;a en Direcci&#xF3;n de Comunicaciones de la Universidad de Montevideo, y es Licenciada en Ciencias de la Comunicaci&#xF3;n Social por la Universidad Cat&#xF3;lica del Uruguay.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Estamos orgullosos de contar en Evertec con mujeres como Ana Laura, quienes demuestran que nuestro compromiso continuo de asegurar que la diversidad y la inclusi&#xF3;n se integren en nuestras pr&#xE1;cticas y decisiones de negocio. Compromiso que nos ha llevado a ser incluidos y reconocidos, por tercera ocasi&#xF3;n, en el &lt;a href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/evertec-bloomberg-gei-tercer-ano/"&gt;&#xCD;ndice de Igualdad de G&#xE9;nero de Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2021-05-28 11:02:24</post_date><post_name>conoce-a-nuestras-lideres-ana-laura-olmos</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Mujeres-lideres-Ana-Laura-Olmos-Portada.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Externos</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Conoce a nuestras l&#xED;deres: Ana Laura Olmos</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Successful Evertec Strategy: Bet on Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion</post_title><ID>27401</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;Evertec is the clear example of how to integrate strategies aimed at this purpose; it is the key to achieving great business results. Proof of this is the company&#x2019;s inclusion, for the third time, in &lt;strong&gt;Bloomberg&#x2019;s Gender Equality Index&lt;/strong&gt;, which highlights its commitment to and transparency in the promotion of women's equality within the organization.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bogot&#xE1;, February 202&lt;/strong&gt;1. Evertec, a leading company of transaction processing services in Latin America, stands out in the industry as an organization that features diversity, equity, and inclusion as its pillars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Part of Evertec&#x2019;s efforts is reflected in their positioning as an employer brand, by promoting several policies based on equity and gender diversity, free of prejudice and fostering an inclusive culture where women can occupy leadership roles, as well as anti-harassment policies. These have been effective tools that the corporation is proud of.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Recently, Evertec received the news that, for the third consecutive year, it would be included in Bloomberg&#x2019;s Gender Equality Index, which identifies companies committed to transparency in the disclosure of gender-related reports and the promotion of women's equality. This index also measures gender equality based on five pillars: female leadership and talent pipeline, equal pay and gender pay parity, inclusive culture, sexual harassment policies, and pro-women brand.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&#x201C;For Evertec, it is gratifying to see that all of the efforts that we promote within the company are reflected in the industry. Being included in this important index for the third time in a row shows us that our programs &#x2013;focused on developing female talent through leadership roles&#x2013; and our diversity efforts are on the right path&#x201D;,&lt;/i&gt; says Paola P&#xE9;rez, Executive Vice-President and Evertec's main administrative officer lead in human resources management.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is not the only aspect worth highlighting. As part of Evertec's commitment to women's growth within the organization, they held part of the &lt;strong&gt;Globant Awards - Women That Build Edition&lt;/strong&gt;, an award that recognizes women who have made their careers in technology and manage innovation projects and collaborations. One of the five finalists for this award was Patricia Parrado, Technology Manager for Colombia, who stood out among a large number of participants due to her professional trajectory, academic training, leadership, and impact on the community.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;&#x201C;It is an honor for us that one of our leaders is part of this select group of women who have been recognized for their leadership skills and knowledge in the sector. This shows that women in Evertec can change the vision of the industry and greatly improve the company&#x2019;s ideas&#x201D;,&lt;/i&gt; says Enrique Candanoza, Country Head of Evertec Colombia.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Evertec has two offices in Colombia, located in Bogot&#xE1; and Medell&#xED;n, that meet all of the pillars for which the organization is recognized.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The efforts made by Evertec to achieve this recognition include the following:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Promote an inclusive culture among its employees.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Develop female talent through leadership roles.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Include policies to protect against, prevent, and address sexual harassment.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Integrate, as a brand hallmark, Evertec&#x2019;s value as a pro-gender diversity and prejudice-free employer.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;37% of our employees are women, 26% of whom work in information technology, which is significant since it has been shown that the role of women in the technology industry is key to the development of the sector.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With these achievements in the field of gender equity, Evertec is reaffirmed as one of the leading companies to feature inclusion, not only at the national level but also globally, as an ideal path for business productivity and growth, something that has been evidenced through its figures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;About Evertec:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Evertec (NYSE: EVTC), a leading transaction processing services company in Latin America, provides services for acquiring retail transactions, payment processing, and business process management. It manages a system of electronic payment networks that processes more than 2 billion transactions annually and provides an integral set of banking solutions processing services, cash processing, and technology outsourcing. In addition, Evertec possesses and operates &lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/cajeros/"&gt;the ATH&lt;sup&gt;&#xAE;&lt;/sup&gt; network&lt;/a&gt;, one of the main PIN debit networks in Latin America. With headquarters in Puerto Rico, it offers services in 26 countries in Latin America. For more information, visit &lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com"&gt;www.evertecinc.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Press contacts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Brenda Agosto&lt;br /&gt;(787) 472-7633 / &lt;a href="mailto:brenda.agosto@sandybrown-hedgehog-798082.hostingersite.com"&gt;brenda.agosto@sandybrown-hedgehog-798082.hostingersite.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Alexandra L&#xF3;pez-Soler&lt;br /&gt;Cel. (939) 400-6497 / &lt;a href="mailto:alexandra.lopez@sandybrown-hedgehog-798082.hostingersite.com"&gt;alexandra.lopez@sandybrown-hedgehog-798082.hostingersite.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Bogot&#xE1;, febrero de 2021. Evertec, una compa&#xF1;&#xED;a l&#xED;der de servicios de procesamiento de transacciones en Am&#xE9;rica Latina se destaca dentro de la industria como una organizaci&#xF3;n que ha puesto como eje del negocio la diversidad, equidad e inclusi&#xF3;n.&#xA0;</post_excerpt><post_date>2021-03-05 15:17:04</post_date><post_name>successful-evertec-strategy-bet-on-diversity-equity-and-inclusion</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Apostar-por-la-diversidad-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after>0</hefo_after><hefo_before>0</hefo_before><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Successful Evertec Strategy: Bet on Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Acquisition as part of a future strategy</post_title><ID>27419</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;Factors such as interoperability, exchange, standards compliance, and fraud monitoring play a relevant role when it comes to thinking about implementing acquisition as part of your future strategy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The business of acquiring&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;There is a symbiotic relationship between issuance and acquisition: for there to be issuance, there must be acceptance, for there to be acceptance, issuance must occur. Acquiring is defined as the acceptance of means of payment, and acquirer, as the institution that accepts payments on behalf of a company. Said payments are made in both card-present and non-present environments. Traditionally, card-present transactions are made through a point of sale (POS) and, more recently, through smartphones or QR codes. On the other hand, the main channel for generating card-not-present transactions is e-commerce (electronic commerce).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;An acquiring institution is, in most cases, the link between merchants and international card brands. This institution manages the different contracts with businesses, general conditions for accepting payments, forms and terms of settlement, commission for the service, and monthly POS rent amounts, among other aspects. The motivations for entering this business can be diverse: establishing direct relationships with businesses, earning commission margins, performing bank cross-selling, and supporting the issuing business, among others; therefore, being clear about the business objective is essential.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There are as many acquisition models as there are countries in Latin America, some more complex than others, where various parties intervene in the integration and processing of payments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Certain countries have acquisition networks, some established for many years and still in operation today. In other markets, it is the banks who perform the tasks of an acquirer directly. Countries like Chile and Argentina are in full transition of their acquisition model and have started growing from one or two acquisition networks to a more competitive model, both in new technologies and in services directed to different market segments &#x2014;very similar to what happened in Brazil a few years ago. This is a dynamic business in which the reality of each country determines the model. Therefore, the acquirer must establish a very clear strategy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The role of the acquiring processor&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;One of the most complex issues in the world of acquisition, and one of the decisions that tip the balance in choosing an acquiring processing provider, is the regulatory and mandatory trademark updates in processing systems. In the case of an acquiring processor, the processor must comply with these updates. Otherwise, the institution must carry out internal efforts and constantly absorb these changes into its own systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Another important aspect is related to the size of the investments required to become an acquirer. Hiring a sizable processor with scalability, such as Evertec, allows the acquirer to make the right decision, supported by the experience, infrastructure, certifications, and connections required to meet industry standards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Digital payments have received a huge and unstoppable boost in recent years. Acquirers must be prepared, and their processors must offer the tools to always stay on top of that wave. The participation of issuers and, in some countries, governments, is essential to the implementation of measures that promote and encourage new means of payment. This is one of the reasons why some Asian countries have been successful in the digital transformation. Since the government has great influence in some of these countries, it helps encourage the switch from physical to electronic money and promotes the use of electronic transactions, prompting a faster evolution of the ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Beyond commissions, value-added services&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;The acquirer has the ability to retain affiliate business which is not subject to the commission levied. In a competitive market, commissions take a back seat, and value-added services take on added relevance. These can be associated with basic issues, such as efficiency in field management, and even more complex ones, such as fraud management and consulting. This is where the merchant base segmentation comes into play, knowing the needs of each segment and having a processing partner that supports the acquirer with the appropriate tools for each one. A small store might need field services, like hubs, phone support, or easy-to-read statements; while sophisticated businesses or large retail stores might need direct connections, accounting system integration, 24x7 technology support, or robust fraud monitoring tools and assistance. This is where we circle around to the original point and the importance of defining your objective as an acquirer, fine-tuning the strategy for different segments, and establishing the services that will provide more value and security for customers. A processing partner like Evertec makes differentiation possible.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Article by: &lt;br /&gt;Daniel Barba / Vice President of Acquisition and Processing for Latin America&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>En constante evoluci&#xF3;n en los diferentes mercados de la regi&#xF3;n y del mundo, el negocio adquirente representa la apertura a nuevos nichos de mercado y a la innovaci&#xF3;n; ya sea en tecnolog&#xED;a de dispositivos o terminales para capturar los pagos, como en la experiencia de compra y de servicio entre los diferentes actores de los ecosistemas de pagos.</post_excerpt><post_date>2020-02-24 00:20:45</post_date><post_name>acquisition-as-part-of-a-future-strategy</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/banner-La-Adquirencia-como-parte-de-una-estrategia-a-futuro-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Acquisition as part of a future strategy</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Digitization and Challenges for the Payment Ecosystem</post_title><ID>27440</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;However, not everything has been shadows. Those who made the decision to move forward in the digitization of their businesses are now in a position that allows them to &#x201C;ride the wave&#x201D; and be part of an era of very important changes in the way companies and their customers interact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The lockdown has forced consumers to migrate from physical channels to digital channels, which has brought a significant increase in the demand for online purchases. According to the Santiago Chamber of Commerce, by the end of March of this year, online purchases had grown 119% (compared to the same period last year), to the detriment of sales in physical stores, which fell by 41%.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;According to a study by Mercado Libre, between the months of March and May of this year, 1.7 million new online buyers were added in Latin America, not only purchasing items associated with protection against the pandemic, but also making purchases associated with lifestyle and mass consumption, such as board games, beauty products, and consoles, among other categories.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The study shows that, in Chile, 74% of respondents state they will continue using electronic channels after the pandemic, while 70% will continue using electronic means of payments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Challenges for the Payment Ecosystem&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;The increasing demand and changes in customer behavior present significant challenges for the players in the payment ecosystem. Both the companies that sell their products / services and the financial and non-financial institutions that make this possible must be able to respond appropriately and in a timely manner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On the one hand, we should ask: h ow do we attract and retain new users? It is essential to be flexible and offer experiences that respond to the expectations and habits of new consumers, as well as be able to offer digital means of payment that include everyone. In this regard, new prepaid issuers and their portfolios have the chance to attract the unbanked segment, which needs an alternative to access goods and services through online channels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On the other hand, it is important to ensure a 100% digital and frictionless operation that stimulates, instead of discouraging, the use of online channels, from customer onboarding to payment and claims management. If it had previously seemed annoying to have to go through physical channels to make payments or transactions, doing it now would border on the absurd.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today, there are strategies and technologies, such as risk-based authentication, which allow you to adjust the intensity of the interaction with the user based on their profile, context, and behavior to avoid unnecessary friction throughout their experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Finally, this increase in demand should not mean a commensurate increase in fraud. According to data provided by Nova Red, March saw a growth of close to 40% in cybercrimes, mostly phishing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now more than ever, preventing fraud implies leaving aside the static rules that produce high rates of denial (and therefore dissatisfaction) and starting to look at customers from a 360&#xBA; angle, as a unit that must be understood and that interacts through multiple transactions, channels, and devices. We must move towards the implementation of rules to analyze customer behavior beyond payment, to "fine-tune the aim", increase acceptance, and reduce false positives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The change is just beginning and is here to stay. There is still time to rethink business models, to adapt them to this &#x201C;new normal,&#x201D; and to be able to participate in the new economy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Article by Pablo Sever&#xED;n Bull, Evertec Regional Presales Manager.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>La crisis sanitaria nos ha pasado la cuenta por las decisiones que tomamos o dejamos de tomar previo a la pandemia.</post_excerpt><post_date>2020-08-05 14:39:10</post_date><post_name>digitization-and-challenges-for-the-payment-ecosystem</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/articulo-la-digitalizacion-y-los-desafios-para-el-ecosistema-de-pagos-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Digitization and Challenges for the Payment Ecosystem</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Requiring signatures from your clients when paying with credit cards is optional</post_title><ID>27449</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;These changes were implemented in 2018, when different credit card companies started to flexibilize this requirement, with the arrival of new technologies that help validate customer identities without the need to sign payment receipts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;What Does This Mean for the Merchant?&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is an important innovation in terms of security, like EMV chips, contactless payments, and advanced technologies against fraud. These improvements offer greater security and a simpler way to pay.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now, the merchant will not need to ask for a signature on payment receipt, with additional options to offer customers an expedited experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;For the Common Good&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Given the current pandemic situation, with the spread of the novel coronavirus, brands such as Visa and Amex have announced their efforts to reduce contact at POS terminals and support merchants.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Recently, Visa announced that it will be extending the option of not requiring signatures to all merchants, even if they don't have the ability to process EMV chip payments, in order to reduce contact at POS terminals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Meanwhile, American Express, in its effort to support both cardholders and merchants, will not require the cardholder&#x2019;s signature at POS terminals for current card transactions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MasterCard&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="https://mastercardcontentexchange.com/newsroom/press-releases/2018/signing-off-mastercard-moves-beyond-signatures-worldwide/"&gt;https://mastercardcontentexchange.com/newsroom/press-releases/2018/signing-off-mastercard-moves-beyond-signatures-worldwide/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VISA&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="https://usa.visa.com/dam/VCOM/global/support-legal/documents/visa-nosigflyer-us-can-040518.pdf"&gt;https://usa.visa.com/dam/VCOM/global/support-legal/documents/visa-nosigflyer-us-can-040518.pdf&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AMEX&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.americanexpress.com/us/merchant/index.html?inav=gb_sitefooter_merchant"&gt;https://www.americanexpress.com/us/merchant/index.html?inav=gb_sitefooter_merchant&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Recientemente, las principales marcas de tarjetas de cr&#xE9;dito (MasterCard, VISA, AmEx y Discover) han tomado la determinaci&#xF3;n de no exigir el uso de firmas.</post_excerpt><post_date>2020-07-31 21:18:41</post_date><post_name>requiring-signatures-from-your-clients-when-paying-with-credit-cards-is-optional</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/articulo-opcional-el-requerir-firmas-de-tus-clientes-a-la-hora-de-pagar-con-tarjetas-de-credito-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Requiring signatures from your clients when paying with credit cards is optional</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Simplify the operational processes of your company with an ERP system</post_title><ID>27462</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;To achieve this, there is Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP), a set of information systems that enable the integration of certain procedures and automate business activities, from order entry, payment collection, purchasing supplies, to paying vendors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On the other hand, cloud-based computing (also called Software as a Service, or SaaS), allows users to access software applications that run on shared computing resources (e.g., processing power, memory, and disk storage) over the Internet. These computing resources are maintained in remote data centers dedicated to hosting multiple applications on various platforms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now, let&#x2019;s talk about Cloud ERP. A software as a service (SaaS) that allows users to access the enterprise resource planning (ERP) system over the Internet. Cloud ERP generally has much lower upfront costs because the computing resources are rented monthly instead of being purchased outright and maintained on-site. Cloud ERP also gives companies access to their critical business applications at any time, from anywhere.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Having these services reside in the cloud is a great advantage for small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs), as it provides access to these full-featured applications at a reasonable cost. This means the business does not have to incur substantial upfront expenses on hardware and software, because by using a suitable cloud provider, they can quickly scale their business productivity software as their business grows or a new company is added.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For this type of solution, Evertec offers the Acumatica system, an adaptable business management product designed for the growth of small and medium-sized organizations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To learn more, visit: &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/acumatica-erp/"&gt;Acumatica ERP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>The integration and automation of a business's operational processes facilitate a company in having an agile and successful operation.</post_excerpt><post_date>2020-06-03 21:28:24</post_date><post_name>simplify-the-operational-processes-of-your-company-with-an-erp-system</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/banner-Simplifica-los-procesos-operacionales-de-tu-empresa-con-un-Sistema-ERP-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Opcional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Simplify the operational processes of your company with an ERP system</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Tokenization, a safe solution to protect cardholder information</post_title><ID>27492</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;For those who are not familiar with the term, and without going into the technical details, a token is a chain of characters that has a coherent meaning in certain programming languages.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Why is this relevant for end users or from a client&#x2019;s perspective?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tokenization adds security to credit card payments by replacing the customer's credit or debit card number with a series of randomly generated numbers (TOKEN). These tokens can move through the internet and the existing payment networks, handling the data needed to process payments without exposing the real information, making it possible for the card digits to stay safe inside a security "vault".&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tokenization is emerging rapidly as the safe solution to protect customer card information and comply with the payment method processing standards, which all participants in this process must meet to achieve the information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This helps customers complete transactions while providing the least amount of payment details and improving their experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Benefits of Tokenization:&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;It protects the payment method details.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;It protects personal information.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;It protects the data in the cloud.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;It helps ensure compliance with regulatory obligations, including the PCI DSS standard.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;It safeguards financial data.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;These technologies promote the development of a global standard and will help payment product institutions improve. We urge all participants to enroll in the implementation of these alternatives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Author:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rafael Murillo Chinchilla, Manager Network of POS &amp;amp; ATMs LATAM in Evertec Costa Rica&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>A medida que m&#xE1;s consumidores realizan compras en l&#xED;nea con sus tel&#xE9;fonos inteligentes, tabletas y computadores.</post_excerpt><post_date>2020-07-15 21:37:02</post_date><post_name>tokenization-a-safe-solution-to-protect-cardholder-information</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/banner-Tokenizacion-una-solucion-segura-para-proteger-la-informacion-del-Tarjetahabiente-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Tokenization, a safe solution to protect cardholder information</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec supported Grupo &#xC9;xito in grocery donations to the most vulnerable</post_title><ID>27528</ID><post_content>&lt;strong&gt;A digital portal was developed in record time by Evertec to support digital transactions with high security standards&lt;/strong&gt;&#xD;
(Source: Published by Radio Caracol, Caracol.com on April 15, 2020)&#xD;
&#xD;
Evertec&lt;sup&gt;&#xAE;&lt;/sup&gt;, a technology company, together with Grupo &#xC9;xito developed a virtual platform where groceries can be purchased to be donated to families who need it in the middle of the contingency of the COVID-19 pandemic. Those interested can gift the grocery card by Colombia, exclusively for grocery products, ranging from $ 10,000 COP up to $ 500,000 COP.&#xD;
&#xD;
The bonus can be purchased through the web portal and can be redeemed in different warehouses from &lt;strong&gt;Grupo &#xC9;xito&lt;/strong&gt;.&#xD;
&#xD;
Enrique Candanoza, General Manager of Evertec in Colombia said: "&lt;em&gt;We have developed this site solution for payment by any means in record time. It was a very important collaborative endeavor with the information technology team from &lt;strong&gt;Grupo &#xC9;xito&lt;/strong&gt;, in which we achieved a connection with the gift card platform in just 5 days, when this this process can usually take up to 2 months. We have put together an experienced technical and human team, using our PlacetoPay platform, specialized in digital transactions which offers safe operations because it is PCI DSS certified (Payment Card Industry Data Security Standard)&lt;/em&gt;."&#xD;
&#xD;
Those interested can enter the website: &lt;a href="https://www.exito.com/tarjeta-mercado" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://www.exito.com/tarjeta-mercado&lt;/a&gt; , click on the option "&lt;em&gt;Gift groceries&lt;/em&gt;", fill out the form with the requested data, choose the amount, and finish the transaction.</post_content><post_excerpt>Un portal digital fue desarrollado en tiempo r&#xE9;cord por Evertec y soporta transacciones digitales con altos est&#xE1;ndares de seguridad</post_excerpt><post_date>2020-05-02 14:51:31</post_date><post_name>evertec-supported-grupo-exito-in-grocery-donations-to-the-most-vulnerable</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/banner-evertec-apoyo-a-grupo-exito-en-donacion-de-mercados-a-los-mas-vulnerables.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News,Evertec en los medios,</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec supported Grupo &#xC9;xito in grocery donations to the most vulnerable</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec donates $50,000 to non-profit organizations</post_title><ID>27555</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;(San Juan, P.R. &#x2013; 30 de noviembre de 2020) &#x2013; Conscientes de la gran labor que realizan las organizaciones sin fines de lucro en Puerto Rico, Evertec anunci&#xF3; hoy que &lt;strong&gt;donar&#xE1; $50 mil d&#xF3;lares a la iniciativa #GivingTuesdayPR&lt;/strong&gt; para parear los recaudos de hasta 45 organizaciones sin fines de lucro que se beneficien de esta iniciativa global que se llevar&#xE1; a cabo, ma&#xF1;ana martes 1 de diciembre.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alexandra L&#xF3;pez, vicepresidenta senior de Mercadeo y Comunicaciones de Evertec, indic&#xF3; que, &#x201C;&lt;em&gt;el Tercer Sector ha sido instrumental en la recuperaci&#xF3;n y el desarrollo de nuestro pa&#xED;s. Ellos son el primer frente de respuesta en momentos de crisis y uno de sus grandes retos sigue siendo obtener fondos para sus operaciones. Hemos sido testigos de su gesti&#xF3;n durante los huracanes, los terremotos y ahora con la pandemia. Por eso, en Evertec, vamos a parear los primeros $45 mil d&#xF3;lares que se reciban a trav&#xE9;s de la iniciativa local. &#xA0;Adicional, donaremos $5,000 a la Alianza para el Desarrollo del Tercer Sector Puertorrique&#xF1;o, en sus esfuerzos por promover el trabajo de las organizaciones sin fines de lucro&lt;/em&gt;.&#x201D;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evertec hace un llamado a los m&#xE1;s de 1.5 millones de usuarios de &lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="https://portal.athmovil.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;ATH M&#xF3;vil&lt;/a&gt; y a la empresa privada en Puerto Rico a que se unan a este esfuerzo y apoyen con su donativo a la organizaci&#xF3;n sin fines de lucro de su preferencia que est&#xE9; participando de &lt;strong&gt;#GivingTuesdayPR&lt;/strong&gt;. De esta forma, se maximizan las oportunidades de recaudaci&#xF3;n de fondos de estas organizaciones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Por su parte, Roberto Soto Acosta, presidente de la Alianza para el Desarrollo del Tercer Sector Puertorrique&#xF1;o y representante global de #GivingTuesday Puerto Rico expres&#xF3;, &#x201C;&lt;em&gt;estamos muy agradecidos con Evertec por todo su apoyo en estos dos a&#xF1;os.&#xA0; Esta particular iniciativa de "matching gifts" nos llena de gran entusiasmo porque sabemos que, sin lugar a duda, ser&#xE1; un gran incentivo para que las organizaciones promuevan sus proyectos de #GivingTuesday entre los potenciales donantes de #GivingTuesday 2020 el 1 de diciembre&lt;/em&gt;.&#x201D;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Para determinar las 45 organizaciones a las cuales se les parear&#xE1; los $1,000 de donaciones, las organizaciones participantes tener sus proyectos registrados debidamente en &lt;strong&gt;#GivingTuesdayPR&lt;/strong&gt;, alcanzar esa cantidad en donaciones, el 1 de diciembre de 2020, entre las 12:01 a.m. hasta las 11:59 p.m. y cumplir con las reglas y regulaciones establecidas por la Alianza. Las mismas incluyen entre otras: evidenciar que al momento de la emisi&#xF3;n del pago contin&#xFA;an activas como organizaciones sin fines de lucro y una notificaci&#xF3;n por correo electr&#xF3;nico a &lt;strong&gt;#GivingTuesdayPR&lt;/strong&gt;, de que la cantidad del pareo ($1,000 d&#xF3;lares) fue recaudada, incluyendo evidencia del momento en que se logr&#xF3;. Para m&#xE1;s informaci&#xF3;n sobre las reglas, pueden acceder &lt;a href="https://www.givingtuesday.org.pr" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://www.givingtuesday.org.pr&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Conscientes de la gran labor que realizan las organizaciones sin fines de lucro en Puerto Rico.</post_excerpt><post_date>2020-11-30 22:33:49</post_date><post_name>evertec-donates-50000-to-non-profit-organizations</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/evertec-dona-50000-a-organizaciones-sin-fines-de-lucro.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>closed</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News,Evertec en los medios,</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Opcional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec donates $50,000 to non-profit organizations</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec is a participating organization of the PCI Council</post_title><ID>27574</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;PCI SSC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&#xA0;(Payment Card Industry Security Standards Council) is an open world forum with the objective of formulating, improving, storing, disseminating, and applying all of the necessary security standards to guarantee the protection of account data.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In turn, the &lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;PCI SSC&lt;/a&gt; is the Council that defines the security standards consisting of physical, logical and administrative controls (PCI DSS) to meet this objective. In the PCI Council, any processor or service provider dedicated to processing, storing, or transmitting payment card data, is required to comply with the standards previously agreed upon.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a participating organization, &lt;strong&gt;Evertec&lt;/strong&gt; plays a relevant role in the continuous development of PCI security standards, as it brings together a global network of almost 800 companies in more than 60 countries and collaborates in the assurance of standards that are implemented globally to secure payment data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In addition, by being a member, &lt;strong&gt;Evertec&lt;/strong&gt; can participate in the annual PCI meetings, which benefits its customers in the implementation of early knowledge and adaptation of the new standards that arise in the Council. In this way, &lt;strong&gt;Evertec&lt;/strong&gt; plays a key role, facing its customers, increasing data security, and staying at the forefront of payments processing technology.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt> Evertec&#xAE;, como compa&#xF1;&#xED;a l&#xED;der en tecnolog&#xED;a y transacciones electr&#xF3;nicas y de procesamiento de pagos en Am&#xE9;rica Latina, est&#xE1; plenamente comprometido con el cumplimiento de normativas y est&#xE1;ndares de la industria financiera y sigue reafirmando su compromiso al ser una organizaci&#xF3;n participante del Consejo de PCI desde el 2019.</post_excerpt><post_date>2020-05-26 23:55:37</post_date><post_name>evertec-is-a-participating-organization-of-the-pci-council</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/banner-Evertec-es-Organizacion-participante-del-Consejo-de-PCI-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec is a participating organization of the PCI Council</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec expands its presence in Brazil in partnership with Alelo</post_title><ID>27584</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;SAN JUAN, PUERTO RICO&#x2013; Evertec, Inc., leader in payment transactions processing services in Latin America and specialized in monitoring and fraud management, announced today its agreement with &lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://www.alelo.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Alelo&lt;/a&gt;, a brand specialized in benefits, incentives, and corporate expenditure management, which acts as a member Business and businesses, offering a better experience to cardholders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2003, &lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://www.alelo.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Alelo&lt;/a&gt; has more than fifteen years of experience in the market, and since 2013, it has been a leader in the benefit sector through &lt;strong&gt;the Workers&#x2019; Food Program&lt;/strong&gt; (PAT) of the Ministry of Labor (MPT). It has more than 130,000 customer-centric companies, 8 million users, and more than 600 thousand affiliated businesses in Brazil.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mac Schuessler, president and CEO of Evertec, indicated&lt;/strong&gt;: &#x201C;We are pleased with the trust placed by &lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://www.alelo.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Alelo&lt;/a&gt; in Evertec. This agreement is significant due to the important role that &lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://www.alelo.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Alelo&lt;/a&gt; has in the Brazilian market. In 2018, &lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://www.alelo.com.br/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Alelo&lt;/a&gt; processed over 600 million transactions only in its workers&#x2019; program. This is a great testimony of the continuous adoption of our technology throughout Latin America.&#x201D;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adriano Tchen, Alelo&#x2019;s CIO, stressed that &#x201C;Choosing Evertec as a technological partner is the result of a profound analysis of the market, as well as the trust the company has earned during its time in Brazil. Evertec offers us a flexible and modular solution that will allow us to streamline the response times to our customers and, therefore, provide them with a better service.&#x201C;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2020-05-26 04:14:32</post_date><post_name>evertec-expands-its-presence-in-brazil-in-partnership-with-alelo</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/banner-Evertec-expande-su-presencia-en-Brasil-en-alianza-con-Alelo-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>closed</comment_status><ping_status>closed</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count>4</ekit_post_views_count><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec expands its presence in Brazil in partnership with Alelo</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec strengthens its relationship with Colombia&#x2019;s tourism sector</post_title><ID>27606</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More options for digital payments for regional tourism.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Recently, tourism entrepreneurs from the &lt;strong&gt;Medell&#xED;n Chamber of Commerce&lt;/strong&gt; joined us to highlight the importance of offering digital payments solutions to serve international audiences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thanks to &lt;strong&gt;Evertec&lt;/strong&gt; and its &lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;PlacetoPay&lt;/a&gt; digital payments solution, tourism businessmen will now be able to offer their clients multiple options with different payment methods to tourists visiting Colombia from all over the world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Some of the services that can be implemented in any business are the following:&lt;/p&gt;		
