					&lt;/a&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Contar con informaci&#xF3;n precisa, siempre disponible, te ayuda a tomar decisiones para tu negocio. Por eso, te invitamos a utilizar nuestro dashboard.</post_excerpt><post_date>2020-07-31 23:26:36</post_date><post_name>get-to-know-the-dashboard-functionalities</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/articulo-conoce-las-funcionalidades-de-dashboard-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Get to Know the Dashboard Functionalities</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>How to Handle Your Business&#x2019;s Intelligence and Data</post_title><ID>28001</ID><post_content>&lt;h4&gt;What does Dashboard provide?&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Graphs with statistics on the behavior of payment channels&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Universal search engine to facilitate data search&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;POS transaction reports available for the preceding 365 days&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Account statements for the preceding 18 months&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;POS receipts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Transaction POS for the preceding 12 months&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;E-commerce transactions for th