Pilar Bazterrica</post_title><ID>28576</ID><post_content>&lt;strong&gt;At Evertec, we are committed to diversity, gender equality and the development of women. These are key features of our success that distinguish us and fill us with pride.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Meet one of our leaders:&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;b&gt;PILAR BAZTERRICA &lt;/b&gt;is the Senior Vicepresident of Corporate Development at Evertec.&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
She has more than 25 years of experience in the finance field. Before joining Evertec in 2016, she worked 16 years at Equifax Inc. in Brazil, Peru, Atlanta and Spain, where she held positions such as International CFO for Latin America, Europe &amp;amp; Canada, Vice President of New Business Development, CFO of Brazil, and Director of Accounting and Consolidation, among others.&#xD;
&#xD;
She has an International MBA from Facultdade Gertulio Vargas (Top 10 of Latin America) and completed a bachelor's degree in Administration.&lt;span class="Apple-converted-space"&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;em&gt;We are proud to have women like Pilar, at Evertec, women who demonstrate and ensure that our ongoing commitment to diversity and inclusion are integrated into our business practices and decisions. This commitment has led us to be recognized and included, for the third time in a row, in &lt;a href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/evertec-named-to-bloombergs-gender-equality-index-for-third-consecutive-year/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bloomberg&#x2019;s Gender Equality Index&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. At Evertec, we believe that diversity in our workforce is our formula for successful innovation.&lt;/em&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>At Evertec, we are committed to diversity, gender equality and the development of women. These are key features of our success that distinguish us and fill us with pride.</post_excerpt><post_date>2021-06-18 10:29:13</post_date><post_name>meet-one-of-our-leaders-pilar-bazterrica</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/06/EN-Mujeres-lideres-Pilar-Bazterrica-Portada.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>External</post_category><post_tag>Evertec,Leaders,l&#xED;deres</post_tag><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Meet one of our leaders: Pilar Bazterrica</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Conoce a nuestras l&#xED;deres: Karla Cruz Jusino</post_title><ID>28718</ID><post_content>&lt;b&gt;En Evertec, estamos comprometidos con la diversidad, equidad de g&#xE9;nero y desarrollo de las mujeres. Son rasgos claves de nuestro &#xE9;xito que nos distingue y llena de orgullo. Conoce a una de nuestras l&#xED;deres.&lt;/b&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Conoce a una de nuestras l&#xED;deres:&#xD;
&lt;p class="xmsonormal"&gt;&lt;span lang="ES-PR"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Karla M. Cruz Jusino&lt;/strong&gt; es Directora (vicepresidenta) de Finanzas de Evertec para Puerto Rico, el Caribe y Am&#xE9;rica Latina. Tiene m&#xE1;s de 14 a&#xF1;os de experiencia en el campo de contabilidad y finanzas. Antes de unirse a Evertec en el 2019, form&#xF3; parte de la firma de servicios profesionales PwC por m&#xE1;s de 12 a&#xF1;os, alcanzando el rol de Directora dentro de la pr&#xE1;ctica de Auditoria. Durante esa trayectoria se especializ&#xF3; en la industria financiera, sirviendo principalmente clientes de la Banca. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang="ES-PR"&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
&lt;p class="xmsonormal"&gt;&lt;span lang="ES-PR"&gt;Comenz&#xF3; en Evertec manejando temas de planificaci&#xF3;n y an&#xE1;lisis financiero a nivel Corporativo y de las operaciones de Puerto Rico y el Caribe. Posteriormente se sumaron dentro de sus responsabilidades el manejo de las &#xE1;reas de impuestos y planificaci&#xF3;n contributiva y, recientemente, la planificaci&#xF3;n y an&#xE1;lisis financiero para las operaciones de Am&#xE9;rica Latina.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
&lt;p class="xmsonormal"&gt;&lt;span lang="ES-PR"&gt;Posee un bachillerato en Administraci&#xF3;n de Empresas con concentraci&#xF3;n en Contabilidad y Finanzas de la de la Universidad de Puerto Rico, y es Contador P&#xFA;blico Autorizado. El otro rol que ejerce con gran dedicaci&#xF3;n y que le brinda gran satisfacci&#xF3;n es el de Madre de su hijo Alejandro, quien es su compa&#xF1;ero de aventuras hace 10 a&#xF1;os.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
&lt;em&gt;Estamos orgullosos de contar en Evertec con mujeres como Karla, quienes demuestran que nuestro compromiso continuo de asegurar que la diversidad y la inclusi&#xF3;n se integren en nuestras pr&#xE1;cticas y decisiones de negocio. Compromiso que nos ha llevado a ser incluidos y reconocidos, por tercera ocasi&#xF3;n, en el &lt;a href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/evertec-bloomberg-gei-tercer-ano/"&gt;&#xCD;ndice de Igualdad de G&#xE9;nero de Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>En Evertec, estamos comprometidos con la diversidad, equidad de g&#xE9;nero y desarrollo de las mujeres. Son rasgos claves de nuestro &#xE9;xito que nos distingue y llena de orgullo. Conoce a una de nuestras l&#xED;deres.</post_excerpt><post_date>2021-07-01 13:06:49</post_date><post_name>conoce-a-nuestras-lideres-karla-cruz-jusino</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/Mujeres-lideres-Karla-Cruz-Jusino-Portada.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Externos</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Conoce a nuestras l&#xED;deres: Karla Cruz Jusino</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>La digitalizaci&#xF3;n de los  medios de pago, una realidad derivada por la pandemia</post_title><ID>28826</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;La pandemia no solo lleg&#xF3; para reinventar la manera de trabajar, tambi&#xE9;n ejerci&#xF3; un cambio en los h&#xE1;bitos que se ten&#xED;an al realizar actividades diarias, as&#xED; como en el manejo de nuestro dinero.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;La necesidad de cuidarnos y el hecho de tener restringida la salida de nuestro hogar, hizo que muchas personas acostumbradas a hacer sus transacciones monetarias de manera presencial pasaran de ir a hacer la fila a un banco y tener un sello en su comprobante, a utilizar los canales electr&#xF3;nicos que desde tiempo atr&#xE1;s ya se ten&#xED;an disponibles, pero que por desconocimiento y en gran medida por falta de confianza, no eran utilizados.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;El &lt;strong&gt;COVID-19&lt;/strong&gt; ayud&#xF3; a potenciar una serie de transformaciones digitales en la gran mayor&#xED;a de personas, las cuales tuvieron que adaptarse a realizar sus compras, pagos y pedidos de manera digital. Por su parte, las empresas tuvieron que adecuar su funcionamiento, integrando una opci&#xF3;n digital para los consumidores, acelerando de esta manera la transformaci&#xF3;n hacia la digitalizaci&#xF3;n, con el prop&#xF3;sito de asegurar su permanencia y dar cumplimiento a las disposiciones impuestas por los gobiernos sobre salud p&#xFA;blica para la prevenci&#xF3;n del contagio del coronavirus.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Parte esencial de esta transformaci&#xF3;n, era entender la necesidad de habilitar otras opciones de pago para compras, que no involucraran la presencia del consumidor o el contacto directo. Si bien implementar o &lt;a href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/nuestra-plataforma-de-pagos-llega-a-mas-paises-para-fortalecer-el-comercio-electronico/"&gt;fortalecer el comercio electr&#xF3;nico&lt;/a&gt; fue un paso elemental de la mayor&#xED;a de las compa&#xF1;&#xED;as, tambi&#xE9;n exist&#xED;an tr&#xE1;mites y procesos que deb&#xED;an hacerse de forma f&#xED;sica y necesitar&#xED;an una opci&#xF3;n. Esto trajo consigo la promoci&#xF3;n de los pagos sin contacto mediante el uso de tarjetas de cr&#xE9;dito y d&#xE9;bito que contaran con esta tecnolog&#xED;a, como la mayor&#xED;a de las existentes en el mercado ya lo hacen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;La pandemia llev&#xF3; a un nicho importante de personas en el caso de Colombia, que a pesar de estar bancarizadas no utilizaban medios digitales para movilizar su dinero, y logr&#xF3; llevarlas a realizar el pago de sus compras a trav&#xE9;s de &lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/pasarela-de-pagos-e-commerce/"&gt;pasarelas de pago&lt;/a&gt;, utilizar el sistema de pagos electr&#xF3;nicos Pagos Seguros en L&#xED;nea (PSE), y realizar transferencias de dinero a trav&#xE9;s del sistema autom&#xE1;tico de trasferencias de fondo, Automated Clearing House, red ACH.&lt;/p&gt;		
												&lt;img width="700" height="280" src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/digitalizacion-de-los-medios-de-pago-evertec-2.png" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/digitalizacion-de-los-medios-de-pago-evertec-2.png 700w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/digitalizacion-de-los-medios-de-pago-evertec-2-300x120.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /&gt;														
		&lt;p&gt;As&#xED; lo confirma el estudio de Visa Latam, que mostr&#xF3; datos relevantes en temas de comercio electr&#xF3;nico en la pandemia como:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Un incremento del 56% de aumento en las compras en l&#xED;nea.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Una de cada tres personas mayores de 15 a&#xF1;os hizo una compra en l&#xED;nea en medio del brote pand&#xE9;mico.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;10,8 millones de consumidores hicieron su primera compra digital en 2020.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Los m&#xE9;todos de pago con mayor preferencia para consumidores latinoamericanos durante la pandemia fueron los pagos con Tarjeta D&#xE9;bito (pagos desde cuentas de ahorros) y Tarjeta de Cr&#xE9;dito.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Este estudio tambi&#xE9;n mostr&#xF3; la migraci&#xF3;n de consumidores al m&#xF3;vil, donde se realizaron m&#xE1;s de 6 mil millones de ventas a trav&#xE9;s de &#xE9;ste durante el 2020, esperando duplicar esta cifra para el 2025.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;El &lt;strong&gt;Covid19&lt;/strong&gt; no solo cambi&#xF3; nuestra perspectiva de vida, nos llev&#xF3; a una nueva realidad, forz&#xE1;ndonos a incluir la tecnolog&#xED;a en nuestros pagos. Ejemplo de ello, ha sido la adopci&#xF3;n de billeteras digitales, que permiten tener de forma virtual y en un solo lugar nuestros medios de pago, realizar compras y retiros a trav&#xE9;s de tokens, disminuyendo el contacto y con ello cumplir los protocolos de bioseguridad evitando un posible contagio.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;En &lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evertec&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/a&gt;no hemos estado ajenos a esta situaci&#xF3;n. Contamos no s&#xF3;lo con el conocimiento y la tecnolog&#xED;a necesaria para el desarrollo de soluciones conjuntas con nuestros clientes, sino tambi&#xE9;n priorizamos la seguridad transaccional para generar esa confianza que necesitan las personas al momento de administrar y hacer uso de su dinero.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Contamos no s&#xF3;lo con el conocimiento y la tecnolog&#xED;a necesaria para el desarrollo de soluciones conjuntas con nuestros clientes, sino tambi&#xE9;n priorizamos la seguridad transaccional para generar confianza en las personas.</post_excerpt><post_date>2021-07-06 17:39:05</post_date><post_name>la-digitalizacion-de-los-medios-de-pago-una-realidad-derivada-por-la-pandemia</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/Linkedin-Adriana-Rojas.png</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Art&#xED;culos</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>La digitalizaci&#xF3;n de los  medios de pago, una realidad derivada por la pandemia</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Success Story: Cencosud Project</post_title><ID>28970</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sharing an ideal and a joint effort to reach the most vulnerable population, administering benefit bonuses redeemed for goods and services at the multibrand and multiformat retailer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Cencosud&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;A Chilean company with regional presence and diversified businesses in the retail sector, including supermarkets, department stores, shopping centers, financial retail, and home improvement, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;A regional market leader&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Multibrand and multiformat retailer with locations throughout Latin America&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;In the top 5 supermarkets with the largest share in Colombia&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="https://www.cencosud.com/"&gt;Cencosud&#xA0;&lt;/a&gt;is a Chilean business consortium that is one of the largest and most prestigious retail conglomerates in Latin America. The company operates in several South American countries such as Argentina, Brazil, Chile, Per&#xFA;, and Colombia. Cencosud's objective is to become the largest retailer in Latin America and provide the highest quality of service to all of its clients. Its mission is to be the most profitable retailer in the region.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Company's objective is to do business in general, including the purchase, sale, consignment, distribution, importing, exporting, representation, commissioning, packaging, bulk-breaking, and commercialization on one's account or on behalf of someone else of all manner of movable tangible assets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since 2019, the company has been working to reinforce its omnichannel strategy based on the understanding that the way to establish relationships is always evolving. Thus, the company is working hard to be at the fore in that change and ensure that it delivers the best sales and services experience to its customers every single time, whether through its physical or virtual stores.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Business Units&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;		
									&lt;figure&gt;
										&lt;img width="58" height="58" src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/03/IMG-cencosudMesa-de-trabajo-5.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;											&lt;figcaption&gt;Costanera Center&lt;/figcaption&gt;
										&lt;/figure&gt;
									&lt;figure&gt;
										&lt;img width="59" height="58" src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/03/IMG-cencosudMesa-de-trabajo-6.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;											&lt;figcaption&gt;Department Stores&lt;/figcaption&gt;
										&lt;/figure&gt;
									&lt;figure&gt;
										&lt;img width="59" height="58" src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/03/IMG-cencosudMesa-de-trabajo-7.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;											&lt;figcaption&gt;Supermarkets&lt;/figcaption&gt;
										&lt;/figure&gt;
									&lt;figure&gt;
										&lt;img width="59" height="58" src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/03/IMG-cencosudMesa-de-trabajo-8.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;											&lt;figcaption&gt;Home Improvement and Construction&lt;/figcaption&gt;
										&lt;/figure&gt;
									&lt;figure&gt;
										&lt;img width="59" height="58" src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/03/IMG-cencosudMesa-de-trabajo-9.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;											&lt;figcaption&gt;Financial Retail&lt;/figcaption&gt;
										&lt;/figure&gt;
									&lt;figure&gt;
										&lt;img width="59" height="58" src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/03/IMG-cencosudMesa-de-trabajo-10.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;											&lt;figcaption&gt;Shopping Center&lt;/figcaption&gt;
										&lt;/figure&gt;
		&lt;h4&gt;The challenge&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;In its constant search for partners to facilitate the gathering of aid or benefits for the public, the Secretar&#xED;a Distrital de Integraci&#xF3;n Social ("District Secretariat of Social Integration")&#x2014;an entity of the Capital District of Bogot&#xE1; that oversees and designs social policies to address the social integration of people, families, and communities (especially those who are in conditions of dire poverty and vulnerability)&#x2014;established a relationship with Cencosud, one of the largest and most prestigious retail conglomerates in Latin America. Facing this challenge, Cencosud endeavored to find a reliable technology ally to help guarantee a timely purchase experience without increasing its own workload and that of its customers as well as transaction security through an agile and secure redemption mechanism.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;An agile and leading technology provider&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;The need was a given, and Evertec&lt;sup&gt;&#xAE;&lt;/sup&gt;, taking advantage of its infrastructure, comes in as a technology provider to serve as the bridge in transactions, facilitate purchase experiences through electronic means, and make operational processes more efficient. Thanks to a joint effort and after a few months of project evaluations, Evertec made available to Cencosud Colombia a transaction web portal that permits validation and execution of the information provided by the customer for adequate operation of its program, which consists of benefit bonuses that can be exchanged for goods or services at the Retailer. A fluid communication and collaboration with Evertec enabled the solution to be updated according to market behavior as well as with the customer's reality, as it was conceived for and aligned with the project's objective from the start: "to provide effective and secure service and support to those persons who are most vulnerable."&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The result&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Confidence in the redemption mechanism. It consolidated the model as one of the most successful, reliable, and accountable models upon the execution of the project that Cencosud commissioned to Evertec. The solution migrated to other projects, representing a notable sales increase for the retail sector. By keeping the business model in sync with customer needs and demands, a commercial relationship of more than a decade is still going strong.&lt;/p&gt;		
									&lt;figure&gt;
										&lt;img width="109" height="112" src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/03/IMG-cencosudMesa-de-trabajo-11.png" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;											&lt;figcaption&gt;H&#xE9;ctor Dar&#xED;o Cifuentes&lt;br/&gt;Special Sales Director / Business Sales at Cencosud&lt;/figcaption&gt;
										&lt;/figure&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;"Our experience with Evertec has been more than satisfactory. It has addressed our customers&#x2019; new needs in a timely fashion, always adapting to new market demands, correcting, and looking to improve its processes continuously. This has enabled the strengthening, consolidation, and transformation of the model into a traditional payment method both within Cencosud as well as externally, as used by the customers we serve. The implementation of automatic correction mechanisms that came about from Evertec&#x2019;s initiative has mitigated many errors that commonly arise in similar transactions, to the point where there are practically no flaws in the system. We go through every transaction with confidence and peace of mind because we know that we have a solid product that is hard to match."&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2021-04-05 10:07:06</post_date><post_name>success-story-cencosud-project</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/IMG-cencosudMesa-de-trabajo-2.png</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Success Story: Cencosud Project</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>2020 did not Stop Our Eagerness to Help</post_title><ID>28990</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;2020 was full of immense challenges for everyone. It was an unusual year, and it became difficult not to think about how the pandemic would impact our families, business employees, and communities where we operate. The situation also gave us the opportunity to find out how prepared businesses are to manage events like these and make possible what for many seemed impossible, which is exactly what we set out to do at Evertec. We put into practice our Business Continuity and Pandemic Management Plans to continue our operations, always focused on ensuring both the health and safety of our employees as well as the service we provide to our customers. In addition, we were also able to fulfill our commitment to social responsibility, aware that helping those in need became society's priority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And that's how we dealt with the consequences of the pandemic: we made the most of its positive aspects for our business. There was more collaboration between our employees, the relationship with our customers became stronger, and the advantages offered by our digital payment service and business solutions came to the forefront. &lt;b&gt;Moreover, we were able to keep our Social Responsibility Program in practice and demonstrate our employees&#x2019; and Evertec&#x2019;s interest and genuine commitment with our communities.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;IT WAS NOT IMPOSSIBLE...&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&#x2026; Supporting Education&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sixth Edition of the Scholarship Program: Per our interest in serving as an engine to drive education by helping to create a more diverse labor force, we held the sixth edition of our Scholarship Program and granted a total of 161 scholarships to university students in Puerto Rico and Latin America for a total investment of $185,000. Science and engineering were the most popular areas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Moreover, in 2020 and in the interest of increasing the number of women in STEM, &lt;strong&gt;we made an alliance with leading women in technology and science and increased applications from women to participate in the Scholarship Program by 50%, resulting in greater diversity and inclusion among awardees in the program on the account of the rate of male to female applications matching 1:1 compared to 3:1 in prior years.&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;...Protecting the Environment Through the Revoluci&#xF3;n Naranja Initatives&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evertec Costa Rica once again obtained its Esencial Costa Rica certification&lt;/strong&gt;: a distinction which guarantees that our operations comply with the competitive standards of the Costa Rica nation branding.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Earth Hour&lt;/strong&gt;: global initiative held on March 28 in which we joined and participated with 193 employees and their family members who reside in Costa Rica, Puerto Rico, Panam&#xE1;, Chile, Uruguay, Colombia, and the Dominican Republic. As proof of our commitment to the environment, we received the appreciation of the Earth Hour Global Team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&#x201C;Yo Protejo al Ambiente&#x201D;&lt;/strong&gt;: a competition of short stories through which we promoted the importance of protecting the environment. Children between the ages of 5 and 12 were able to express not only their ideas on the matter but also integrate technology in some way as part of the narrative of protecting the environment. We received short stories from seven countries where we do business, and the subject that generated the most interest among children was environmental pollution. Through a regional alliance, the Evaluation Committee was composed of persons of letters, writers, professors, artists, and one member of our legal team. The winning short story was "Animales Salvadores.&#x201D;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;... Looking After Our Communities&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;"Unidos a distancia" volunteer program&lt;/strong&gt;: Aware of the barriers and restrictions of COVID-19 social distancing, we rethought how we would do our community service and ensure that volunteer work could be done remotely and safely for all. In this way, our annual Volunteer Day turned into the "Unidos a distancia" Volunteer Week, a strategy that allowed us to contribute the best of us: our intellectual capital and the ability to highlight technology through various initiatives held in support of non-profit organizations. The strategy included five support areas: community, technology, education, pets, and the environment. But being able to once again confirm the genuine interest of our employees in helping those in need was more important. Through their actions they showed us that even with the pandemic, they could unite remotely and proclaim their great commitment to the community's wellbeing. We are very proud of this.&lt;/p&gt;		
												&lt;img width="800" height="437" src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/03/Evtc-Voluntariado-2020-cifras-ingles-1024x559.png" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/03/Evtc-Voluntariado-2020-cifras-ingles-1024x559.png 1024w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/03/Evtc-Voluntariado-2020-cifras-ingles-300x164.png 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/03/Evtc-Voluntariado-2020-cifras-ingles-768x419.png 768w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/03/Evtc-Voluntariado-2020-cifras-ingles.png 1100w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /&gt;														
		&lt;h4&gt;... Facilitating Our ATH M&#xF3;vil Technology as a Catalyst for the Development of the Third Sector&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supporting the #GivingTuesday initiative&lt;/strong&gt;: for the second year in a row, we joined the Alliance for the Development of the Puerto Rican Third Sector ("Alianza para el Desarrollo del Tercer Sector") as representatives of the #GivingTuesdayPR initiative. As part of the initiative, we did a promotional campaign to bring awareness to the public of the important role non-profit organizations have and why they should be supported with donations. For that, we promoted donations be made through ATH M&#xF3;vil (the service we offer for electronic transfers from person to person) due to it being the preferred method of payment of the movement in Puerto Rico. Moreover, we held a round table with the press and several representatives of important non-profit organizations such as Roberto Soto Acosta, president of the Alliance for the Development of the Puerto Rican Third Sector and global representative of #GivingTuesday Puerto Rico, Ana Mar&#xED;a L&#xF3;pez, vice president of development at Foundation for Puerto Rico, and Gilberto Qui&#xF1;ones, associate director at MDA in Puerto Rico. They shared their life experiences and the positive impact that ATH M&#xF3;vil has had in their organizations, becoming not only a reliable tool to receive donations but also as a service that has transformed the way funds can be raised for NGOs in Puerto Rico.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Results&lt;/strong&gt;: funds raised through ATH M&#xF3;vil $395,916.91 vs. $116,803.75 in 2019, triple the amount donated and a 239% increase compared to last year.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It is worth noting that Evertec also donated $50,000 to match the donations of the 45 non-profit organizations that were able to raise the first $1,000 on December 1, when the #GivingTuesdayPR is held globally. The remaining $5,000 were donated to the Alliance for the Development of the Puerto Rican Third Sector in its efforts of promoting the work of non-profit organizations in Puerto Rico.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;... Making Corporate Contributions&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;In 2020, our corporate contributions exceeded $730,000 in sponsorships and donations to non-profit organizations whose mission is to support the development of communities, children, the environment, and the arts throughout the several different countries where we operate.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Through all these initiatives, we continue to show our commitment to the wellbeing of the communities where we do business. &lt;b&gt;Together with our employees, we will continue onward at a steady pace and leave a deep impression on the communities of the different countries where we are located.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>El 2020 fue un a&#xF1;o de grandes retos para todos. Fue un a&#xF1;o inusual donde result&#xF3; dif&#xED;cil no pensar en el impacto que la pandemia causaba en nuestras familias, empleados, en las industrias y las comunidades donde tenemos nuestras operaciones.</post_excerpt><post_date>2021-03-03 18:07:31</post_date><post_name>2020-did-not-stop-our-eagernes-to-help</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/BannerHaciendoPosible-2.png</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag>#GivingTuesday,ATH,ATH M&#xF3;vil,Costa Rica,Earth hour,Evertec,Giving Tuesday,Programa de Becas,Puerto Rico,Responsabilidad social,Unidos a distancia,Yo Protejo al Ambiente</post_tag><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after>0</hefo_after><hefo_before>0</hefo_before><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>2020 did not Stop Our Eagerness to Help</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Interfaz V/S parche Servicio al Cliente como ventaja competitiva</post_title><ID>29064</ID><post_content>mantener a un cliente contento velando por entregar un servicio de calidad, no se determina por el lugar en el que se trabaja, si no en el c&#xF3;mo se trabaja.
&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&#x2013; por Juan Pedro Arcil
   Country Manager Evertec Chile					
						&lt;img src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/juan-pedro-arcil-servicio-cliente-evertec.png" alt=""&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;Con un mercado altamente competitivo y una industria en constante cambio, contar con equipos dedicados al servicio al cliente, capaces de brindar soporte, ayuda y acompa&#xF1;amiento en sus diversas necesidades, se ha vuelto una de las ventajas competitivas m&#xE1;s importantes y tambi&#xE9;n en uno de los principales desaf&#xED;os que marcan el crecimiento de una compa&#xF1;&#xED;a en el mercado.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Por su parte,&lt;strong&gt; entregar un servicio de valor agregado se ha convertido en uno de los pilares de las &#xE1;reas de servicios&lt;/strong&gt;. Acompa&#xF1;ar, guiar, satisfacer y comprender, se vuelven elementos claves a la hora de formar un &#xE1;rea esencial para la compa&#xF1;&#xED;a, que muchas veces recoge las primeras impresiones de un cliente, ya sean positivas o negativas, reaccionando de manera oportuna, de tal forma que cualquier conflicto sea resuelto de la mejor manera posible, por lo que la confianza se vuelve el punto central del &#xE9;xito.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Toda idea nace de un problema&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Un mal resultado en una encuesta de satisfacci&#xF3;n, la desconexi&#xF3;n de &#xE1;reas similares que deben trabajar conjuntamente para lograr sus objetivos, o simplemente la falta de comunicaci&#xF3;n, pueden detonar altas frustraciones en los colaboradores que repercuten en su actuar cotidiano con los clientes, generando conflictos que, a la larga, si no son atendidos en el momento oportuno, pueden terminar con la relaci&#xF3;n cliente - empresa.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sin embargo, cuando se tiene un problema y se gestiona oportunamente, se puede convertir en una importante oportunidad de mejora. Tal es el caso del nacimiento del &#xE1;rea de servicio al cliente que me toc&#xF3; liderar a&#xF1;os atr&#xE1;s, la cual en una primera instancia naci&#xF3; como interlocutor entre cliente &#x2013; empresa, velando por la resoluci&#xF3;n de conflictos concretos. En su momento, el conflicto detect&#xF3; diversas oportunidades de mejora en el servicio que se le brindaba a los clientes y permiti&#xF3; concretar nuevos negocios, no obstante, los cambios de la industria han evidenciado la importancia de incorporar, m&#xE1;s all&#xE1; de los conocimientos t&#xE9;cnicos de un producto, habilidades emocionales, tales como la confianza, empat&#xED;a y comunicaci&#xF3;n asertiva; ampliando as&#xED; el perfil de los colaboradores y futuros recursos que se dediquen a ejercer tan importante labor al interior de la empresa, entregando soluciones integrales a trav&#xE9;s de una interfaz colaborativa de &#xE1;reas y no solo soluciones parches moment&#xE1;neas que no servir&#xE1;n para entregar mejoras sustanciales en el tiempo.&lt;/p&gt;		
												&lt;img width="307" height="154" src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/Trasnparencia-compromiso-respaldo.png" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/Trasnparencia-compromiso-respaldo.png 307w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/Trasnparencia-compromiso-respaldo-300x150.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 307px) 100vw, 307px" /&gt;														
		&lt;p&gt;Esclarecer estos conceptos es clave en el &#xE9;xito de un &#xE1;rea que est&#xE1; sometida a constantes cambios, vista de la siguiente manera:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tal como se muestra en el diagrama, la confianza y la empat&#xED;a son la base que sostiene y da vida a tres de las caracter&#xED;sticas cotidianas m&#xE1;s importantes para el &#xE9;xito del &#xE1;rea: &lt;strong&gt;Transparencia, Compromiso y Respaldo&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;		
		&lt;p&gt;Construir, fortalecer y mantener la confianza, abrir&#xE1; nuevos caminos en la relaci&#xF3;n cliente - empresa, los cuales son posibles gracias a la transparencia con la que interact&#xFA;an ambas partes. El compromiso que emane desde la empresa hacia el cliente y por, sobre todo, el respaldo que el &#xE1;rea pueda brindarle, son tan esenciales como el respaldo que la empresa le confiere al &#xE1;rea de servicio al cliente, para que pueda tomar decisiones y actuar de manera proactiva y oportuna ante las necesidades de los clientes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Por otro lado, la empat&#xED;a, vista desde la emocionalidad que entrega a la relaci&#xF3;n cliente - empresa, le permite al &#xE1;rea tener en consideraci&#xF3;n las necesidades del cliente y ver una soluci&#xF3;n antes de un &#x201C;no&#x201D; como respuesta. Practicar la empat&#xED;a con la intenci&#xF3;n de comprender los sentimientos y emociones de los clientes, intentando experimentar de forma objetiva y racional lo que est&#xE1;n sintiendo, crear&#xE1; una mayor conexi&#xF3;n entre el cliente y la empresa y comprometer&#xE1; a los equipos de trabajo a velar por una &#xF3;ptima soluci&#xF3;n, entregando un servicio que brinde apoyo, seguimiento y confianza libre de juicios que afecten la relaci&#xF3;n a largo plazo.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;El reto del &#xE1;rea en tiempos de pandemia&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hoy, la resiliencia es clave para alinear un buen servicio desde adentro hacia afuera.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Asimismo, el compromiso y respaldo que entregue la empresa al &#xE1;rea conlleva a la r&#xE1;pida acci&#xF3;n y resoluci&#xF3;n de los conflictos diarios. Actuar como una red de cuidados que se preocupa por suplir las necesidades de un cliente de forma alineada, demuestra que, a pesar de la distancia en la que hoy estamos inmersos debido a la pandemia por COVID-19, &lt;strong&gt;la importancia de dejar y mantener a un cliente contento velando por entregar un servicio de calidad, no se determina por el lugar en el que se trabaja, si no en el c&#xF3;mo se trabaja&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;De igual manera, mantener la cercan&#xED;a a pesar de la distancia en la cual estamos inmersos, ha sido el gran desaf&#xED;o que nos ha dejado el 2020. Un &#xE1;rea que necesita mucho de la proximidad ha logrado dar la milla extra y sobreponerse al cambio de modalidad, el cual pareciera ha llegado para quedarse.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2021-07-14 15:34:44</post_date><post_name>interfaz-v-s-parche-servicio-al-cliente-como-ventaja-competitiva</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/servicio-al-cliente-como-ventaja-competitiva.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Art&#xED;culos</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Interfaz V/S parche Servicio al Cliente como ventaja competitiva</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Customer Service as a Competitive Advantage</post_title><ID>29094</ID><post_content>customer delight isn&#x2019;t determined by the place where one works but by how one works.
&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&#x2013; por Juan Pedro Arcil
   Country Manager Evertec Chile					
						&lt;img src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/juan-pedro-arcil-servicio-cliente-evertec.png" alt=""&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;With a highly competitive market and an ever-changing industry, having teams that are dedicated to customer service capable of supporting, helping, and addressing customer needs has become one of the most important competitive advantages and one of the main challenges that mark the growth of a company in the market.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Moreover, &lt;strong&gt;offering value-added solutions has become one of the pillars of the service industry&lt;/strong&gt;. Understanding and guiding are key elements when developing the customer service area, an essential area for any business. It is the customer service team which many times is the first line of defense provoking the customer's first impressions, whether positive or negative, providing a timely response and ensuring that any request or conflict is resolved in the best possible way. Proving that trust in your team is essential to success.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Ideas Arise from Solving a Problem&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;A bad score in a satisfaction survey, a disconnect between areas that should work together to achieve their joint objectives, or a simple lack of communication can trigger much frustration among collaborators, which, in turn, can have negative repercussions in how they perform their daily tasks and cause conflict. In the long run, if these internal issues are not addressed, they can negatively affect the customer-company relationship.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;However, when a problem arises and it is dealt with in a timely manner, it can become an important opportunity for improvement. Such is the case of the customer service area I led years ago. At first, it came about as a conversation between the client and the company looking to resolve concrete conflicts. At that time, these conflicts revealed several opportunities for improvement in our customer service area and enabled the creation of new businesses. However, changes in the industry have proven the importance of incorporating soft skills emotional attributes such as trust, empathy, and assertive communication within a team beyond the technical knowledge of a service or product. The scope of these customer service collaborators was expanded to include such an important task as is delivering comprehensive solutions through a collaborative interface of areas and not merely momentary patches that would deliver only immediate fixes and not long-lasting overall improvements in the business.&lt;/p&gt;		
												&lt;img width="307" height="154" src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/customer-service-as-a-competitive-advantage.png" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/customer-service-as-a-competitive-advantage.png 307w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/customer-service-as-a-competitive-advantage-300x150.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 307px) 100vw, 307px" /&gt;														
		&lt;p&gt;Understanding the concepts in the graph below is key to succeeding in an area that is subject to constant changes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As shown in the diagram, trust and empathy are the foundation that hold and gives life to three of the daily attributes that are most important to the area's success:&lt;strong&gt; Transparency, Commitment, and Support&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;		
		&lt;p&gt;Building, strengthening, and maintaining trust will open new paths in the customer-business relationship that are possible thanks to the transparency of the interactions among them. The commitment that the company has to the customer and, above everything else, the support the company gives to the customer service area so that it can make decisions and act in a proactive and timely manner to address the customer needs are fundamental for success.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On the other hand, empathy within the context of the business-client relationship, allows the service area to consider the customer's needs and look for a solution before offering "no" as an answer. Practicing empathy with the intention of understanding the feelings and emotions of the customer to experience objectively and rationally what they are feeling creates a greater connection between the joint work teams which will leads to collaboration to find an optimal solution offering support and trust, free from judgment that could negatively affect the relationship in the long run.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;The Challenge of the Area During a Pandemic&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;The commitment and support provided by the company to the customer service area is essential since it leads to prompt action and quick resolution of daily conflicts. Acting as a customer care network that concerns itself with addressing customer needs shows that, despite the distance we are keeping due to the pandemic, customer delight isn't &lt;strong&gt;determined by the place where one works but by how one works&lt;/strong&gt;. Giving importance to high quality service is what makes and keeps a customer happy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Likewise, the main challenge for 2020 and 2021 has been maintaining a close relationship despite the physical distance. An area that usually needs a high degree of proximity has managed to go the extra mile and overcome the shift in work modality which seems to be here to stay.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2021-07-14 15:34:44</post_date><post_name>customer-service-as-a-competitive-advantage</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/servicio-al-cliente-como-ventaja-competitiva.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Customer Service as a Competitive Advantage</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>A Look Towards the Possibilities of Mobile Technology</post_title><ID>29115</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;If we really think about how our lives have changed or about our daily routines since the emergence of new technologies, the above phrase does not seem like an exaggeration. Without going too much into it, nowadays many transactions, purchases, consultations, and requests do not require that we move from one place to another. Having a device connected to the internet with access to multiple services that can be activated with just a tap on a smartphone screen is enough.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;These technological advances have not only affected consumers but have also changed the way many companies do business. To innovate, companies require that their clients have a mobile phone application that familiarizes them with the business, that makes them feel better and more closely serviced while facilitating their transactions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We at &lt;strong&gt;Evertec&lt;/strong&gt; as well as our customers have seen this need to develop products and services using mobile technologies to facilitate day-to-day interactions with customers. In 2018, relying on collaboration and a highly trained team with lots of ideas, our &lt;strong&gt;Evertec Bogot&#xE1;&lt;/strong&gt; office began to work on an application for Android and iOS mobile devices that will benefit users of private multi-segment cards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;After much analysis, setup of functionalities, and design, we developed an application that includes transactions that customers previously executed through other channels that took more time, such as calling a telephone number.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The functional basis of this application is divided into modules in which transactions can be performed as part of users' day-to-day, such as balance inquiry for each section, verifying transactions, making transfers between accounts, and generating tokens for withdrawals and purchases, among others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If we once saw it as just a possibility, as of August 2019 and with Evertec's collaboration, it is now a reality. This application is operable with Android and iOS devices and already has more than 9,000 downloads. The application has been very well received by our customer&#x2019;s users and reaffirms the idea that, when technology companies, business partners, and final users work together, the impossible is possible.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Author: Mar&#xED;a Camila Sierra, IT Project Coordinator, Evertec Colombia.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>La frase &#x201C;el mundo al alcance de la mano&#x201D; puede muchas veces sonar trillada o exagerada.</post_excerpt><post_date>2020-06-08 23:36:01</post_date><post_name>possibilities-mobile-technology</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/banner-Una-mirada-hacia-las-posibilidades-de-la-tecnologia-movil-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>A Look Towards the Possibilities of Mobile Technology</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Business Agility: Responding to the Complexities of Surroundings</post_title><ID>29121</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;Once we are immersed in particular surroundings, we can address certain situations and wonder: How much do we know about a determined, concrete situation? To what extent can we anticipate the result of our actions? We can answer this through knowing and predicting our surroundings, and to face these two assumptions, we need to address the situation with agility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;What is agility or business agility?&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;We can say it is a way of solving complex problems, facing changes, anticipating changes in surroundings, and obtaining better results. It can also be understood as the ability to divide a larger problem into smaller problems with short and frequent stages that allow for constant revision and adapting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To understand more about business agility, we need to go back to the beginning and look at the model identified and defined by Ikujiro Nonaka and Hirotaka Takeuchi at the beginning of the 1980's after analyzing the development of new products from the main manufacturing technology companies such Fuji-Xerox, Canon, Honda, Nec, Epson, Brother, 3M, and Hewlett-Packard (Nonaka &amp;amp; Takeuchi, The New Product Development Game, 1986). These companies identified a model that adopted a strategy of incremental development in lieu of complete planning and execution of a product so as to launch in much less time. Then, after several years of trial and error, in 2001, a movement called the "Agile Movement" emerged through which 17 renown professionals in software development met in the state of Utah (USA) and defined the basis of business agility with the purpose of discovering better ways to develop software. From there, what we know today as the Manifesto for Agile Software Development was created. In essence, it is a set of four values and 12 principles that unfolded into a variety of processes, methods, and practices.&lt;/p&gt;		
													&lt;a href="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/08/manifiesto-evertec-en.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-title="agile, visual manifest - evertec"&gt;
							&lt;img width="800" height="544" src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/08/manifiesto-evertec-en.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/08/manifiesto-evertec-en.jpg 1000w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/08/manifiesto-evertec-en-300x204.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/08/manifiesto-evertec-en-768x522.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /&gt;								&lt;/a&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;&#x201C;We are uncovering better ways of developing software by doing it and helping others do it. Through this work we have come to value:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Individuals and interactions over processes and tools.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Working software over comprehensive documentation.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Customer collaboration over contract negotiation.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Responding to change over following a plan.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;That is, while there is value in the items on the right, we value the items on the left more." (Manifesto for Agile Software Development &#x2013; Agile Manifesto, Utah, 2001)&lt;/p&gt;		
		&lt;p&gt;Now then, knowing this model of adding value in short periods of time, an initiative springs forth from the heart of our Evertec Bogot&#xE1; office in which we decide to implement a new focus to address projects that Evertec, as a company, has already been adopting since 2015. This focus requires a different way of considering the alternatives through which value delivery can be incremental and centered on validating surroundings that, at the same time, allow our customers to experience early and continuous delivery of our products.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It was this way we undertook a pilot program, an initiative that had been saved for approximately five years and that is called tum&#xF3;vilpaga ("your mobile pays"). It is the purchasing mobile application for small- and medium-sized businesses in Colombia to receive payment through a token or QR code. This time, we addressed this need differently. The entire team had a particular focus and was guided to work as a team and motivated to develop functional prototypes in very short time intervals of two weeks each.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It took six sprints* to come up with a functional prototype that then went into production. Said prototype was shown in the ASOCAJAS Congress in Cartagena, Colombia, in 2019. Word of our various products got out, especially the Billetera M&#xF3;vil ("Mobile Wallet") and tum&#xF3;vilpaga, which were well received by attendees and users at the event.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;All this led us to reformulate our strategy on how to focus and tackle developments from a traditional or waterfall* methodology to a new focus such as agile methodologies. This new focus, applied to some projects, is based on customer satisfaction, frequent value delivery, sustainable development, highly motivated teams with attention to excelence and principles of continuous improvement. As a result, it helped us maximize the amount of work done, especially with the collaboration of highly self-organized teams. In short, by applying the principles of the agile methodology, we were able to develop these high-impact and greatly beneficial products for customers within a period of time that was considered to be impossible.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Evertec, we constantly train teams, embrace changes, take advantage of such changes as competitive advantages for our organization, take care of our customers by addressing their needs, and innovate constantly by focusing on generating value in short periods of time, all while considering our ever-changing surroundings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Article by: Yeins Balaguera, Agile Technical Coordinator at Evertec Colombia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Glossary:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sprint: predetermined interval during which a usable "Made or Finished" product increment, potentially deliverable, is created.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Waterfall: cascading or linear development model or project development in sequences.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Consulted sources: &lt;a href="https://agilemanifesto.org/iso/es/manifesto.html"&gt;https://agilemanifesto.org/iso/es/manifesto.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Actualmente, nuestro entorno cambia constantemente, al igual que el de las organizaciones, estos se caracterizan por la volatilidad, la incertidumbre, la complejidad. </post_excerpt><post_date>2020-08-05 23:42:51</post_date><post_name>business-agility-responding-to-the-complexities-of-surroundings</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/bannerEl-Agilismo-una-respuesta-a-la-complejidad-del-entorno-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Business Agility: Responding to the Complexities of Surroundings</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec apoya a Grupo &#xC9;xito en lanzamiento de tarjeta &#x201C;Mercado para Colombia&#x201D;</post_title><ID>29172</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mercados a partir de $10.000 COP podr&#xE1;n ser adquiridos y donados a familias necesitadas a trav&#xE9;s del sitio web www.exito.com/tarjeta-mercado.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;El portal digital, desarrollado en tiempo r&#xE9;cord por Evertec, soporta transacciones digitales con los m&#xE1;s altos est&#xE1;ndares de seguridad.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(Medell&#xED;n, Colombia &#x2013; 7 de abril de 2020) &#x2013; &lt;strong&gt;Evertec&lt;sup&gt;&#xAE;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, empresa l&#xED;der en tecnolog&#xED;a con presencia en 26 pa&#xED;ses de Am&#xE9;rica Latina, junto con el &lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="https://www.exito.com/"&gt;Grupo &#xC9;xito&lt;/a&gt; desarroll&#xF3; la plataforma virtual donde se pueden comprar mercados para donar a familias que lo necesiten en medio de la contingencia del COVID-19. &lt;strong&gt;Los interesados pueden regalar la Tarjeta Mercado por Colombia, exclusivamente para productos de mercado, que van desde $10.000 COP hasta $500.000 COP&lt;/strong&gt;. El bono se puede adquirir por medio del portal web y puede ser redimido en &lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="https://www.exito.com/"&gt;almacenes &#xC9;xito&lt;/a&gt;, Carulla, Surtimax, Surtimayorista, y Superinter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bajo la consigna Juntos saldremos adelante, &lt;strong&gt;Evertec&lt;/strong&gt; se une a esta causa para disponibilizar la tecnolog&#xED;a que busca beneficiar a las familias colombianas m&#xE1;s necesitadas. Es as&#xED; como desarrolla una soluci&#xF3;n donde se puede donar, a trav&#xE9;s de canales no presenciales, un mercado utilizando tarjetas d&#xE9;bito o cr&#xE9;dito.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#x201C;&lt;em&gt;Para el Grupo &#xC9;xito es fundamental emprender estos proyectos de apoyo a la comunidad y a&#xFA;n m&#xE1;s en este momento en el que la solidaridad debe ser nuestro mayor valor. De igual manera, por cada $50.000 pesos que sean donados en las tarjetas de mercado, el Grupo &#xC9;xito har&#xE1; un aporte de $5.000 pesos que al acumular $500 millones de pesos, ser&#xE1;n donados a una causa social de car&#xE1;cter nacional&lt;/em&gt;&#x201D; afirm&#xF3; Camilo Reina, vicepresidente de Mercadeo e innovaci&#xF3;n de Grupo &#xC9;xito.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Al respecto, Enrique Candanoza, Gerente General de Evertec en Colombia explic&#xF3;: &#x201C;&lt;em&gt;En tiempo r&#xE9;cord hemos desarrollado este sitio soluci&#xF3;n para el pago por cualquier medio, conect&#xE1;ndolo con nuestra plataforma de Tarjeta Regalo, en tan solo 5 d&#xED;as, cuando normalmente este proceso puede durar hasta 2 meses. Hemos dispuesto todo un equipo t&#xE9;cnico y humano experimentado, utilizando nuestra plataforma PlacetoPay, especializada en transacciones digitales que ofrece realizar operaciones seguras porque est&#xE1; certificada en PCI DSS (Payment Card Industry Data Security Standard), versi&#xF3;n 2.0.&lt;/em&gt;&#x201D;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Los interesados pueden ingresar al sitio web: &lt;a style="color: #f36e21;" href="https://www.exito.com/tarjeta-mercado"&gt;www.exito.com/tarjeta-mercado&lt;/a&gt;, hacer clic en la opci&#xF3;n &#x201C;regala un mercado&#x201D;, diligenciar el formulario con los datos solicitados, elegir el monto del mismo y finalizar la transacci&#xF3;n. Una vez hecho este proceso, le llegar&#xE1; un c&#xF3;digo al correo electr&#xF3;nico y con este se puede hacer la compra en cualquiera de los supermercados: &#xC9;xito, Carulla, Surtimax, Super Inter y Surtimayorista. Las donaciones deben realizarse a nombre de un destinatario espec&#xED;fico, puesto que al momento de este reclamar el mercado, deber&#xE1; presentar su documento de identidad y el c&#xF3;digo generado en la compra.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About EVERTEC&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Evertec (NYSE: EVTC), es una compa&#xF1;&#xED;a l&#xED;der de servicios de procesamiento de transacciones en Am&#xE9;rica Latina, provee servicios de adquisici&#xF3;n de transacciones en comercios, procesamiento de pagos y gerencia de procesos de negocios. Maneja un sistema de redes de pagos electr&#xF3;nicos que procesa m&#xE1;s de 2 mil millones de transacciones anualmente y brinda un conjunto integral de servicios de procesamiento de soluciones bancarias, procesamiento de efectivo y tercerizaci&#xF3;n de tecnolog&#xED;a. Adem&#xE1;s, Evertec posee y opera la Red ATH&#xAE;, una de las principales redes de d&#xE9;bito con n&#xFA;mero de identificaci&#xF3;n personal en Am&#xE9;rica Latina. Con sede principal en Puerto Rico, ofrece servicios en 26 pa&#xED;ses de Am&#xE9;rica Latina. Para m&#xE1;s informaci&#xF3;n, visite &lt;a href="https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fsandybrown-hedgehog-798082.hostingersite.com&amp;amp;esheet=52199865&amp;amp;newsitemid=20200406005822&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=www.evertecinc.com&amp;amp;index=1&amp;amp;md5=88bc960bf812ab2b8382ad7f817711de"&gt;www.evertecinc.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sobre Grupo &#xC9;xito&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Grupo &#xC9;xito es una empresa multilatina colombiana del sector retail. Naci&#xF3; en 1905 con la marca Carulla y desde 1999 su accionista mayoritario es el grupo franc&#xE9;s Casino. Es l&#xED;der del retail en Colombia, con las marcas &#xC9;xito, Carulla, Super Inter, Surtimax y Surtimayorista y en Uruguay con las marcas Disco, Devoto y Geant, y tiene presencia en Argentina con la marca Libertad.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contacto de Prensa&lt;/strong&gt;: Juliana Grajales / +57 (310) 895 60 11 / juliana.grajales@sandybrown-hedgehog-798082.hostingersite.com. / Colombia&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>today announced that Almacenes Exito SA (CB: EXITO) (&#x201C;Exito&#x201D;), the largest supermarket chain in Colombia.</post_excerpt><post_date>2020-04-07 16:19:16</post_date><post_name>evertec-apoya-grupo-exito-en-lanzamiento-de-tarjeta</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/banner-evertec-supports-new-payment-solution-for-exito-colombias-largest-supermarket-chain.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Noticias,Evertec en los medios,</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec apoya a Grupo &#xC9;xito en lanzamiento de tarjeta &#x201C;Mercado para Colombia&#x201D;</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec reporta los resultados del cuarto trimestre y a&#xF1;o completo 2020</post_title><ID>29187</ID><post_content>&lt;h4&gt;Anuncia perspectivas para 2021&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;San Juan, Puerto Rico &#x2013; 1&#xBA; de marzo, 2021 &#x2013; EVERTEC, Inc. (NYSE: EVTC) (&#x201C;Evertec&#x201D; o la &#x201C;compa&#xF1;&#xED;a&#x201D;) anunci&#xF3; hoy los resultados del cuarto trimestre y del a&#xF1;o completo que finaliz&#xF3; el 31 de diciembre de 2020.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aspectos destacados del cuarto trimestre de 2020 y recientes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Los ingresos aumentaron un 6% a $ 134,2 millones&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;La utilidad neta GAAP atribuible a los accionistas fue de $ 32,3 millones, o $ 0,44 por acci&#xF3;n diluida.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;El EBITDA ajustado aument&#xF3; un 16% a $ 63,9 millones&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Las ganancias ajustadas por acci&#xF3;n fueron de $ 0.59, o un aumento del 23%.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Lanzamiento de productos Santander Chile y Citibanamex&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Expandi&#xE9;ndose en M&#xE9;xico con Mercado Libre&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aspectos destacados del a&#xF1;o completo 2020&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Los ingresos crecieron un 5% a $ 510,6 millones&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;La utilidad neta GAAP atribuible a los accionistas fue de $ 104,4 millones, o $ 1,43 por acci&#xF3;n diluida.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;El EBITDA ajustado aument&#xF3; un 6% a $ 240,5 millones&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Las ganancias ajustadas por acci&#xF3;n fueron de $ 2.07, o un aumento del 6%.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;$ 21,7 millones devueltos a los accionistas a trav&#xE9;s de recompras de acciones y dividendos&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mac Schuessler, presidente y director ejecutivo declar&#xF3;: &#x201C;&lt;em&gt;A pesar de la pandemia, logramos resultados r&#xE9;cord para 2020 y cumplimos con importantes implementaciones de productos clave en Am&#xE9;rica Latina para Santander Chile, Citibanamex y m&#xE1;s recientemente con Mercado Libre en M&#xE9;xico. Tambi&#xE9;n nos beneficiamos de los aumentos en nuestro negocio ATH M&#xF3;vil y ATH M&#xF3;vil a medida que los consumidores adoptaron una transici&#xF3;n a las transacciones digitales."&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Schuessler continu&#xF3;: &#x201C;&lt;em&gt;De cara al 2021, esperamos que las tendencias con consumidores, comerciantes y bancos impulsen a&#xFA;n m&#xE1;s la digitalizaci&#xF3;n en los comercios. Estos vientos de cola de la industria, combinados con nuestro enfoque continuo en la innovaci&#xF3;n y la expansi&#xF3;n del mercado en Am&#xE9;rica Latina, impulsar&#xE1;n nuestro crecimiento tanto este a&#xF1;o como en el futuro&lt;/em&gt;&#x201D;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Puede leer el informe completo aqu&#xED;: &lt;a href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/EVERTEC-REPORTS-FOURTH-QUARTER-AND-FULL-YEAR-2020-RESULTS.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;EVERTEC REPORTA RESULTADOS DEL CUARTO TRIMESTRE Y A&#xD1;O COMPLETO 2020&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2021-03-11 12:57:13</post_date><post_name>evertec-resultados-cuarto-trimestre</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/EVERTEC-FACILIDADES-DE-SU-SEDE-con-nuevo-logo-2.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Noticias</post_category><post_tag>2020,Earnings Report,Evertec,Fourth Quarter,Investors</post_tag><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec reporta los resultados del cuarto trimestre y a&#xF1;o completo 2020</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>TIC M&#xF3;vil Cafam, un servicio a la mano</post_title><ID>29371</ID><post_content>&lt;h4&gt;Evertec&#xAE; anunci&#xF3; el lanzamiento de la TIC M&#xF3;vil Cafam en Colombia&lt;/h4&gt;&#xD;
&lt;p style="text-align: left;"&gt;TIC m&#xF3;vil Cafam es una billetera digital que permite a los afiliados de la Caja de Compensaci&#xF3;n realizar transacciones desde la comodidad de sus dispositivos m&#xF3;viles, empleando la practicidad y seguridad de c&#xF3;digos QR y tokens para efectuar operaciones de compra o retiro en los comercios de convenio y aliados, sin tener que usar la tarjeta f&#xED;sica.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
Con el impulso que han tenido hoy en d&#xED;a las soluciones digitales en la regi&#xF3;n, la Caja de Compensaci&#xF3;n Familiar Cafam de Colombia, se suma a la virtualizaci&#xF3;n de su Tarjeta Integral (TIC), para ofrecer a sus afiliados una herramienta m&#xF3;vil que facilite la administraci&#xF3;n de su cuota monetaria, realizando transacciones de compra y retiro de forma r&#xE1;pida, simple y en cualquier momento.&#xD;
&#xD;
Mediante este proceso de transformaci&#xF3;n digital, refuerzan a&#xFA;n m&#xE1;s el compromiso que tienen con la comunidad para estar &#x201C;m&#xE1;s cerca del afiliado&#x201D;, puesto que con la virtualidad que ahora tiene su Tarjeta Integral, los afiliados podr&#xE1;n contar con un servicio a la mano para acceder de manera r&#xE1;pida a los servicios propios y de convenio que tienen con la Caja de Compensaci&#xF3;n Familiar.&#xD;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&#x201C;La TIC M&#xF3;vil Cafam es el resultado de un proceso de innovaci&#xF3;n y desarrollo conjunto, con el respaldo de Evertec como aliado tecnol&#xF3;gico. Despu&#xE9;s de varios meses de trabajo entre ambas compa&#xF1;&#xED;as, se ha logrado exitosamente contar con este nuevo servicio virtual, el cual se pone a disposici&#xF3;n de nuestros afiliados para que puedan administrar de manera segura los productos que tienen con nosotros y realizar operaciones tanto financieras como no financieras desde la conveniencia de sus tel&#xE9;fonos m&#xF3;viles. Con esto, buscamos disminuir gradualmente el uso de la tarjeta f&#xED;sica, para que a trav&#xE9;s de la TIC M&#xF3;vil Cafam los usuarios realicen compras, retiros, recargas de l&#xED;nea de celular, consultas de saldos, actualizaci&#xF3;n de datos, entre otras operaciones&#x201D; &lt;/em&gt;se&#xF1;ala Rodrigo Del Castillo, vicepresidente ejecutivo y principal oficial comercial para Am&#xE9;rica Latina.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
El entendimiento constante de las necesidades de los afiliados, as&#xED; como el impulso para desarrollar un portafolio de servicios innovadores, es lo que ha consolidado a Cafam como una de las principales Cajas de Compensaci&#xF3;n Familiar en el pa&#xED;s, raz&#xF3;n por la cual cada vez busca diversas y nuevas alternativas que promuevan el bienestar de los trabajadores colombianos, especialmente en esta ocasi&#xF3;n mediante el desarrollo de su billetera digital. Con esta actualizaci&#xF3;n simplifica a sus afiliados los procesos de pago, adem&#xE1;s de permitirles acceder a m&#xFA;ltiples canales y beneficios.&#xD;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&#x201C;El gran reto es continuar mejorando la experiencia de los consumidores con soluciones digitales, autogestionadas e intuitivas, seguiremos trabajando para complementar con nuevas funcionalidades la oferta de servicios para la TIC M&#xF3;vil Cafam, convirti&#xE9;ndola en una soluci&#xF3;n integral para nuestro cliente, as&#xED; como para sus afiliados&#x201D;&lt;/em&gt;, asegur&#xF3; Sandra Milena Romero Ropero, Gerente General Evertec Colombia, quien desde el pasado mes de junio lidera las operaciones desarrolladas desde la oficina de Bogot&#xE1;, y quien cuenta con m&#xE1;s de 20 a&#xF1;os de experiencia profesional en la industria financiera.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2021-07-23 12:24:49</post_date><post_name>tic-movil-cafam-un-servicio-a-la-mano</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/WEBcafam.png</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Art&#xED;culos</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>TIC M&#xF3;vil Cafam, un servicio a la mano</title><meta_desc>TIC M&#xF3;vil Cafam, una billetera digital que permite a los afiliados realizar transacciones desde la comodidad de sus dispositivos m&#xF3;viles.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec y Social Media Group (Gustazos&#xAE;) lanzaron al mercado Gustitos&#xAE;Go</post_title><ID>29376</ID><post_content>El pasado mes de junio Evertec y Social Media Group, este &#xFA;ltimo creador de Gustazos&#xAE;,&#x202F;l&#xED;der en Puerto Rico de mercadeo digital a base de ofertas y descuentos, lanzaron al mercado del pa&#xED;s, Gustitos&#xAE;Go,&#x202F;un nuevo programa de lealtad para los usuarios de ATH&#xAE; y los comercios que procesan en la isla con Evertec. Los consumidores que se registran en el programa pueden acumular puntos de Gustazos.com (G-Credits&#x2122;) por compras efectuadas en comercios participantes.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;em&gt;&#x201C;En Evertec, estamos entusiasmados con este nuevo programa que sin lugar a duda es una excelente herramienta para que los comercios locales puedan aumentar sus ventas mientras los tarjetahabientes de ATH reciben un nuevo beneficio al obtener cr&#xE9;ditos por comprar los art&#xED;culos que compran a diario en sus tiendas favoritas. Es una excelente forma de continuar fortaleciendo los comercios y la econom&#xED;a de Puerto Rico&#x201D;&lt;/em&gt; indic&#xF3; Mike Vizcarrondo, director comercial de Evertec para Puerto Rico y el Caribe.&#xD;
&#xD;
GustitosGo es un programa de lealtad que otorga puntos (G-Credits) a los usuarios registrados a trav&#xE9;s de la plataforma de Gustazos, al momento de realizar pagos con su tarjeta ATH en comercios participantes. Al utilizar su tarjeta ATH debidamente registrada en el programa, y comprar en un comercio participante de GustitosGo, al presente, recibir&#xE1;n en G-Credits el equivalente a 7% del total de su compra y un 12% al regresar y realizar una compra por segunda ocasi&#xF3;n en el mismo comercio participante durante el mismo mes,&#x202F;seg&#xFA;n las reglas de participaci&#xF3;n establecidas por GustitosGo.&#x202F;Estos G-Credits podr&#xE1;n ser redimidos en www.Gustazos.com.&#xD;
&#xD;
Luke C. Todesco, CEO de Social Media Group, indic&#xF3; que, &lt;em&gt;&#x201C;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;esta alianza entre Gustazos y Evertec representa una continuaci&#xF3;n de la ya exitosa colaboraci&#xF3;n de largos a&#xF1;os dirigida a ayudar a que el d&#xED;a a d&#xED;a de los residentes y negocios de Puerto Rico, sea una experiencia de excelencia. Evertec, como socio clave de Gustazos, nos ha apoyado procesando millones de Gustazos desde 2011. Esta colaboraci&#xF3;n le ofrece un beneficio a largo plazo para los titulares de tarjetas ATH, los socios comerciales de Evertec en Puerto Rico y para el consumidor en general.&#x201D;&lt;/em&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Entre los beneficios que GustitosGo le ofrece a los comercios que procesan con Evertec y que se registren a trav&#xE9;s de &lt;a style="color: #00d3ad;" href="https://www.getgustitosgo.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;getgustitosgo.com&lt;/a&gt;&#x202F;se destacan: el que los comercios pueden participar del programa, que ser&#xE1;n incluidos en las promociones de mercadeo y, como beneficio principal, que los tarjetahabientes ser&#xE1;n incentivados a visitar a esos comercios. De esta forma, no solo les ayudar&#xE1; a aumentar las ventas sino tambi&#xE9;n a recompensar la lealtad de sus clientes.&#xD;
&#xD;
Los usuarios que desean participar solo tienen que visitar &lt;a style="color: #00d3ad;" href="https://www.gustitosgo.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;gustitosgo.com&lt;/a&gt;, vincular su tarjeta ATH y autom&#xE1;ticamente comenzar&#xE1;n a ganar recompensas al pagar con su tarjeta vinculada en todos los comercios participantes. Registrarse en el programa es gratis para los tarjetahabientes.&#xD;
&#xD;
Por su parte, Evertec estar&#xE1; actuando como procesador y agregador de los datos entre los tarjetahabientes y los comercios participantes en GustitosGo. Los comerciantes que deseen procesar con Evertec y beneficiarse de este programa pueden conseguir m&#xE1;s informaci&#xF3;n y contactarlos a trav&#xE9;s de &lt;a style="color: #00d3ad;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;www.evertecinc.com&lt;/a&gt;.</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2021-07-23 12:54:13</post_date><post_name>evertec-y-social-media-group-gustazos-lanzaron-al-mercado-gustitosgo</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/WEBgustitos.png</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Art&#xED;culos</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority/><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec y Social Media Group (Gustazos&#xAE;) lanzaron al mercado Gustitos&#xAE;Go</title><meta_desc>GustitosGo es un programa de lealtad que otorga puntos (G-Credits) a los usuarios registrados a trav&#xE9;s de la plataforma de Gustazos.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec fortalece la fuerza laboral del futuro</post_title><ID>29387</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;Comprometido con la educaci&#xF3;n de nuestra fuerza laboral y las comunidades a las que servimos, anunciamos el 13 de mayo, la 7ma edici&#xF3;n de nuestro Programa de Becas logrando nuevamente el inter&#xE9;s de sobre 1,400 estudiantes universitarios de Puerto Rico y Latinoam&#xE9;rica, quienes se registraron para solicitar la beca. El Programa se estableci&#xF3; en el 2015 y desde entonces, Evertec ha demostrado su compromiso genuino de contribuir al desarrollo de una sociedad eminentemente tecnol&#xF3;gica con j&#xF3;venes profesionales que puedan desenvolverse de forma competitiva en el nuevo mercado laboral. El Programa no solo est&#xE1; enfocado en fortalecer las industrias relacionadas a la ciencia, tecnolog&#xED;a, ingenier&#xED;a y matem&#xE1;ticas (STEM por sus siglas en ingl&#xE9;s), sino tambi&#xE9;n est&#xE1; alineado a las necesidades actuales del mercado provocadas por el COVID-19 donde la demanda por profesionales de ciencia y tecnolog&#xED;a de datos e informaci&#xF3;n han tenido un gran auge. Pero va m&#xE1;s all&#xE1;, pues tambi&#xE9;n sus resultados han demostrado que fomenta el inter&#xE9;s y la inclusi&#xF3;n de las f&#xE9;minas en las carreras de STEM. Agradecemos a las universidades por su apoyo demostrado al promover nuestra beca en el estudiantado y a los j&#xF3;venes que reconocen lo que hacemos, valoran la otorgaci&#xF3;n de la beca y les sirve de orgullo y est&#xED;mulo para superarse.&lt;/p&gt;		
				&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/Infografia-BECAS-2021.png" alt="Infografia BECAS 2021" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/Pieza-becas-testimonio-Aimar-Morales.png" alt="Pieza becas - testimonio Aimar Morales" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src="https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/07/Pieza-becas-testimonio-Manuel-Kike-Salva.png" alt="Pieza becas - testimonio Manuel Kike Salva" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;			
