&#xD;
Designed for small and midsize businesses, Acumatica Cloud ERP enables you to grow your business to the next level with unparalleled functional breadth across an extensive suite of connected applications for accounting, projects, cases, analytics, and customer management.&#xD;
&#xD;
Discover why leading organizations modernize their operations with Acumatica to manage their financial backbone, streamline operating costs, and win new revenue opportunities.&#xD;
&#xD;
With Acumatica, you will always know the health of your company&#x2019;s operations&#x2014;from client engagements to inventory and from projects to financials&#x2014;to help you make better decisions and grow your business.&#xD;
&#xD;
Acumatica empowers employees with a modern ERP application that is easy to use, easy to learn, available anytime on any device, and adaptable to their specific role in the organization. Personalize dashboards and workspaces by role, create user-defined fields, modify reports, and generate inquiries without technical assistance.&#xD;
&#xD;
Acumatica&#x2019;s mobile app and open cloud architecture connect remote workers with in-house employees for real-time information anytime, anywhere, on any device.&#xD;
&#xD;
Acumatica has affordable prices that include unlimited users and flexible deployment options. Engage all employees in the company&#x2019;s operation without added user fees and extend collaboration to customers, vendors, and contractors.&#xD;
&#xD;
Designed for mobile accessibility anytime, anywhere, on any device, Acumatica provides growing organizations with a business platform to thrive in the new digital economy.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
