&lt;h4 style="text-align: center;"&gt;&#xA1;Gracias a todos los que apoyaron con su donativo a este importante esfuerzo!&lt;/h4&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Si hay algo que ha caracterizado a Evertec como ciudadano corporativo, es su respuesta inmediata ante situaciones de emergencia que impactan de forma inesperada y negativa a nuestra sociedad. M&#xE1;xime cuando estas ocurren en los pa&#xED;ses donde tiene operaciones. Ejemplo de ello han sido las diversas iniciativas realizadas en apoyo a los clientes, colaboradores, organizaciones sin fines de lucro y hasta los damnificados que fueron afectados, ya sea por la pandemia del COVID-19 que impact&#xF3; a todos los pa&#xED;ses, y los terremotos y huracanes ocurridos en Puerto Rico. </post_excerpt><post_date>2022-12-06 16:48:41</post_date><post_name>evertec-responde-ante-los-estragos-causados-por-el-huracan-fiona</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/huracan-fiona-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Noticias</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Opcional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec responde ante los estragos causados por el hurac&#xE1;n Fiona</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Un d&#xED;a del voluntariado para recordar</post_title><ID>40447</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;El D&#xED;a del Voluntariado representa nuestro d&#xED;a anual de servicio a la comunidad. Una vez al a&#xF1;o, desde Puerto Rico hasta Uruguay, nos unimos como un solo Evertec para realizar diversas actividades que contribuyen a hacer de nuestro mundo un mejor lugar para las familias, el ambiente, los animales y las comunidades donde tenemos nuestras operaciones.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Este a&#xF1;o, la campa&#xF1;a de nuestro evento gir&#xF3; en torno a la diversidad y el evento, que se llev&#xF3; a cabo en el mes de noviembre, nos permiti&#xF3; demostrar c&#xF3;mo nuestro compromiso con la sociedad cobr&#xF3; vida a trav&#xE9;s de m&#xFA;ltiples proyectos de servicio. Proyectos que fueron realizados por cientos de nuestros colaboradores, quienes tuvieron la oportunidad de compartir y apoyar a organizaciones sin fines de lucro de Am&#xE9;rica Latina y Puerto Rico. La emoci&#xF3;n y el inter&#xE9;s de poder llevar nuestra diversidad a los participantes de las organizaciones que respaldamos qued&#xF3; evidenciada en las horas de voluntariado ofrecidas, demostrando a su vez que, el inter&#xE9;s de apoyar y colaborar con los m&#xE1;s necesitados es un valor genuino de nuestra cultura corporativa.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Agradecemos el apoyo de los l&#xED;deres de nuestra empresa y el compromiso demostrado por los l&#xED;deres de los proyectos del D&#xED;a del Voluntariado, ya que, gracias a todos ellos, fue posible realizar con &#xE9;xito nuestro voluntariado corporativo en Chile, Colombia, Costa Rica, M&#xE9;xico, Panam&#xE1;, Per&#xFA;, Puerto Rico, Rep&#xFA;blica Dominicana y Uruguay. Sobre todo, agradecemos a las 22 organizaciones que con alegr&#xED;a nos recibieron permitiendo que de alguna forma nuestra colaboraci&#xF3;n contribuyera en la transformaci&#xF3;n de las vidas de los ni&#xF1;os, adultos mayores, personas con discapacidad y animales que ellos atienden. Igualmente, a las organizaciones dirigidas a proteger la naturaleza, tema igualmente importante para nuestra empresa.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;En esta 8va edici&#xF3;n apoyamos a las siguientes organizaciones:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;De Puerto Rico&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Instituto Loaiza Cordero&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n S&#xED;ndrome Down&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Siervas de Maria&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;El Comedor de la Kennedy&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Hogar Ruth&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Hogar del Ni&#xF1;o Ave Mar&#xED;a&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Hogar de Abu&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Hogar Rafaela Ybarra&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;MDA&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Brownie Blondie Foundation&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n Team 821, Inc., Vieques en Rescate&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Programa REDES&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;De Am&#xE9;rica Latina&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Hogar Bol&#xED;var&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n Planificable&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n Servidores del Servidor&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n Callejeros de la Misericordia&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n Orca&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Corporaci&#xF3;n Masbosques&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n Bandera Blanca&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Jomp&#xE9;ame
Redalco&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Karumb&#xE9;&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;En busca de un hogar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Y a&#xFA;n quedan unos proyectos por realizarse. Nuestro compromiso es genuino y el mensaje ha sido claro, en Evertec, compartimos con las organizaciones sin fines de lucro un mismo fin de cooperaci&#xF3;n, ayuda mutua y bienestar social. &lt;strong&gt;&#xA1;No est&#xE1;n solas y contar&#xE1;n con Evertec para impulsarlas!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>En Evertec, somos ricos en diversidad de g&#xE9;nero, raza, experiencia, etnia, educaci&#xF3;n, generaciones, cultura, edad, nacionalidad, idioma, &lt;b&gt;pero somos a&#xFA;n m&#xE1;s ricos en generosidad.  As&#xED; lo demostramos a trav&#xE9;s de la 8va edici&#xF3;n del D&#xED;a del Voluntariado.&lt;/b&gt;</post_excerpt><post_date>2022-12-06 17:16:29</post_date><post_name>un-dia-del-voluntariado-para-recordar</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/voluntareado-2022.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Noticias</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Opcional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Un d&#xED;a del voluntariado para recordar</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec premia la excelencia acad&#xE9;mica en Puerto Rico y Latinoam&#xE9;rica</post_title><ID>40462</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;Demostrando el genuino compromiso que tiene nuestra empresa por la educaci&#xF3;n y el desarrollo econ&#xF3;mico de los pa&#xED;ses donde tiene sus operaciones, celebramos en octubre la 8va. ceremonia de entrega de becas, donde se reconoci&#xF3; a estudiantes universitarios de Puerto Rico y de Latinoam&#xE9;rica. Cabe destacar que, en los pasados ocho a&#xF1;os, en Evertec ya hemos otorgado m&#xE1;s de $1 mill&#xF3;n de d&#xF3;lares en apoyo a 876 estudiantes destacados, por su excelencia acad&#xE9;mica y compromiso comunitario y que cursan estudios en STEM a nivel de bachillerato, maestr&#xED;a y doctorado.&lt;/p&gt;		
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				"Quiero felicitar a los premiados de este a&#xF1;o, ya que sus extraordinarios esfuerzos y excelencia acad&#xE9;mica demostraron que son los m&#xE1;s distinguidos entre todos los solicitantes de nuestro programa de becas, el cual cada a&#xF1;o se vuelve m&#xE1;s competitivo. Deber&#xED;an estar orgullosos de este logro&#x201D;			&lt;/p&gt;
											&lt;cite&gt;Presidente y CEO, Mac Schuessler. &lt;/cite&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;Nuestro Programa de Becas fue lanzado en mayo del 2015 y actualmente es uno de los pilares principales de la gesti&#xF3;n de responsabilidad social de nuestra empresa. &#x201C;Estamos convencidos de que la educaci&#xF3;n les brinda a las personas los conocimientos, las competencias, las actitudes y los valores que se necesitan para ser exitosos y forjar un futuro sostenible. Al aportar a la educaci&#xF3;n, proporcionamos herramientas fundamentales para el progreso de las comunidades y la sociedad&#x201D;, indic&#xF3; Alexandra L&#xF3;pez, nuestra primera oficial de Mercadeo y Comunicaciones Corporativas de Evertec.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Uno de los logros que en Evertec hemos obtenido a trav&#xE9;s del Programa de Becas es que, por tercer a&#xF1;o consecutivo, hemos podido mantener la participaci&#xF3;n de mujeres en STEM sobre el 50%, igualando la proporci&#xF3;n de solicitudes 1:1. Dato importante, ya que la integraci&#xF3;n de la mujer en las carreras STEM (ciencia, tecnolog&#xED;a, ingenier&#xED;a y matem&#xE1;ticas) contin&#xFA;a siendo fundamental para reducir la brecha digital entre hombres y mujeres. De hecho, el reto es mayor si se toma en consideraci&#xF3;n el informe publicado por el Foro Econ&#xF3;mico Mundial (WEF, por sus siglas en ingl&#xE9;s), en abril del 2021 el cual destaca que, &lt;strong&gt;la desigualdad de g&#xE9;nero se agudiz&#xF3; a nivel mundial a causa del COVID-19&lt;/strong&gt;. Seg&#xFA;n la rese&#xF1;a publicada, &#x201C;la pandemia del Covid-19 levant&#xF3; nuevas barreras para construir econom&#xED;as y sociedades inclusivas y pr&#xF3;speras. Las brechas de g&#xE9;nero preexistentes amplificaron la crisis de manera asim&#xE9;trica entre hombres y mujeres. Antes del COVID se esperaba que la brecha de g&#xE9;nero se cerrar&#xED;a en 99 a&#xF1;os y ahora se pronostica que tomar&#xE1; 135 a&#xF1;os.&#x201D;1 Ante esta situaci&#xF3;n Alexandra indic&#xF3; que, &#x201C;ahora m&#xE1;s que nunca se necesitan empresas como la nuestra que fomenten la diversidad, equidad y la inclusi&#xF3;n, y le brinden oportunidades a las f&#xE9;minas para que formen parte de la fuerza laboral.&#x201D;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Los candidatos galardonados recibir&#xE1;n una beca de $1,000 para sus estudios universitarios 2022 &#x2013; 2023 e incluye a estudiantes de la poblaci&#xF3;n general de Puerto Rico y a empleados de Evertec y sus hijos que residen en Puerto Rico, Am&#xE9;rica Latina y el Caribe. Adem&#xE1;s, en Evertec tambi&#xE9;n contamos con un Programa de Internado mediante el cual se les brinda la oportunidad a estudiantes de tercer y cuarto a&#xF1;o universitario de tener experiencias reales de lo que es el mundo laboral. M&#xE1;s de 130 estudiantes de 31 universidades de Puerto Rico y Estados Unidos han participado del Programa desde el 2015, al cual tambi&#xE9;n podr&#xED;an solicitar los estudiantes que fueron becados recientemente.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Los becados cuentan su experiencia&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#x201C;&lt;strong&gt;El futuro que sue&#xF1;as es posible&lt;/strong&gt;&#x201D;, fue el lema de la campa&#xF1;a de becas de este a&#xF1;o, la cual capt&#xF3; el inter&#xE9;s en su mayor&#xED;a de estudiantes de ciencia y tecnolog&#xED;a, entre las solicitudes recibidas. Como parte de la ceremonia de entrega de becas, se cont&#xF3; con la participaci&#xF3;n del Dr. Gian Villamil, quien fue becado por nuestra empresa en dos ocasiones durante sus estudios doctorales y quien hoy es meteor&#xF3;logo, programador Python y ejerce como Deputy Project Manager and System Developer Team Lead en la empresa GAMA-1 Technologies. Villamil ofreci&#xF3; su experiencia y la importancia que ha tenido la ciencia y la tecnolog&#xED;a en su carrera.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Por otro lado, y con el inter&#xE9;s de conocer el sentir de los estudiantes, se les solicit&#xF3; a los galardonados que expresaran lo que para ellos significaba recibir nuestra beca. A continuaci&#xF3;n, se comparten algunas expresiones de los becados:&lt;/p&gt;		
						&#x201C;Recibir la beca de Evertec significa mucho para m&#xED;, ya que reconoce mi esfuerzo acad&#xE9;mico y mis deseos de emprender en el futuro.&#x201D; &#x2013; Alianys K. Ocasio, estudiante de Administraci&#xF3;n de Empresas con concentraci&#xF3;n en Sistemas Computarizados de Informaci&#xF3;n de la Universidad Ana G. M&#xE9;ndez. Becada por 1ra. vez.					
						&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/plugins/widgetkit-for-elementor/dist/images/placeholder.jpg" alt=""&gt;
						&#x201C;Recibir nuevamente la beca Evertec, significa para m&#xED; que una vez m&#xE1;s cuento con el apoyo para seguir alcanzando mis metas.&#x201D;- Andrea E. Figueroa Rosa, estudiante de Educaci&#xF3;n Secundaria en Matem&#xE1;ticas de la Universidad Interamericana de Arecibo. Becada por 2da. ocasi&#xF3;n. 					
						&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/plugins/widgetkit-for-elementor/dist/images/placeholder.jpg" alt=""&gt;
						&#x201C;Gracias por impulsar a j&#xF3;venes como yo, apasionados por carreras STEM, a lograr nuestras metas y convertirnos en profesionales innovadores del futuro.&#x201D;   Krystal M&#xE9;ndez Bonilla, estudiante de ingenier&#xED;a mec&#xE1;nica de la Universidad Polit&#xE9;cnica. Becada por 1ra. vez.					
						&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/plugins/widgetkit-for-elementor/dist/images/placeholder.jpg" alt=""&gt;
						&#x201C;Ser seleccionada como becada, esto significa el continuar con mi crecimiento acad&#xE9;mico/profesional para el apoyo hacia futuras generaciones de mujeres en STEM.&#x201D; &#x2013; Francheska M. Col&#xF3;n Gonz&#xE1;lez, estudiante de Qu&#xED;mica de la Universidad de Puerto Rico, Recinto de Mayag&#xFC;ez. Becada por 3ra ocasi&#xF3;n.					
						&#x201C;Esta beca para m&#xED; significa un paso m&#xE1;s para lograr mis metas.&#x201D; &#x2013; Jan Bidot Cruzado, estudiante de ciencias con concentraci&#xF3;n en matem&#xE1;ticas de la Universidad de Puerto Rico, Recinto de R&#xED;o Piedras. Becado por 3ra ocasi&#xF3;n.					
						&#x201C;El ser nuevamente galardonado con esta beca es una gran bendici&#xF3;n, bendici&#xF3;n que recuerda que los sue&#xF1;os se cumplen y el cielo es el l&#xED;mite.&#x201D; &#x2013; William Negr&#xF3;n Mercado, estudiante de ingenier&#xED;a de computadoras de la Universidad de Puerto Rico, Recinto de Mayag&#xFC;ez. Becado por 4ta ocasi&#xF3;n.					
						&#x201C;Gracias una vez m&#xE1;s por invertir en mi futuro.&#x201D; &#x2013; Joshua Gaspar Rodriguez, estudiante de ciencias de computadora de la Universidad Polit&#xE9;cnica. Becado por 4ta ocasi&#xF3;n.					
														Anterior
														Siguiente
		&lt;p&gt;Para m&#xE1;s informaci&#xF3;n del Programa de Becas de Evertec 2022 puedes acceder al siguiente enlace: &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4EztSWn1n28" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Entrega de Becas 2022 - YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 - How long will it take to close the global gender gap? | World Economic Forum (&lt;a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://www.weforum.org/agenda/2021/04/136-years-is-the-estimated-journey-time-to-gender-equality/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;weforum.org&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>En la 8va edici&#xF3;n de nuestro Programa de Becas otorgamos 186 becas a estudiantes destacados, en su mayor&#xED;a de STEM, para una inversi&#xF3;n total de m&#xE1;s de $190,000</post_excerpt><post_date>2022-12-06 17:34:30</post_date><post_name>evertec-premia-la-excelencia-academica-en-puerto-rico-y-latinoamerica</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/becas-evertec-2022.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Noticias</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Opcional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec premia la excelencia acad&#xE9;mica en Puerto Rico y Latinoam&#xE9;rica</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>A volunteer day to remember</post_title><ID>40757</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;Volunteer Day is our annual day of community service. Once a year, from Puerto Rico all the way to Uruguay, we join efforts as a single Evertec team to carry out different activities to help make the world better for the families, environment, the animals, and the communities from where we operate.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This year, our volunteer campaign focused on diversity, and the event&#x2014;held in November&#x2014;embodied our commitment to society through multiple service projects. These projects were the result of the work of hundreds of our team members, who had the opportunity to share and support nonprofit organizations in Latin America, Puerto Rico and the Caribbean. Our excitement in bringing our diversity to the participants of the organizations we support was evident in the volunteer hours that were shared with these organizations. This, in turn, shows that our interest in supporting and collaborating with those in need is a genuine part of our corporate culture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are thankful for the support of our leaders and for the commitment demonstrated by those who organized and led our Volunteer Day. Thanks to them, we successfully placed Evertec volunteers in Chile, Colombia, Costa Rica, Mexico, Panama, Peru, Puerto Rico, the Dominican Republic, and Uruguay. A special thanks to the 22 organizations that welcomed us, making it possible for our collaboration in helping them transform the lives of children, the elderly, people with disabilities, and the animals they care for. We would also like to thank the organizations dedicated to protecting nature and our environment, a cause equally important for our organization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;During our eighth annual Volunteer Day, we provided support to the following organizations:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;In Puerto Rico&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Instituto Loaiza Cordero&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n S&#xED;ndrome Down&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Siervas de Maria&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;El Comedor de la Kennedy&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hogar Ruth&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hogar del Ni&#xF1;o Ave Mar&#xED;a&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hogar de Abu&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hogar Rafaela Ybarra&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;MDA&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Brownie Blondie Foundation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n Team 821, Inc., Vieques en Rescate&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Programa REDES&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;In Latin America&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Hogar Bol&#xED;var&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n Planificable&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n Servidores del Servidor&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n Callejeros de la Misericordia&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n Orca&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Corporaci&#xF3;n Masbosques&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n Bandera Blanca&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Jomp&#xE9;ame
Redalco&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;Karumb&#xE9;&lt;/li&gt;
 	&lt;li&gt;En busca de un hogar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;There is still more work to be done. Our commitment is evident and the message is clear&#x2014;at Evertec, we share common goals with these organizations: work in collaboration, provide aid, and focus on promoting social well-being. &lt;strong&gt;You are not alone. You have Evertec to help you move forward!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>At Evertec, we are rich in diversity in terms of our gender, race, experience, ethnicity, education, generation, culture, age, nationality, and language. &lt;b&gt;But we are also rich in generosity. This was demonstrated through at our eighth annual Volunteer Day.&lt;/b&gt;</post_excerpt><post_date>2022-12-06 17:16:29</post_date><post_name>a-volunteer-day-to-remember</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/voluntareado-2022.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>A volunteer day to remember</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec responds to the devastation caused by hurricane Fiona</post_title><ID>40773</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;This includes hurricanes like Fiona, which hit the Island of Enchantment in September of this year and after which a large portion of the western region is still struggling to recover. Aware of the impact, and as a demonstration of support toward the recovery efforts, Evertec in conjunction with ATH led an initiative where, from September 23 to October 7, Evertec matched each dollar donated through the &#x201C;Donate&#x201D; feature in the ATH M&#xF3;vil application to 31 organizations that stood out for their work in helping those affected by the disaster. The maximum limit was set at $100,000 with a cap of $5,000 per organization, subject to the availability of funds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;According to Evertec President and CEO Mac Schuessler, &#x201C;Hurricane Fiona inflicted hardship on Puerto Rico and the Caribbean, and our hearts go out to those affected. We remain deeply committed to the recovery and I am proud of our colleagues and their efforts to respond to these challenges.&#x201D;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style="color: #ff6c0c;"&gt;Below, we have listed the institutions that were supported by Evertec and the citizens of Puerto Rico:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Taller Salud / TallerSalud&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;La Fondita de Jes&#xFA;s / LaFonditaDeJesus&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Techos Pa' Mi Gente / TPMGCorp&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rehaciendo Comunidades con Esperanza / REHACE&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;MATRIA / ProyectoMatria&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Casa Protegida Julia de Burgos / CasaJulia&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Banco de Alimentos de PR / bancodealimentosdepr&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n Mochileando / FundacionMochileando&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ayuda Legal Puerto Rico / ayudalegalpuertorico&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fundacion Pisadas de Amor / FundacionPisadasDeAmor&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Comedores Sociales de Puerto Rico / ComedoresSocialesPR&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;PlenitudPR / PlenitudPR&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Puerto Rico Renace, Inc / PUERTORICORENACEINC&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Red Por La Ni&#xF1;ez /AlberguesPR&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;True Self Foundation / TrueSelf&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Brownie Blondie Foundation / Brownieblondiefoundation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Scuba Dogs Society / Scubadogssociety&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;ConPRmetidos / ConPRmetidos&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Centros Sor Isolina Ferre / CentrosSorIsolinaFerre&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fundaci&#xF3;n Yo no me quito / yonomequitopr&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Para La Naturaleza /Paralanaturaleza&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hogar Forjadores de Esperanza / HogarForjadores&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;El Comedor de la Kennedy / ElComedordelaKennedy&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;C&#xE1;ritas Puerto Rico / CaritasPR&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hogar Ruth / HogarRuthparaMujeres&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Save a Sato / saveasato&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ciencia en Tus Manos / cienciaentusmanos&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Iniciativa Comunitaria / IniciativaComunitaria&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;PRoTechos / PROTECHOS&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Boys and Girls Club / BoysandGirlsClubsdePR&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Cruz Roja Americana, Cap&#xED;tulo de Puerto Rico / CruzRojaPR&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4 style="text-align: center;"&gt;Thank you to all who donated to show their support for this important initiative!&lt;/h4&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>If anything has demonstrated Evertec's role as a corporate citizen, it is its immediate response to unexpected emergency situations that negatively affect our society. This is especially true when those situations happen in the countries where the company operates. One such example has been the various initiatives conducted in support of clients, collaborators, nonprofit organizations, and others affected by damages caused by the COVID-19 pandemic, which impacted the entire world, or the earthquakes and hurricanes in Puerto Rico. </post_excerpt><post_date>2022-12-06 16:48:41</post_date><post_name>evertec-responds-to-the-devastation-caused-hurricane-fiona</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/fiona-EN.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec responds to the devastation caused by hurricane Fiona</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec rewards academic excellence in Puerto Rico and Latin America</post_title><ID>40797</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;To demonstrate our company's commitment to education and economic development in the countries we operate in, in October, we held our 8th Annual Scholarship Award Ceremony, where university students from Puerto Rico, the Caribbean and Latin America received recognition for their academic achievement. Over the past eight years, &lt;strong&gt;Evertec has awarded over $1 million to 876 outstanding students pursuing STEM (science, technology, engineering, and math) studies at the undergraduate, graduate, and doctorate levels, rewarding their academic excellence and community engagement.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;		
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				&#x201C;I want to congratulate this year's awardees, as, their extraordinary efforts and academic excellence helped them stand out among all applicants of our scholarship program, which gets more competitive every year. They should be proud of this achievement&#x201D;			&lt;/p&gt;
											&lt;cite&gt;President and CEO, Mac Schuessler.&lt;/cite&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;Our Scholarship Program was launched in May 2015 and is currently one of the core pillars of our company's social responsibility initiative. &#x201C;We firmly believe that education provides people with the knowledge, skills, attitudes, and values necessary to be successful and build a sustainable future. By contributing to education, we provide the fundamental tools for the progress of our communities and society,&#x201D; stated Alexandra L&#xF3;pez, Chief Marketing &amp;amp; Communications Officer at Evertec.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;One of the great accomplishments of Evertec's Scholarship Program is that, for the third year in a row, over 50% of our program's participants are women in STEM, maintaining a 1:1 women-to-men ratio within the scholarship applicants. This is important because the integration of women in STEM careers is a fundamental step in decreasing the digital gap between men and women globally. In fact, the challenge is even greater considering the report published by the World Economic Forum (WEF) in March of 2021, which stated that &lt;strong&gt;COVID-19 has exacerbated gender inequality worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;. According to the publication, the COVID-19 pandemic has raised new barriers to building inclusive and prosperous economies and societies. Pre-existing gender gaps amplified during the pandemic asymmetrically between men and women. Before COVID, the gender gap was expected to close in 99 years. Now, the forecast is that it will take more than 135 years for equality to be achieved.1 Alexandra remarked that, given the situation, &#x201C;Now more than ever, we need companies like ours, which foster diversity, equality, and inclusion to provide opportunities for women to be part of the workforce.&#x201D;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The awardees will receive a $1,000 scholarship toward their 2022&#x2013;2023 college tuition. The candidates include students from the general population of Puerto Rico, as well as Evertec employees and their children residing in Puerto Rico, the Caribbean and Latin America. At Evertec, we also have an Internship Program that offers third- and fourth-year university students the opportunity to obtain real-life experience in the professional world. More than 130 students from 31 universities in Puerto Rico and the United States have participated in this program since 2015, and it is also available to the recent scholarship awardees.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Scholarship Awardees Share Their Experience&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;The scholarship campaign slogan this year was El futuro que sue&#xF1;as es posible (&#x201C;The future you dream of is possible&#x201D;). This captured the interest of mostly science and technology students, based on the applications received. The Scholarship Award Ceremony featured the participation of Dr. Gian Villamil, who received a scholarship from our company twice during his doctorate studies and is now a meteorologist, a Python programmer, and the Deputy Project Manager and System Developer Team Lead at GAMA-1 Technologies. Villamil shared his experience and talked about the importance of science and technology within his line of work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Meanwhile, in the interest of learning more about the students&#x2019; opinions, awardees were asked to describe what it meant for them to receive our scholarship. Below, we have shared some of the awardees&#x2019; answers:&lt;/p&gt;		
						&#x201C;Getting the Evertec scholarship means a lot to me since it recognizes my academic efforts and my desire to become an entrepreneur in the future.&#x201D; &#x2013; Alianys K. Ocasio, student of Business Administration majoring in Computer Information Systems at Ana G. M&#xE9;ndez University. 1st-time awardee.					
						&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/plugins/widgetkit-for-elementor/dist/images/placeholder.jpg" alt=""&gt;
						&#x201C;Receiving the Evertec scholarship means that I once again have the support to continue pursuing my goals.&#x201D; &#x2013; Andrea E. Figueroa Rosa, student of High School Mathematics Education in the Inter American University in Arecibo. 2nd-time awardee.					
						&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/plugins/widgetkit-for-elementor/dist/images/placeholder.jpg" alt=""&gt;
						&#x201C;Thank you for encouraging young people like me, who are passionate about STEM careers, to reach our goals and become innovative professionals in the future.&#x201D;   Krystal M&#xE9;ndez Bonilla, student of Mechanical Engineering at the Polytechnic University of Puerto Rico. 1st-time awardee.					
						&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/plugins/widgetkit-for-elementor/dist/images/placeholder.jpg" alt=""&gt;
						&#x201C;Being selected as an awardee means that I can continue my academic/professional growth to support future generations of women in STEM.&#x201D; &#x2013; Francheska M. Col&#xF3;n Gonz&#xE1;lez, student of Chemistry at the University of Puerto Rico, Mayag&#xFC;ez Campus. 3rd-time awardee.					
						&#x201C;To me, this scholarship allows me to get one step closer to achieving my goals.&#x201D; &#x2013; Jan Bidot Cruzado, student of Science with a major in Mathematics at the University of Puerto Rico, R&#xED;o Piedras Campus. 3rd-time awardee.					
						&#x201C;Being awarded this scholarship again is a great blessing, which serves as a reminder that dreams can come true and that the sky is the limit.&#x201D; &#x2013; William Negr&#xF3;n Mercado, student of computer engineering at the University of Puerto Rico, Mayag&#xFC;ez Campus. 4th-time awardee.					
						&#x201C;Thank you once more for investing in my future.&#x201D; &#x2013; Joshua Gaspar Rodriguez, student of computer science at the Polytechnic University of Puerto Rico. 4th-time awardee.					
