        &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;#8220;The ATH M&#xF3;vil for Puerto Rico initiative aims to support and provide visibility to nonprofit organizations in Puerto Rico. Thanks to ATH M&#xF3;vil&amp;#8217;s Donate function, we were able to help nonprofit organizations raise more than $200K and receive the funds immediately. We&amp;#8217;re proud of the impact and growth of this initiative and grateful for the hundreds of nonprofit organizations, celebrities, artists, and influencers who took action to make this initiative a success,&amp;#8221;&lt;/em&gt; said Alexandra L&#xF3;pez-Soler, chief marketing officer of Evertec. The winning organizations were a product of the efforts of WAPA-TV, influencers and individual campaigns carried out by the organizations themselves as part of their ATH M&#xF3;vil for Puerto Rico efforts, she added.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- .lae-testimonial --&gt;
&lt;!-- .lae-testimonials --&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;The ATH M&#xF3;vil Donate feature once again proved that it has become a catalyst for the development of NGOs on the island by facilitating the fund-raising efforts of these organizations. The result of the initiative demonstrates that ATH Movil is the easiest, fastest, and immediate manner for donors to contribute to their preferred NGO.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This year the initiative expanded its reach in partnership with WAPA-TV and the talents of its shows Noticentro al Amanecer, P&#xE9;gate al Mediod&#xED;a, Viva La Tarde, Lo S&#xE9; Todo, and Los Datos Son los Datos. Each of the shows promoted different nonprofit organizations and supported their fundraising efforts while motivating the audience to participate and contribute to their causes.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>The initiative raised more than $200K to support not-for-profit organizations (NGOs) on the island.  Additionally, Evertec contributed an additional $5K to each of the top six organizations who raised the most funds during that week.  This initiaitve was designed to raise the visbility and increase the impact of the work these NGOs perform in Puerto Rico.</post_excerpt><post_date>2023-03-31 13:26:34</post_date><post_name>ath-movil-for-puerto-rico-2023</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/ATH-por-puerto-rico-sobresale.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>ATH M&#xF3;vil for Puerto Rico impacts hundreds of nonprofit organizations</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Conoce nuestro servicio de monitoreo de fraude</post_title><ID>41639</ID><post_content>Por esta raz&#xF3;n, monitoreamos las transacciones con nuestra soluci&#xF3;n RiskCenter 360&#x2122;, junto con un equipo de analistas de fraude. Esta soluci&#xF3;n forma parte de nuestros servicios para proteger a nuestros clientes y no conlleva un costo adicional dentro de tu acuerdo contractual con nosotros.&#xD;
&#xD;
A trav&#xE9;s de este servicio, el equipo de analistas ubicado en nuestros centros de operaciones en Puerto Rico y Costa Rica podr&#xED;a contactarte a trav&#xE9;s de llamada y correo electr&#xF3;nico, con el fin de alertar, validar y documentar la investigaci&#xF3;n de cualquier transacci&#xF3;n inusual.&#xD;
&#xD;
Si recibes llamada de alerta y correo electr&#xF3;nico de &lt;strong&gt;TransactionAlert@popularmerchant.com&lt;/strong&gt; por alguna transacci&#xF3;n inusual, es importante responder con prioridad para que el equipo de analistas pueda obtener informaci&#xF3;n adicional y validar esta transacci&#xF3;n. Si deseas comunicarte directamente con nuestro equipo de &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/administracion-de-riesgo/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;monitoreo de fraude,&lt;/a&gt; llama al &lt;strong&gt;(787) 773-5338&lt;/strong&gt; y/o env&#xED;a un correo electr&#xF3;nico a &lt;strong&gt;TransactionAlert@popularmerchant.com.&lt;/strong&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Esta capa adicional de seguridad nos ayuda a fortalecer nuestros servicios de prevenci&#xF3;n de fraude que, a su vez, reduce el riesgo operativo para nuestros comerciantes y aumenta la seguridad de las transacciones comerciales. Con esto, cumplimos con los requisitos de la red de las tarjetas de cr&#xE9;dito y las regulaciones federales.</post_content><post_excerpt>Evertec tiene el compromiso de implementar las mejores pr&#xE1;cticas y as&#xED; ofrecer el m&#xE1;s alto nivel de servicio y seguridad a nuestros clientes.</post_excerpt><post_date>2023-04-03 13:12:05</post_date><post_name>conoce-nuestro-servicio-de-monitoreo-de-fraude</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Conoce-nuestro-servicio-de-monitoreo-de-fraude-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Merchant (boletines)</post_category><post_tag>Comercios,e-commerce,Evertec,fraude,Negocios,Pagos digitales,procesamiento,tarjeta,Tienda en L&#xED;nea,ventas en l&#xED;nea</post_tag><translation_priority>Opcional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Conoce nuestro servicio de monitoreo de fraude</title><meta_desc>Evertec tiene el compromiso de implementar las mejores pr&#xE1;cticas y as&#xED; ofrecer el m&#xE1;s alto nivel de servicio y seguridad a nuestros clientes.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Conoce nuestro servicio de monitoreo de fraude</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Get to know our fraud monitoring service</post_title><ID>41653</ID><post_content>&lt;p style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;This is why we monitor transactions through our RiskCenter 360&#x2122; solution with the support of a team of fraud analysts. This solution is part of our services to protect our customers and does not carry an additional cost under your Merchant Agreement with us.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
&lt;p style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Through this service, the team located in our operations centers in Puerto Rico and Costa Rica may contact you by phone and email in order to alert, validate, and document the investigation of any unusual transactions.&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
&lt;p style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;If you receive an alert call and email from &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="mailto:TransactionAlert@popularmerchant.com"&gt;TransactionAlert@popularmerchant.com&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;for unusual transactions, it is important to respond promptly so our team can obtain additional information and validate this transaction. If you would like to contact our &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/risk-management/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;fraud monitoring&lt;/a&gt; team directly, please call &lt;strong&gt;(787) 773-5338&lt;/strong&gt; and/or email &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="mailto:TransactionAlert@popularmerchant.com"&gt;TransactionAlert@popularmerchant.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
&lt;p style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;This additional layer of security helps us strengthen our fraud prevention services which, in turn, reduces the operational risk for our merchants and boosts the security of their business transactions. This helps us comply with the credit card network requirements and federal regulations.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Evertec is committed to the implementation of the best practices to offer the highest level of service and security to our customers.</post_excerpt><post_date>2023-04-03 13:23:29</post_date><post_name>get-to-know-our-fraud-monitoring-service</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Conoce-nuestro-servicio-de-monitoreo-de-fraude-evertec.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Merchant (news)</post_category><post_tag>Banks,Comercios,e-commerce,Evertec,Fintech,fraud,fraude,Leaders,merchant,Negocios,online sale,payments,PYMES,Tienda en L&#xED;nea,ventas en l&#xED;nea</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Get to know our fraud monitoring service</title><meta_desc>Evertec is committed to the implementation of best practices to offer the highest level of service and security to our customers.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Get to know our fraud monitoring service</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>La aceleraci&#xF3;n digital tambi&#xE9;n puede ser sin&#xF3;nimo de mayor protecci&#xF3;n</post_title><ID>41709</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;La tecnolog&#xED;a ha tenido un impacto significativo en la industria aseguradora en los &#xFA;ltimos a&#xF1;os. A priori podr&#xED;a pensarse que qued&#xF3; rezagada en relaci&#xF3;n a otros segmentos de la industria, sin embargo, y gracias a su poder de adaptaci&#xF3;n, las predicciones para el 2023 son positivas de acuerdo al estudio realizado por &lt;em&gt;Swiss Re Institute&lt;/em&gt;* el cual se&#xF1;ala que el mercado asegurador mundial mostr&#xF3; una recuperaci&#xF3;n en 2021, con un crecimiento de las primas en t&#xE9;rminos reales del 3,4%.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Para el mercado colombiano, la evoluci&#xF3;n se mantiene ya que ocup&#xF3; el tercer lugar entre los pa&#xED;ses de Am&#xE9;rica Latina con mayor crecimiento, con 10,2%. As&#xED; mismo, entre 88 pa&#xED;ses del mundo, Colombia ocup&#xF3; el lugar 39 en lo que respecta a primas emitidas. Esto implica una leve mejora desde la posici&#xF3;n 40 que ocup&#xF3; en 2020.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Parte de este escenario se debe a que la industria aseguradora no solo ha enfocado sus esfuerzos en la mejora de sus productos, sino en incluir tecnolog&#xED;a que permita generar una mejor experiencia y oferta de valor a sus clientes diversificada y adaptada conforme la sociedad y la tecnolog&#xED;a han avanzado. Ejemplo de esto son los nuevos esquemas de ventas que incluyen seguros parciales, o personalizados a nuevas demandas del mercado. Tambi&#xE9;n el impulso tomado por las startups en el sector, denominadas Insurtech, ha generado una transformaci&#xF3;n de las compa&#xF1;&#xED;as tradicionales que vieron su oferta desactualizada y rezagada frente a estas nuevas empresas &#xE1;giles y m&#xE1;s cercanas al cliente y sus necesidades.&lt;/p&gt;		
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				Seg&#xFA;n Finessa  &#x201C;la aceleraci&#xF3;n digital, si bien trae efectos positivos tambi&#xE9;n implica la aparici&#xF3;n de brechas que los ciberdelincuentes no han dejado escapar, de all&#xED; que el 19.5% de los expertos l&#xED;deres consultados consideran que las fallas de ciberseguridad ser&#xE1;n un riesgo en los pr&#xF3;ximos dos a&#xF1;os (2023-2024).  Por ello las compa&#xF1;&#xED;as de seguros est&#xE1;n incluyendo en su portafolio nuevos productos y servicios orientados a proteger a sus clientes de estos ataques&#x201D; **. 			&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;
		&lt;h2&gt;&#xBF;Cu&#xE1;l es el rol de la tecnolog&#xED;a?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Aqu&#xED; es donde las nuevas tecnolog&#xED;as juegan un rol preponderante, y encontrar socios tecnol&#xF3;gicos que acompa&#xF1;en esas necesidades es clave. Block chain, procesos de Onboarding digital con doble factor de autenticaci&#xF3;n, big data, machine learning, se vuelven parte del lenguaje corriente en las empresas de hoy en d&#xED;a, porque son tecnolog&#xED;as que benefician tanto a empresas como a clientes, permitiendo conocer mejor al cliente, anticipar riesgos, y adaptar los modelos de p&#xF3;liza al comportamiento del asegurado.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Evertec es una compa&#xF1;&#xED;a con amplia trayectoria en el mercado que cuenta con soluciones y servicios que permiten a las aseguradoras centrar sus esfuerzos en su core de negocio: atender mejor a sus clientes, personalizar sus planes y p&#xF3;lizas, mientras Evertec se encarga de agilizar procesos de cobro, seguridad y big data que mejorar&#xE1;n los tiempos de respuesta y la satisfacci&#xF3;n de los asegurados.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;El 2023 sin dudas trae grandes retos, pero tambi&#xE9;n grandes oportunidades para el sector que puede transformar y acelerar la digitalizaci&#xF3;n de sus procesos de la mano de Evertec.&lt;/p&gt;		
		&lt;p&gt;* &lt;a href="https://www.swissre.com/institute/research/sigma-research/Economic-Outlook.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Economic Outlook | Swiss Re&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;**&lt;a href="https://www.finesa.com.co/blog/que-esperar-en-la-industria-aseguradora-para-el-proximo-2023#:~:text=%C2%BFQu%C3%A9%20esperar%20en%20la%20industria%20aseguradora%20para%20el,de%20adaptaci%C3%B3n%2C%20las%20proyecciones%20para%202023%20son%20positivas." target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&#xBF;Qu&#xE9; esperar en la industria aseguradora para el pr&#xF3;ximo 2023? | Blog (finesa.com.co)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.swissre.com/institute/research/sigma-research/Economic-Outlook.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Economic Outlook | Swiss Re&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>El impacto de la transformaci&#xF3;n tecnol&#xF3;gica en el sector asegurador de Colombia</post_excerpt><post_date>2023-04-21 16:52:48</post_date><post_name>la-aceleracion-digital-tambien-puede-ser-sinonimo-de-mayor-proteccion</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/transformacion-tecnologica-sector-asegurador.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Art&#xED;culos</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Opcional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>La aceleraci&#xF3;n digital tambi&#xE9;n puede ser sin&#xF3;nimo de mayor protecci&#xF3;n</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Digital Acceleration Can Also Mean Better Protection</post_title><ID>41724</ID><post_content>In recent years, technology has had a significant impact on the insurance industry. At first, it seem to have been left behind when compared to other business sectors, but thanks to its ability to adapt, projections for 2023 are optimistic, according to the research on economy conducted by Swiss Re Institute*. This research noted that the global insurance market showed signs of recovery in 2021, with premiums exhibiting a real growth rate of 3.4%.&#xD;
&#xD;
The Colombian market continued to perform well, ranking third among Latin American countries with the highest growth rate at 10.2%. In terms of premium volume, Colombia ranked 39th out of 88 countries worldwide. This represents a subtle improvement from 40th place in 2020.&#xD;
&#xD;
This improvement is partly since the insurance industry has not only focused its efforts on improving its products, but also on integrating technology to provide its customers with a better experience and value that adapts as society and technology advance. An example of this are the new sales models that include partial insurance coverage or policies that are tailored to the new demands in the market. The momentum gained in the industry by the startups known as &#x201C;insurtech companies&#x201D; has also led to a transformation in traditional companies after seeing their offering become outdated and lag behind these startups, which are more agile and closer to customers and their needs.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;According to analyses in the aforementioned study, &#x201C;while this digital acceleration brings positive effects, it also results in the emergence of security breaches that have not gone unnoticed by cybercriminals. This is why 19.5% of the leading experts consulted consider that cybersecurity breaches will be a risk over the next two years (2023-2024). Therefore, insurance companies are expanding their portfolios with new products and services aimed at protecting their customers from these attacks.&#x201D; **&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
This is where new technologies play a major role and finding technology partners to address these needs is key. Blockchain, digital onboarding processes with two-factor authentication, big data, and machine learning are all becoming part of the everyday language in modern-day companies, as these are technologies that benefit companies and their customers by allowing them to better understand customers, anticipate risks, and adapt the insurance policy models to the insured's behavior.&#xD;
&#xD;
Evertec is a company with a long track record in the market, offering solutions and services that help insurers focus their efforts on their core line of business: serving their customers better and personalizing their plans and policies, while Evertec takes care of streamlining payment processes, implementing and managing security protocols, and big data to improve response times and customer satisfaction.&#xD;
&#xD;
The year 2023 will certainly bring great challenges, but it will also provide great opportunities for the industry to transform itself and accelerate the digitization of its processes in partnership with Evertec.&#xD;
&#xD;
By Adriana Rojas, Business Manager at Evertec&#xD;
&#xD;
* &lt;a href="https://www.swissre.com/institute/research/sigma-research/Economic-Outlook.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Economic Outlook | Swiss Re&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;
