mitadas en el tiempo para fomentar la compra de esos regalos de &#xFA;ltima hora.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Cuenta con Evertec &lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;para obtener&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soluciones a la medida:&lt;/strong&gt; adaptamos nuestros productos a las necesidades espec&#xED;ficas de tu empresa.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiencia y apoyo:&lt;/strong&gt; contamos con un equipo de expertos siempre dispuesto a ayudarte.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovaci&#xF3;n constante:&lt;/strong&gt; estamos a la vanguardia de la tecnolog&#xED;a, ofreci&#xE9;ndote las &#xFA;ltimas herramientas para crecer.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&#xA1;Cont&#xE1;ctanos al 787-773-7150, opci&#xF3;n 1, y descubre c&#xF3;mo Evertec puede ayudarte a alcanzar tus metas!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>La Navidad es m&#xE1;s que una fecha en el calendario; es una oportunidad &#xFA;nica para que tu negocio prospere. Pero &#xBF;c&#xF3;mo destacar entre la competencia y maximizar tus ventas?</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-12-17 18:09:52</post_date><post_name>guia-definitiva-para-capitalizar-estas-fiestas</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/merchant-diciembre.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Merchant (news)</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Opcional,Opcional,</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Gu&#xED;a definitiva para capitalizar estas fiestas</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Maximize Your Christmas Sales: The Ultimate Business Guide</post_title><ID>61923</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;Look at these proven strategies and innovative solutions that Evertec offers to help boost your business during this festive season.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Simplified&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shopping Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Payment Diversity:&lt;/strong&gt; Offer your customers the flexibility to pay as they prefer, whether with card, ATH M&#xF3;vil, or digital wallets. With solutions like Placetopay, each transaction will be quick and secure.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Streamline Your Processes:&lt;/strong&gt; Reduce queues and improve customer satisfaction with Smart Terminals and interactive kiosks. A seamless shopping experience is key to customer loyalty.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Connect with Your&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customers Personally&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reward Their Loyalty:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement loyalty programs and show your customers how important they are to you. Small gestures make a big difference.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Know Your Audience:&lt;/strong&gt; Use your sales data to personalize your offers and campaigns. With integrated operating systems like Linga by Evertec, you can make data-driven decisions with real-time reports.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Bet on Omnichannel&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell Anywhere, Anytime:&lt;/strong&gt; Offer your customers the ability to shop both online and in your physical store. With a mobile point-of-sale system, you can manage all your sales centrally and in real time.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Use the&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Right Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personalize Your Offers:&lt;/strong&gt; Use your customers&#x2019; data to create personalized and relevant promotions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tell Stories:&lt;/strong&gt; Use the power of storytelling to connect with your customers on a deeper level.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Limited Time Offers:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement time-limited sales strategies to encourage those last-minute gift purchases.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Count on Evertec for&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tailored Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; We adapt our products to the specific needs of your business.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experience and Support: We have a team of experts always ready to help you.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Constant Innovation: We are at the forefront of technology, offering you the latest tools to grow.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contact us at 787-773-7150, option 2, and discover how Evertec can help you reach your goals!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Christmas is more than just a date on the calendar; it&#x2019;s a unique opportunity for your business to thrive. But how can you stand out from the competition and maximize your sales?</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-12-17 18:09:52</post_date><post_name>maximize-your-christmas-sales-the-ultimate-business-guide</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/merchant-diciembre.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Merchant (news)</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elemen