mation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ensure you maintain the integrity of your operations and the trust of your customers by implementing PCI DSS standards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why complete the &lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PCI Questionnaire?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Commitment to safety:&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The main reason for completing the PCI Questionnaire is to protect customers' sensitive information. Payment card details can be a tempting target for cybercriminals, and your customers need to have confidence that their sensitive data is protected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Avoid fines and losses:&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Complying with PCI DSS standards is not only a best practice but, in many cases, a legal requirement for processing debit and credit card payments. Failure to comply can lead to fines, penalties, and the loss of the ability to process card payments, which can impact your business's operations and profitability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Risk mitigation:&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The high direct costs of remediating a security breach, such as notifying customers and offering credit monitoring services, can also significantly damage your organization's reputation. Complying with PCI DSS standards helps reduce these financial risks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Protect your reputation:&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;As you know, customers value the security of their data, and by demonstrating that your business is PCI DSS compliant, you reinforce your customers' trust in your company. Customer trust not only fosters loyalty but can also attract new customers who are looking for security in their transactions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;How to complete the &lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PCI Questionnaire?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before completing the questionnaire&lt;/strong&gt;: Evaluate how your transaction information is handled. This includes reviewing payment processing systems, data storage, and security policies.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn about the requirements of PCI DSS&lt;/strong&gt;: these cover areas such as data protection, vulnerability management, access control, and network monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take the quiz&lt;/strong&gt;: The PCI Quiz is usually divided into sections. Answer each question accurately and have the required documents to prove you comply.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implementing improvements&lt;/strong&gt;: You may need to adjust your security practices. Implement recommendations to address any areas of non-compliance.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;PCI DSS compliance is not a one-time event but an ongoing process. Be sure to regularly review and update your security practices to ensure proper compliance with PCI DSS regulations and the safety of your and your customer's sensitive data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Evertec, we are available to answer your questions. If you have any questions, please call Merchant Solutions at 787-773-5484 using option 1 and then 1.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;References:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.pcidssguide.com/what-are-the-pci-compliance-fines-and-penalties/"&gt;https://www.pcidssguide.com/what-are-the-pci-compliance-fines-and-penalties/&lt;/a&gt;&#x200B;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="https://securityboulevard.com/2022/06/what-are-the-consequences-of-a-data-breach/"&gt;https://securityboulevard.com/2022/06/what-are-the-consequences-of-a-data-breach/&lt;/a&gt;&#x200B;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.techrepublic.com/article/pci-dss-compliance-improving-but-still-lags-highs/"&gt;https://www.techrepublic.com/article/pci-dss-compliance-improving-but-still-lags-highs/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="https://smallbiztrends.com/what-is-pci-compliance/"&gt;https://smallbiztrends.com/what-is-pci-compliance/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/"&gt;https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>As we step into the new year, it&#x2019;s crucial to ensure your data is protected against fraud and your business aligns with the best security practices.</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-12-31 13:37:13</post_date><post_name>keep-your-business-safe-in-2025-the-pci-questionnaire-guide-fb</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/InteligenciaArtificial.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Merchant (news)</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Keep your Business Safe in 2025: The PCI Questionnaire Guide</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>La Tiquetera: Transforming the online shopping experience with technology and innovation</post_title><ID>62557</ID><post_content>Colombian company leader in the sale of tickets for events. Founded in Medell&#xED;n in 2014, it offers an online platform and physical points of sale for users to purchase tickets for shows and events easily and securely.&#xD;
&#xD;
With a customer-centric approach, &lt;a href="https://latiquetera.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;La Tiquetera&lt;/a&gt; stands out for its state-of-the-art technology, high security standards and quality service that meets the needs of both entrepreneurs and buyers.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The challenge&#xD;
&lt;strong&gt;a payment solution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
La Tiquetera, a Colombian company pioneer in the online sale of event tickets, was looking for a payment solution that would allow them to:&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide a secure and reliable shopping experience&lt;/strong&gt;: For La Tiquetera, transaction security was a top priority for its users.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offer a user-friendly and intuitive interface&lt;/strong&gt;: To facilitate the purchase of tickets on their website and from any device.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure online transaction processing&lt;/strong&gt;: Guaranteeing the immediate availability of purchased tickets.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The solution&#xD;
&lt;strong&gt;the positive results&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Evertec, with its extensive experience in the market, became the perfect partner for La Tiquetera. Through its online payment platform solutions, Placetopay, it offered its Web Checkout and Payment Link natively integrated with its security solutions: Scudo and 3DS. With this it achieved:&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize the user experience&lt;/strong&gt;: by integrating a friendly and responsive interface into Web Checkout, which facilitates the purchase of tickets from any device.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offer greater flexibility and efficiency&lt;/strong&gt;: adopting Link de Pagos allowed La Tiquetera to generate customized links for different events and promotions, increasing efficiency and payment options for its customers.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen security&lt;/strong&gt;: through the 3DS protocol and the Scudo anti-fraud solution, they provided an additional layer of protection against online fraud.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
The implementation of Evertec's solutions generated positive results for La Tiquetera:&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Significant reduction in online fraud.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Business growth and increased sales.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Increased efficiency in payment processes.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;More agile and satisfactory shopping experience for users.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Lessons &lt;strong&gt;learned&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;The importance of having a comprehensive payment provider that offers customized solutions tailored to the specific needs of each business.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;The need to prioritize security and fraud prevention to ensure customer confidence and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;The success of the partnership lies in the good attention from Evertec Placetopay and the proper documentation that was shared with us. It has been a joint work that has allowed us to grow and improve processes in order to meet the expectations and needs of all the actors that are part of our ecosystem&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Susana Feria,&#xD;
Manager and Legal Representative&#xD;
La Tiquetera&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2024-12-27 10:07:30</post_date><post_name>la-tiquetera-transforming-the-online-shopping</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/LaTiquetera.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>Evertec Colombia,La Tiquetera,link de pagos,Placetopay,web checkout</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>La Tiquetera: Transforming the online shopping experience with technology and innovation</title><meta_desc>Evertec became the perfect ally for La Tiquetera with the solutions of its online payment platform, Placetopay.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Evertec became the perfect ally for La Tiquetera</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>E-commerce security: a key challenge for sustainable growth in Colombia</post_title><ID>62577</ID><post_content>According to Statista, the sector is projected to grow by 60% between 2022 and 2027. This boom is confirmed by figures from ImpactoTIC, which indicate a 10.4% increase in online sales during the second quarter of 2024, compared to the same period last year.&#xD;
&#xD;
However, this accelerated growth brings with it a crucial challenge: ensuring the security of electronic transactions. For e-commerce to continue to thrive, it is essential that all players in the digital ecosystem (payment gateways, acquirers, issuers, franchises, etc.) work together to provide secure environments that minimize the risk of fraud and strengthen user confidence.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Security trends&#xD;
&lt;strong&gt;for e-commerce&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;ol&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tokenization&lt;/strong&gt;: This technology has become a key element in protecting sensitive customer data, replacing card information with unique and useless tokens for cybercriminals. Tokenization not only reduces the risk of fraud, but also simplifies the payment process and improves the user experience.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-factor authentication (MFA)&lt;/strong&gt;: MFA adds an additional layer of security by requiring users to verify their identity through multiple factors, such as passwords, biometrics or one-time codes.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transactional behavior monitoring&lt;/strong&gt;: Real-time analysis of user behavior allows identifying suspicious patterns and proactively preventing fraud.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data encryption&lt;/strong&gt;: Encryption of sensitive information during transmission and storage is critical to protect customer data and comply with security regulations.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Artificial Intelligence (AI)&lt;/strong&gt;: AI is increasingly being used to detect and prevent fraud in real time by analyzing large volumes of data and identifying suspicious patterns.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ol&gt;&#xD;
This is why companies like Evertec Placetopay guarantee maximum security in each transaction, offering scalable solutions that adapt to the needs of each business.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DianaArboleda-150x150.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" srcset="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DianaArboleda-150x150.jpg 150w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DianaArboleda.jpg 300w" alt="" width="150" height="150" /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Security in e-commerce is a crucial factor for the sustainable growth of the sector. By implementing advanced security solutions and prioritizing consumer confidence, companies can drive e-commerce adoption and contribute to the development of the digital economy in Colombia.&#xD;
&lt;h4&gt;Diana Arboleda&amp;lt;/h4 &amp;gt; Evertec&#xD;
