&lt;!-- .lae-testimonial-user --&gt;&#xD;
&lt;!-- .lae-testimonial --&gt;&#xD;
&lt;!-- .lae-testimonials --&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>E-commerce in Colombia has experienced an unprecedented boom in the last decade, becoming a fundamental pillar for business growth.  The accessibility, speed and reliability of digital platforms have driven their adoption, positioning Colombia as the third largest online commerce market in Latin America by 2022.</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-12-27 12:05:32</post_date><post_name>ecommerce-security-in-colombia</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/auge-comercio-electronico.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag>Autenticaci&#xF3;n multifactor,comercio electr&#xF3;nico,Evertec Colombia,inteligencia artificial,tokenizaci&#xF3;n</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>E-commerce security: a key challenge for sustainable growth in Colombia</title><meta_desc>Electronic commerce in Colombia has experienced an unprecedented boom in the last decade, becoming a fundamental pillar...</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>E-commerce in Colombia</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Key technology trends for businesses in 2025</post_title><ID>62584</ID><post_content>With this in mind, here are three key technology trends that will set the course for 2025:&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;1. Artificial &lt;strong&gt;intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Is here to stay 2024 cemented the potential of artificial intelligence (AI) as a transformative tool for business. Leading companies such as Amazon and Netflix have embraced AI to significantly improve the user experience (Business Insider 2021). For example, Amazon uses advanced AI algorithms to personalize product recommendations based on customers' previous behavior, a strategy that has increased both loyalty and sales. In fact, a McKinsey report (2020) estimates that approximately 35% of Amazon's sales are generated by AI-based personalized recommendations.&#xD;
&#xD;
While 2024 was a year of experimentation, 2025 will be the time to integrate AI into daily business operations. However, its implementation is not an immediate or straightforward process. It requires a clear strategy aligned with business objectives, investments in tools and training, robust data governance, adequate technology infrastructure and the support of experts with industry-specific knowledge of each business.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;2. Cybersecurity&#xD;
&lt;strong&gt;is not a luxury, it is a necessity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Cybersecurity has become a strategic priority for companies of all sizes. What was once a subject reserved for specialists now occupies a central place on the business agenda. No company is exempt from cyber threats, and attacks have increased in frequency and complexity. According to a report by Symantec (2022), the global cost of cyberattacks could exceed $10 trillion annually by 2025.&#xD;
&#xD;
In an increasingly digitized environment, companies must prioritize cybersecurity as an operational and budgetary pillar. Implementing robust defense strategies, combined with constant monitoring and advanced solutions, will be key to mitigating risks and protecting business continuity.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;3. Tokenization&#xD;
&lt;strong&gt;as a competitive advantage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
In a world where data privacy and security are priorities, tokenization emerges as a key solution. This process makes it possible to replace sensitive data, such as credit card numbers, with unique identifiers or &#x201C;tokens&#x201D; that cannot be used outside the system for which they were generated. Tokenization protects customer information and reduces the risk of fraud, and is particularly valuable in sectors such as e-commerce, banking and digital payments.&#xD;
&#xD;
In addition, tokenization is also an enabler for innovation, allowing for more secure and seamless transactions in highly connected ecosystems. Companies that adopt this technology will not only strengthen their cybersecurity posture, but also gain the trust of their customers, differentiating themselves in an increasingly competitive market.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Looking towards the future&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
2025 will bring challenges and opportunities for companies looking to stay on the cutting edge of technology. At Evertec, we offer a wide range of solutions designed to optimize business operations and securely lead digital transformation. From cybersecurity services to AI, tokenization and DCC solutions, our innovations are designed to help your business reach its full potential.</post_content><post_excerpt>Innovation, Cybersecurity and Tokenization as pillars of business success.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xD;
&lt;b&gt;In an increasingly digitized business world, technology has become the engine of innovation and competitiveness, consolidating itself as a key differentiator in virtually all sectors of the economy.&lt;/b&gt; However, the technological strategies that worked yesterday no longer guarantee future success. Companies that fail to adapt to new technological trends will not only fall behind but could face failure.</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-12-18 16:15:15</post_date><post_name>key-technology-trends-for-businesses-in-2025-latam</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/tendencias-tecnologicas.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Key technology trends for businesses in 2025</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Banco de Costa Rica and Evertec: Driving Innovation in Payment Solutions</post_title><ID>62643</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;The Challenge:&#xD;
Thriving in a Highly Competitive Market competitivo&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
In the payments sector, particularly in payment acquisition, the market is often saturated with technological options, making innovation essential for staying ahead. With a strong foundation in traditional banking, BCR aimed to provide agile, secure, and technologically advanced solutions to meet the demands of a dynamic market where consumers expect faster, easier, and safer services.&#xD;
&#xD;
Businesses, especially small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs), required tools to efficiently and securely accept electronic payments. However, they often faced challenges due to inadequate infrastructure and the perception that adopting new technologies could be costly and complex.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The Solution:&#xD;
Technological Innovation and Strategic Collaboration&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
To meet market demands, &lt;a href="https://www.bancobcr.com/wps/portal/bcr" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Banco de Costa Rica&lt;/a&gt; strengthened its partnership with Evertec, a leader in payment and financial technology solutions. This transition from a vendor-client relationship to a strategic alliance was crucial in developing innovative solutions tailored to the local market and positioned BCR as a leader in the payment industry.&#xD;
&#xD;
Through this collaboration, Banco de Costa Rica introduced technologies that had previously only been accessible in more developed markets, enabling its customers to compete globally. One of the most notable innovations was the implementation of &lt;strong&gt;Tap M&#xF3;vil&lt;/strong&gt;, a solution that allows small and medium-sized businesses to accept electronic payments using only mobile phones. This eliminates the need for expensive traditional point-of-sale terminals. This technology empowered entrepreneurs, including artisans and small business owners, by providing secure, efficient, and user-friendly payment solutions, opening doors to new customers and markets, including international ones.&#xD;
&#xD;
Additionally, Evertec provided advanced tools to &lt;strong&gt;enhance security and efficiency in e-commerce&lt;/strong&gt;. With new wired and wireless payment terminals, BCR could offer customized solutions for both traditional and online businesses, improving the customer experience with each transaction. Security, a critical aspect of electronic payments, was prioritized across all implemented solutions, ensuring secure transactions and reducing the risk of fraud..&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The Results:&#xD;
Growth, Innovation, and Market Expansion&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
The results of this strategic alliance have been impressive. Since its implementation, Banco de Costa Rica has established itself as an innovative leader in state banking, recognized for its ability to adopt new technologies and its commitment to providing solutions that genuinely enhance its customers' lives. The integration of tools such as e-commerce, digital wallets, and mobile payment solutions has transformed how the bank&#x2019;s customers conduct business.&#xD;
&#xD;
One of the most significant impacts has been on small artisans who previously only accepted cash payments. With the introduction of electronic payment solutions, these small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) have expanded their markets, reached international clients, and increased their sales. This technology has enabled Costa Rican artisanal products to access a wider audience, allowing small businesses to compete more effectively against larger companies.&#xD;
&#xD;
Moreover, many small and medium-sized businesses have experienced substantial growth in sales due to the adoption of electronic payments. The ability to accept credit and debit cards has helped these businesses double or even triple their sales by attracting a broader customer base and simplifying the payment process through a new sales channel.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;This partnership between BCR and Evertec allows us to dream and envision beyond our current achievements. It brings new technologies and faster, safer, and simpler payment solutions to facilitate sales. In today&#x2019;s fast-paced business environment, having a commercial and strategic partner to keep pace with the market is essential. Evertec has been instrumental in supporting us on this journey of innovation and security, helping BCR and its customers grow&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Guillermo Gayle&#xD;
Gerente de Innovaci&#xF3;n y Medio de Pago, Banco de Costa Rica.&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Looking Ahead:&#xD;
Continuing Innovation and Expanding Impact&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;Our partnership with Banco de Costa Rica positions us as a strategic ally in their mission to innovate and lead the payment solutions sector in Costa Rica. It has enabled us to enhance their technological platform by implementing advanced solutions that meet market demands and customer needs. At Evertec, we are excited to continue collaborating with BCR to identify and develop products that facilitate access to electronic payment solutions and contribute to business growth in Costa Rica&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt; Juan Jos&#xE9; Abbiati&#xD;
Commercial Head NOLA de Evertec&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
This collaboration serves as a clear example of how strategic partnerships can drive business innovation and growth, especially in the highly competitive payment solutions sector. Thanks to Evertec&#x2019;s advanced technology and customer-centric approach, Banco de Costa Rica has maintained its position at the forefront of innovation, consistently prioritizing the security and satisfaction of its customers.</post_content><post_excerpt>&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.bancobcr.com/wps/portal/bcr" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Banco de Costa Rica  (BCR)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;), one of the cornerstones of state banking in Costa Rica, has undergone a transformation in recent years, focusing on technological innovation. This shift has been largely enabled by its strategic partnership with Evertec&#x2014;a collaboration that has empowered the bank to enhance its services and products, offering solutions that benefit thousands of customers, ranging from small businesses to large enterprises.</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-12-24 10:22:05</post_date><post_name>banco-de-costa-rica-and-evertec-driving-innovation-in-payment-solutions</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/BCR-innovacion-en-medios-de-pago.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag/><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Banco de Costa Rica and Evertec: Driving Innovation in Payment Solutions</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword/><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>A 3 a&#xF1;os, PSD Corp. sigue potenciando su crecimiento con Acumatica ERP y Evertec</post_title><ID>62652</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;El desaf&#xED;o:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
La relaci&#xF3;n entre PSD Corp. y Evertec comenz&#xF3; en 2020, cuando la empresa enfrentaba la necesidad de modernizar y centralizar sus operaciones para mantenerse competitiva en su industria. El principal reto era la falta de integraci&#xF3;n entre sus sistemas, lo que creaba silos y generaba ineficiencias en su operaci&#xF3;n. La compa&#xF1;&#xED;a buscaba una soluci&#xF3;n tecnol&#xF3;gica moderna y escalable que les permitiera optimizar sus procesos, mejorar la toma de decisiones y adaptarse a las crecientes demandas del mercado.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;La soluci&#xF3;n:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Tras evaluar las operaciones de PSD Corp., Evertec recomend&#xF3; la implementaci&#xF3;n de &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/acumatica-erp/"&gt;Acumatica ERP&lt;/a&gt;, destacando su facilidad de uso, flexibilidad y capacidad de integraci&#xF3;n con aplicaciones de terceros. Adem&#xE1;s, Acumatica les permitir&#xED;a incorporar herramientas m&#xF3;viles para que su personal de campo utilizase dispositivos port&#xE1;tiles en los sitios de los clientes.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Implementaci&#xF3;n:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
El equipo de Evertec complet&#xF3; exitosamente la implementaci&#xF3;n de Acumatica en 3 meses en abril de 2021. El equipo evalu&#xF3; todos los procesos de la empresa, identificando desaf&#xED;os y oportunidades dentro de su operaci&#xF3;n. La comunicaci&#xF3;n abierta y sincera entre ambos equipos ayud&#xF3; a establecer una relaci&#xF3;n s&#xF3;lida, lo que permiti&#xF3; a PSD Corp. estar completamente preparada y confiada antes, durante y despu&#xE9;s de la implementaci&#xF3;n. Este apoyo ha continuado desde la implementaci&#xF3;n y ha sido esencial en la optimizaci&#xF3;n de nuestros sistemas y procesos.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;Un factor clave para el &#xE9;xito de la implementaci&#xF3;n fue el compromiso y la experiencia del equipo de Evertec."&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;El resultado:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
La implementaci&#xF3;n de Acumatica ERP ha tra&#xED;do mejoras significativas a las operaciones de PSD Corp., acelerando muchos de los procesos que antes se realizaban manualmente. Tres a&#xF1;os despu&#xE9;s de la implementaci&#xF3;n, N&#xE9;stor D&#xE1;vila, presidente de PSD Corp., comparte en este video c&#xF3;mo Acumatica ERP ha transformado la forma en que opera la empresa.&#xD;
&#xD;
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P3DnikjlmF0&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;Hemos automatizado procesos y centralizado los datos de una manera que ha transformado completamente nuestra operaci&#xF3;n. Con el apoyo de Evertec, seguimos modernizando y mejorando nuestro negocio, lo cual nos ha ayudado significativamente en el crecimiento que estamos experimentando.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;N&#xE9;stor D. D&#xE1;vila,&#xD;
Presidente PSD Corp.&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
Gracias a la colaboraci&#xF3;n con Evertec, PSD Corp. ha logrado una digitalizaci&#xF3;n completa de sus operaciones. Acumatica ERP ha permitido a la empresa adaptarse con &#xE9;xito a las crecientes demandas del mercado y ha potenciado su crecimiento, flexibilidad y progreso.&#xD;
