ando de procesos que han permitido una mayor eficiencia y la reducci&#xF3;n de errores.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Evertec se convirti&#xF3; en el aliado perfecto para QualityIS</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Digital Transformation: How QualityIS Modernized its Business Management with Acumatica</post_title><ID>62682</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;QualityIS Needed to&#xD;
Modernize Its Technology&#xD;
Infrastructure&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The Challenge:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
QualityIS faced several operational challenges due to an outdated ERP system that did not offer adequate solutions for retail or e-commerce, limiting the company&#x2019;s ability to integrate efficiently into an online sales environment. The online store operated independently, requiring manual import of orders and manual processes in the POS system. These challenges led QualityIS to seek a modern solution that could centralize and automate its operations.&#xD;
&#xD;
The motivation to change came after a recommendation from an existing client who had experienced a significant improvement in their operations thanks to Evertec&#x2019;s services. QualityIS needed to modernize its technology infrastructure to improve access to information and streamline business processes.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evertec Accelerates&#xD;
QualityIS&#x2019;s Success&#xD;
with Automatio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;n&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The solution:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
To address these issues, QualityIS implemented Acumatica, an advanced ERP system offered by Evertec. This solution allowed integration of the 1Retail POS and a connector to BigCommerce, providing a unified platform that automates and connects all operations. The implementation of Acumatica has facilitated process management, significantly reducing errors and accelerating decision-making. The implementation took place in 2022 and was completed in approximately four months. The success of the project was largely due to the continuous support from Evertec's implementation team, which worked closely with QualityIS throughout the process.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The result:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
The implementation of Acumatica significantly transformed QualityIS&#x2019;s operations. The automation of processes has led to greater efficiency and a substantial reduction in errors.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;Processing times have been drastically reduced, allowing tasks that previously took days to be completed with just the push of a button. This agility not only improves customer satisfaction but also frees up resources to focus on critical areas of the business, contributing to QualityIS&#x2019;s continued growth and success.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Daniel Abarca,&#xD;
President QualityIS&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
For more information on how Acumatica can optimize your operations, visit &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/acumatica-erp/"&gt;www.evertecinc.com/en/acumatica-erp/&lt;/a&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>QualityIS (Quality Industrial Safety Corp.), founded in 1990, is a leading Puerto Rican company specializing in the sale and distribution of tools and BBQs. With a workforce of 24 employees and three stores&#x2014;two focused on tools and one on BBQs&#x2014;QualityIS has established itself as a leader in its sector. The company offers products from renowned brands like Milwaukee, Makita, Ridgid, and Klein, as well as a wide range of professional tools for technicians, plumbers, contractors, mechanics, electricians, and woodworkers, among others. QualityIS stands out in the market for its competitive prices and commitment to customer satisfaction.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-01-27 20:29:10</post_date><post_name>digital-transformation-how-qualityis-modernized-its-business-management-with-acumatica</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/qualityis.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>Acumatica,ERP,Evertec,Puerto Rico,QualityIS</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Digital Transformation: How QualityIS Modernized its Business Management with Acumatica</title><meta_desc>Acumatica transformed QualityIS, automating processes that have enabled greater efficiency and reduced errors</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Evertec became the perfect ally for QualityIS</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Three Years Later, PSD Corp. Continues to Fuel Its Growth with Acumatica ERP and Evertec</post_title><ID>62703</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;The challenge:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
The relationship between PSD Corp. and Evertec began in 2020 when the company faced the need to modernize and centralize its operations to remain competitive in its industry. The main challenge was the lack of integration between its systems, which created silos and generated inefficiencies in its operation. The company was seeking a modern, scalable technological solution that would allow it to optimize processes, improve decision-making, and adapt to the growing demands of the market.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The solution:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
After evaluating PSD Corp.'s operations, Evertec recommended the implementation of Acumatica ERP, highlighting its ease of use, flexibility, and ability to integrate with third-party applications. Additionally, Acumatica would allow the company to incorporate mobile tools, enabling its field staff to use portable devices on customer sites.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Implementation:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
The Evertec team successfully completed the Acumatica implementation in 3 months, in April 2021. The team evaluated all of the company's processes, identifying challenges and opportunities within its operations. Open and honest communication between both teams helped establish a strong relationship, allowing PSD Corp. to be fully prepared and confident before, during, and after the implementation. This support has continued since the implementation and has been essential in optimizing our systems and processes.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;A key factor for the success of the implementation was the commitment and experience of the Evertec team.&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The result:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
The implementation of Acumatica ERP has brought significant improvements to PSD Corp.'s operations, accelerating many processes that were previously manual. Three years after the implementation, N&#xE9;stor D&#xE1;vila, President of PSD Corp., shares in this video how Acumatica ERP has transformed the way the company operates.&#xD;
&#xD;
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P3DnikjlmF0&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;We have automated processes and centralized data in a way that has completely transformed our operations. With Evertec&#x2019;s support, we continue to modernize and improve our business, which has significantly helped the growth we are experiencing.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;N&#xE9;stor D. D&#xE1;vila,&#xD;
President PSD Corp.&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
Thanks to its collaboration with Evertec, PSD Corp. has achieved full digitalization of its operations. Acumatica ERP has allowed the company to successfully adapt to the growing demands of the market and has fueled its growth, flexibility, and progress.&#xD;
&#xD;
To learn more about Acumatica, visit &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/acumatica-erp/"&gt;www.evertecinc.com/en/acumatica-erp/&lt;/a&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>PSD Corp. (Professional Sealing Devices, Corp.) is a Puerto Rican company founded in 2001 by N&#xE9;stor D. D&#xE1;vila, headquartered in San Juan, Puerto Rico. PSD Corp. employs a team of 16 people and specializes in products and services related to fluid handling and transfer. The company offers a wide range of solutions, including consulting, parts and equipment supply, engineering, maintenance, and repair of various industrial devices such as pumps, valves, mechanical seals, transmissions, rotating equipment, and tanks. Its commitment to quality, innovation, and customer service has positioned PSD Corp. as a leader in the industrial solutions market in Puerto Rico.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-01-27 20:44:45</post_date><post_name>three-years-later-psd-corp-continues-to-fuel-its-growth-with-acumatica-erp-and-evertec</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/PSD-Corp.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>Acumatica,ERP,Evertec,PSD Corp.,Puerto Rico</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Three Years Later, PSD Corp. Continues to Fuel Its Growth with Acumatica ERP and Evertec</title><meta_desc>The implementation of Acumatica ERP has improvements to PSD Corp.&#x2019;s operations, accelerating many processes that were previously manual.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Evertec became the perfect partner for PSD Corp.</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Mercado Libre and Evertec Transform Card Issuance in Latin America</post_title><ID>62737</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mercado Libre&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the leading e-commerce platform in Latin America, Mercado Libre recognized the need for a technology partner to support its card issuance strategy across multiple markets, including credit, debit, and prepaid cards. The partnership initially started in Mexico and later expanded to Chile. Thanks to its recognized expertise and technological capabilities, Evertec emerged as the ideal ally for this endeavor. Together, they implemented advanced systems that adhered to stringent security and efficiency standards while maintaining the necessary agility to adapt to market dynamics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pioneering &lt;br /&gt;Card Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;In 2019, Mercado Libre began its ambitious venture into the card market, selecting Evertec as its strategic partner to facilitate the launch. This collaboration led to the successful introduction of a Mastercard-branded, fully digital debit card in 2020. A standout innovation was the QR code-based activation system.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Following the success in Mexico and with support from Evertec's specialized team, Mercado Libre expanded into Chile's prepaid card market the following year. This product, linked to a digital account, quickly gained popularity and earned recognition from Chile's Financial Market Commission (CMF) as the leading non-bank issuer of payment solutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Building on the success of its debit card in Mexico, Mercado Libre launched a credit card in collaboration with Visa as part of its second phase.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The Regional Challenge: &lt;br /&gt;Scaling Payment Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;The success of debit cards in Mexico has allowed Mercado Libre to address the complexities of launching regional payment products. Expanding into the prepaid card market in Chile required adapting to diverse market dynamics and local regulatory requirements. With Evertec's expertise, this regional rollout was executed seamlessly, ensuring compliance and effectively addressing local needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A significant challenge was continuously refining the technological platform to provide optimal user experiences and facilitate efficient transactions. Evertec tackled this by making ongoing adjustments and optimizations, ensuring the platform evolved in response to market demands. Strong communication between the two companies was crucial in meeting client needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The launch of credit cards in 2022 added another layer of complexity, necessitating Evertec's integration of advanced systems for processing, back-office operations, and credit core management. Supported by PayStudio, Evertec delivered the project on time, ensuring the system's full functionality.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Collaboration with Visa was also essential for the credit card launch. Evertec played a key role in facilitating this strategic partnership, which enhanced Mercado Libre's financial product offerings and reinforced its position in the regional market. The successful launch in Mexico marked a significant milestone in Mercado Libre's expansion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Early Results: &lt;br /&gt;Debit Card Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;The combined efforts of both teams have led to remarkable success for the debit card in Mexico. Mercado Libre has issued over 8 million debit cards, which manage an average of 10 million monthly transactions. This substantial volume reflects the market's confidence in the efficiency of the services and solutions provided.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Credit Card Impact&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since its launch, the credit card service has experienced significant growth, with over 1.7 million accounts and more than 3 million cards issued. These cards have facilitated over 8.4 million transactions, highlighting Evertec's effectiveness in managing financial services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prepaid Card &lt;br /&gt;Success in Chile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;In Chile, the introduction of prepaid cards has also been successful, with more than 1.1 million cards issued since their launch in 2022. These cards process over 2 million transactions monthly, showcasing Evertec's ability to meet market demands with innovative and efficient payment solutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Model for Future Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;This success story highlights the transformative impact of fintech in Latin America, establishing a foundation for future collaborations and advancements within the sector. The ongoing innovation and adaptability of Evertec and Mercado Libre have solidified their leadership roles in the electronic payment revolution and in promoting financial inclusion throughout the region.&lt;/p&gt;		
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				Mercado Libre challenged us to push our limits at every turn. In their fast-paced environment, speed of response is crucial. This client embraces a high level of risk and continually questions the status quo. We rose to the challenge, delivering agility and efficiency in meeting their demands.			&lt;/p&gt;
											&lt;cite&gt;Juan Abbiati&lt;br&gt;Commercial Head of NOLA.&lt;/cite&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Latin America's financial technology landscape constantly evolves, presenting both opportunities and challenges. In response to this dynamic environment, a strategic alliance between Evertec and Mercado Libre has emerged as a hub of innovation and efficiency. Since its establishment in 2019, this collaboration has introduced advanced technological solutions for issuing and processing digital payments. It has significantly transformed electronic payment transactions through key projects launched in Mexico and Chile.</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-09-10 21:31:20</post_date><post_name>mercado-libre-and-evertec-transform-card-issuance-in-latin-america</post_name><post_author>cmoya</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/MercadoLibre.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>emisi&#xF3;n de tarjetas,Evertec,mercado libre,tarjetas</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Mercado Libre and Evertec Transform Card Issuance in Latin America</title><meta_desc/><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>alianza estrat&#xE9;gica entre Evertec y Mercado Libre</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec and Grupo Santander: Transforming Financial Experience in Latin America</post_title><ID>62743</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;Grupo Santander&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since entering Chile in 1978, Banco Santander Chile has become a leading financial institution. With 259 branches and over four million customers, the bank is recognized for its strong economic performance and profitability. Banco Santander Chile also caters to more than two million digital customers, demonstrating its commitment to innovation and service excellence. The bank's success is rooted in a strategy focused on financial specialization, effective risk management, and active market participation, all supported by Grupo Santander's extensive international network.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The partnership between Evertec and Grupo Santander began in 1996 with the implementation of the Automated Clearing Center (CCA), which enabled electronic payments between banks and set the foundation for mass payment processing and electronic funds transfers (EFT). Over the years, Evertec has played a pivotal role in developing advanced technological solutions that have diversified and improved the financial services Grupo Santander offers in the region. This collaboration has reinforced Evertec's position as a leader in the financial industry, showcasing its ability to adapt to and meet the evolving demands of the fintech market.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Technological &lt;br /&gt;and Security Challenges&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;From the beginning, the partnership between Evertec and Grupo Santander has encountered significant technical challenges, particularly in technology and security. The rapid increase in digital financial transactions has necessitated solutions that ensure agility, efficiency, and security. In response, Evertec has introduced several innovations, such as the REI system for ATM management, electronic pension payment solutions, and multi-bank debit models. These initiatives have enhanced Grupo Santander's customer experience and established both companies as leaders in the digital transformation of the region's financial sector.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In 2020, Getnet achieved notable milestones. It established the Santander Getnet Chile S.A. Payment Card Operator in May and launched a pilot program in September. Throughout the year, Getnet received authorization from the Comisi&#xF3;n para el Mercado Financiero (CMF) to operate in January and began commercializing its services in February. Despite challenges posed by the pandemic, by March, the company had onboarded 10,000 merchants. By September, the number of point-of-sale (POS) terminals sold had reached 41,000, distributed across more than 30,000 merchants nationwide. By October, Getnet had 37,000 clients, and by the end of the year, it had acquired over 68,000 merchants, generating 3 billion CLP in commission revenues.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The company initially projected onboarding 20,000 merchants by 2021 but far exceeded this goal. "Our target for 2021 was to reach 25,000 merchants, but we surpassed 56,000," stated Cristi&#xE1;n Peirano Novoa, Getnet's president in 2021. Today, the company operates in 99% of the national territory, including Easter Island and the Juan Fern&#xE1;ndez archipelago&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Grupo Santander &lt;br /&gt;Stands Out in the Market&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;The entrance of a new acquirer into the market created fresh opportunities for Grupo Santander, spurring national economic growth and enhancing Evertec's presence in the region. With Evertec's robust technological solutions, Grupo Santander quickly established itself by offering high-quality payment processing services. This attracted over 4,000 large companies for card payment processing and connected over 50,000 merchants within the first year, 93% of them being SMEs, entrepreneurs, and local businesses. That same year, Getnet expanded its reach to cover 97% of Chilean municipalities, providing nationwide access to innovative financial services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In 2023, an agreement was made to implement solutions for managing over 2,000 Banco Santander ATMs in Chile. This further solidified both companies' operational efficiency and presence in the region, reaffirming their commitment to continuous innovation and excellence in financial services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Evertec and Grupo Santander remain focused on innovation and the constant improvement of their services. Their ability to quickly adapt to market demands and anticipate emerging challenges will be crucial in maintaining their leadership in the fintech sector. This strategic collaboration has fostered economic and social growth in Latin America, paved the way for new opportunities, and expanded their influence in the regional financial landscape.&lt;/p&gt;		
