&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" srcset="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook.jpg 1200w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-300x87.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-1024x298.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-768x223.jpg 768w" alt="" width="1200" height="349" /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>&lt;i&gt;No hay que bajar la guardia en este 18 de septiembre extendido. Es clave seguir protegiendo nuestra informaci&#xF3;n financiera, insisti&#xF3; Pablo Huircapan, director de IT - Ops de Evertec SOLA.&lt;/i&gt;</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-09-01 12:16:04</post_date><post_name>fiestas-patrias-2024-recomendaciones-para-el-uso-seguro-de-pagos-electronicos-y-evitar-fraudes-bancarios</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Seguridad-en-pagos-electronicos-2024.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Noticias</post_category><post_tag>c&#xF3;digos QR falsos,compras online seguras,estafas digitales,Evertec,evitar fraudes bancarios,fiestas patrias 2024,pagos con tarjeta,pagos electr&#xF3;nicos seguros,phishing,Protecci&#xF3;n de Datos,seguridad financiera</post_tag><translation_priority>Opcional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Seguridad en pagos electr&#xF3;nicos 2024%%page%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Protege tu informaci&#xF3;n financiera en Fiestas Patrias 2024. Sigue estos consejos para evitar fraudes y pagar de forma segura.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Seguridad en pagos electr&#xF3;nicos en Fiestas Patrias 2024</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>The Age of Digital Wallets: Changing the Game for Chilean and Latin American Consumers</post_title><ID>63819</ID><post_content>According to a report by Statista, the number of &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/mobile-wallet/"&gt;digital wallet&lt;/a&gt; users in the region is projected to exceed 300 million by 2025. Chile has been no exception: a study by the Santiago Chamber of Commerce reveals that 65% of digital consumers in the country already use this type of solution to make daily payments.&#xD;
&#xD;
However, this phenomenon should be analyzed from several perspectives. Like &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;digital payments&lt;/a&gt;, at the time, virtual wallets follow the common factor of generating greater financial inclusion. By breaking down barriers to access, more banking services are available to a larger percentage of the population, eliminating traditional gaps and barriers to entry, such as the need to maintain a minimum balance or have a bank account.&#xD;
&#xD;
The boom is not only in response to the digitization of payments, but is also facilitating access in sectors historically underserved by traditional banking, such as rural areas and lower-income groups.&#xD;
&#xD;
Platforms such as Google Wallet, Apple Wallet and other similar financial applications, such as Mercado Pago, Mach, Tenpo, BE Pay, among others, have introduced accessible and secure tools in Chile, gaining ground thanks to their commission-free services and their focus on agile user experiences, which reduce the gap to access digital banking.&#xD;
&#xD;
Likewise, the Latin American consumer has changed its purchasing and financial consumption habits significantly, with one of the main consequences being a greater participation in the economic system. According to the World Bank, 55% of adults in Latin America do not have access to a formal bank account, but do have access to a smartphone. On the other hand, we see more fintechs offering microcredit directly from their platforms, based on transaction histories. Thus, they have been expanding access to credit in underserved sectors.&#xD;
&#xD;
Another relevant aspect is the user experience, where simplicity and speed are key. New consumers, especially Millennials and Generation Z, value instant transactions and a simpler, more intuitive experience: in Chile, 70% of digital wallet users say that ease of use is the main reason for adopting these technologies.&#xD;
&#xD;
Finally, digital wallets have driven a shift towards e-commerce, favoring new consumption habits. &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://americasmi.com/insights/tendencias-comercio-electronico-compradores-en-linea-america-latina/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;In 2023, more than 50% of online purchases in Latin America will use digital wallets&lt;/a&gt;, according to a report by Americas Market Intelligence. This behavior has also benefited small businesses, which now compete on equal terms with large retailers, thanks to the acceptance of digital payments.&#xD;
&#xD;
On the horizon, progress toward integrating AI into account, savings and expense management is expected. However, to make this change sustainable, it requires all market players - banks and financial institutions, businesses, governments, users and technology support companies - to become secure, reliable, properly regulated and resilient platforms.&#xD;
&#xD;
In Chile, with the current pace of adoption and technological advances, it is highly likely that digital wallets will not only consolidate as an essential payment tool, but also drive new business models and greater financial inclusion.</post_content><post_excerpt>Digital wallets have revolutionized the way we make payments, facilitating fast and secure transactions, reducing financial gaps and breaking down barriers of traditional banking. These are just some of the factors that explain, to a large extent, the phenomenon that they have experienced in Chile and the region. In 2023, the use of digital wallets in Latin America reached a historic growth, driven by a 30% increase in digital transactions compared to the previous year.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-03-14 16:31:55</post_date><post_name>the-age-of-digital-wallets-changing-the-game-for-chilean-and-latin-american-consumers</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Billeteras-digitales-en-America-Latina.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag>billeteras digitales,comercio electr&#xF3;nico,banca digital,Evertec,inclusi&#xF3;n financiera,fintech en Chile,mercado fintech,Latin America,Pagos digitales,transacciones digitales,billeteras virtuales</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Digital Wallets in Latin America %%page%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Digital wallets are transforming payments in Chile and Latin America, driving financial inclusion and e-commerce growth.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Digital wallets in Chile and Latin America</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Cybersecurity: Are you ready for the battle ahead?</post_title><ID>63821</ID><post_content>Unfortunately, this ranking shows a partial reality of our country.&#xA0; In this context, it is important to point out that in Chile only 80% of large companies have dedicated &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/fraud-monitoring-and-prevention/riskcenter360/"&gt;cybersecurity&lt;/a&gt; teams, a figure that decreases to 30% in the case of SMEs (according to IT Hunter International), a situation that is worrying since ransomware attacks alone increased by 300% in 2023, mainly affecting banks, insurance companies and telecommunications companies, which indirectly affect people and their credibility in terms of how our information is being handled.&#xD;
&#xD;
It is key for companies to understand the depth of this situation, and that information security must be part of the decisions made by boards of directors and senior management, because in companies that are attacked and do not have a plan to deal with this type of event, the trust of their customers is considerably reduced.&#xD;
&#xD;
On the other hand, Chile is one of the most advanced countries in terms of transactions, &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;online payments&lt;/a&gt;, banking and personal information, it is a leader in Latin America in business development and electronic transactions. Without going any further, our authorities are working on the regulation that establishes the Open Finance System (SFA) of the Fintech Law, which will open business opportunities, but at the same time requires a joint security work, where the public and private sectors must contribute to ensure the personal and financial information of all.&#xD;
&#xD;
That said, it is important that companies are prepared for what is coming, this should be from the Governance (senior management and boards) and finance (budgets), on the other hand, at the specialized level the preparation of equipment and tools are the basis for starting this path, as well as preparations of cyber-attack exercises and continuity plans that allow us to minimize the risks to these cyber-attacks that year after year are growing.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;a href="https://soluciones.evertecinc.com/riskcenter360-0" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&#xD;
&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" srcset="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook.jpg 1200w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-300x87.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-1024x298.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-768x223.jpg 768w" alt="" width="1200" height="349" /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>This year Chile climbed 30 places in the National Cyber Security Index (NCSI), ranking 25th worldwide (being the second best ranked in Latin America). This analysis is developed by Estonia and measures the level of preparedness of countries to manage, prevent and respond to cyber-attacks that may compromise the security of information of governments and individuals.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-03-14 16:41:04</post_date><post_name>cybersecurity-are-you-ready-for-the-battle-ahead</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Ciberseguridad-en-Chile-desafios-y-riesgos.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag>empresas y ciberseguridad,prevenci&#xF3;n de ciberataques,ataques cibern&#xE9;ticos,ciberseguridad en Chile,Protecci&#xF3;n de Datos,Evertec,fintech y seguridad,Ransomware</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Cybersecurity in Chile: Challenges and Risks %%page%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Chile is advancing in cybersecurity, but companies still face challenges. Learn how to prepare for the growing risks of cyberattacks.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Cybersecurity in Chile and its evolution</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Challenges of digital means of payment</post_title><ID>63823</ID><post_content>According to the Central Bank's latest &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/merchants/"&gt;means of payment&lt;/a&gt; report, transactions and amounts of the main low-value payment methods grew 15%, from 5,649 million transactions in 2023, to reach 6,487 million transactions in 2024. This sustained increase, which is now in its third year of growth of over 10%, presents great opportunities, but also key challenges for the future of the sector.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;At Evertec we address this higher transaction load per year through internal innovation processes that respond with practical solutions that facilitate the integration of new, more efficient, faster and safer payment methods, which improve the management of companies and at the same time represent an advance for the end customer's experience. In both cases, the focus today and in the future will be on efficiency, traceability, reconciliation and ensuring the security of each digital payment&#x201D;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Sergio Manero&#xD;
Strategic Partnership Manager&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
The expansion of payment methods is transforming the way users conduct their banking transactions and movements. The emergence of technologies such as digital wallets (Apple Pay and Google Pay), &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;electronic transfers&lt;/a&gt; and contactless payments symbolizes a fundamental advance in terms of convenience, efficiency and effectiveness. However, the implementation of these technologies poses significant challenges such as ensuring interoperability between systems, the so-called multi-acquiring, i.e. that several acquirers coexist, and that each of them offers the possibility of accepting all means of electronic payment to merchants.&#xD;
&#xD;
Regulatory barriers will also have to be overcome, especially in the case of cross-border payments. &#x201C;There is still a gap to be bridged in international transfers, especially in terms of speed and cost,&#x201D; insisted Manero.&#xD;
&#xD;
He also emphasized that &#x201C;technological transformation is a constant in the fintech sector. We must continue to develop and scale solutions for our Retail, Banking, Supermarkets and Services clients, to turn the challenges of the means of payment into opportunities for internal improvement and for their end customers. For years, we have been committed to the continued adoption of emerging technologies and analyzing their potential to drive faster, safer and more accessible transactions, redefining the future of digital payments.&#xD;
&#xD;
However, as digital transactions increase, so do &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/fraud-monitoring-and-prevention/riskcenter360/"&gt;cyber threats&lt;/a&gt;. Fraud and theft through digital transactions and payments have been on the rise. According to a projection by Deloitte, it is estimated that by 2027, U.S. banks will reach approximately US$40 billion in losses due to fraud powered by generative AI. Protecting the integrity of customers requires strong cybersecurity strategies.&#xD;
&#xD;
On the other hand, the incorporation of digital currencies such as cryptocurrencies or Central Bank Digital Currencies (CBDCs), highlights the need to modernize and adapt technological infrastructures and ensure compatibility with other payment methods.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;It is key that innovation and security advance at the same pace, in an increasingly complex digital world. We must focus on protecting our customers from threats but also work on modernizing technological infrastructures to securely integrate different payment methods&#x201D;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Sergio Manero&#xD;
Strategic Partnership Manager&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
References:&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://www.bcentral.cl/web/banco-central/areas/politica-financiera/informe-de-sistemas-de-pago" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;INFORME DE SISTEMAS DE PAGO AGOSTO 2024 Banco Central de Chile &lt;/a&gt;(p&#xE1;gina, 8).&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://www.bcentral.cl/documents/33528/133214/Informe+de+Sistemas+de+Pago+Agosto+2024+-+Claudio+Soto.pdf/bc9e16ed-9000-491f-67bc-d2c5757bfcf7?t=1724356496454" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;INFORME DE SISTEMAS DE PAGO AGOSTO 2024&lt;/a&gt; Banco Central de Chile (p&#xE1;gina, 5).&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://iupana.com/recursos/ia-fraude-en-creditos-combate-el-robo-de-identidad-en-america-latina/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;IA, fraude y cr&#xE9;dito: Comprende el panorama actual y vence el robo de identidad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>We are heading into the second part of the decade and Evertec is already looking ahead to 2030. In the coming years, digital transactions and payment methods are projected to continue to grow at a faster pace, and this increase has reason with the constant evolution in search of greater efficiency in Chile's digital financial ecosystem. </post_excerpt><post_date>2024-12-18 16:50:47</post_date><post_name>challenges-of-digital-means-of-payment</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Desafios-de-los-medios-de-pago-digitales.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag>billeteras digitales,desaf&#xED;os de los pagos digitales,criptomonedas y pagos digitales.,ciberseguridad en pagos,medios de pago digitales,Evertec,Fintech,m&#xE9;todos de pago innovadores,multiadquirencia,pagos electr&#xF3;nicos,seguridad en pagos digitales,transacciones digitales</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Challenges of digital payment methods %%page%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Discover the main challenges of digital payment methods in 2024, from security and regulation to innovation and efficiency.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Challenges of digital payment methods</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Fintech Law: The key challenges for 2025</post_title><ID>63825</ID><post_content>Since its promulgation in January 2023, the advances in regulation and rules have been relevant, complying with the premise of not obstructing the growth of a sector that needs to continue to develop. This has facilitated the promotion of a potentially more symmetrical environment between fintechs and the traditional financial sector, as well as favoring the creation of products and services for more Chilean consumers and SMEs.&#xD;
&#xD;
In 2025 it is key to move forward as soon as possible in defining where the key entities, payment originators, data provision and processing entities will reside, all of which are essential to move forward. It is here that a definition is required with greater urgency compared to other aspects of the legislation.&#xD;
&#xD;
On the fintech side, it is important that they work on complying adequately with all the requirements of the law in order to be able to scale as expected. What is noteworthy in this scenario is that there are some that are ahead of the majority.&#xD;
&#xD;
Today Chile is the country with the most fintechs per 10,000 inhabitants in Latin America, which represents a great scope. However, the question is whether we will be able to generate the conditions for a relevant percentage to develop in an adequate market and be able to scale, reaching more markets in the region.&#xD;
&#xD;
Undoubtedly, the Fintech Law has laid the foundations for a more dynamic and inclusive financial system, but its success will depend on the effective implementation of regulations, the strengthening of &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/fraud-monitoring-and-prevention/riskcenter360/"&gt;cybersecurity&lt;/a&gt;, the guarantee of real financial inclusion and consumer protection. Therefore, in the year ahead, it is a priority to make a coordinated effort between regulators, industry and civil society to make rapid progress in the consolidation of a robust and equitable financial ecosystem.</post_content><post_excerpt>Chile is one of the few countries in the region that, due to the maturity of its market, has a Fintech Law that regulates the activity of financial and technological service providers. This regulation was necessary to lay the foundations for greater innovation and competition in the financial sector by establishing a regulatory framework for developing financial services based on technology and innovation. Although they operated with varying degrees of quality, there was also a need for greater supervision and confidence in the system.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-03-14 16:58:25</post_date><post_name>fintech-law-the-key-challenges-for-2025</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Desafios-de-la-Ley-Fintech-2025.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag>Evertec,inclusi&#xF3;n financiera Chile,fintech y ciberseguridad,fintech y sector financiero tradicional,desaf&#xED;os fintech Chile,Ley Fintech Chile,mercado fintech Chile,normativa fintech,regulaci&#xF3;n fintech 2025,escalabilidad fintech</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Fintech Law Challenges 2025 %%page%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Discover the key challenges of Chile's Fintech Law for 2025 and its impact on the financial ecosystem and innovation.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Challenges of the Fintech Law in Chile</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>How Resilient is your Company to a Cyber Attack?</post_title><ID>63827</ID><post_content>That is why all companies must maintain a global strategy to defend themselves, involving all the company's stakeholders, in order to work together to respond and recover as soon as possible from an impact that affects our assets or infrastructure. With the increase of ramsonware events and attacks on suppliers (supply chain) worldwide, companies are more exposed to this type of events. If we add to this the fact that these types of attacks are becoming more sophisticated, complex and very difficult to detect, the outlook is not so encouraging for companies that do not have a response plan in place (an obligation that is being contemplated in the new &lt;a href="https://ley21663.cl/?gad_source=1&amp;amp;gclid=Cj0KCQjwkN--BhDkARIsAD_mnIo1jkL40ZrI-E8xQA3mTXsgxwYkY23rURkyO6fFse3E0dXAY4K-zH8aAlY6EALw_wcB"&gt;cybersecurity law in Chile&lt;/a&gt;).&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;The World Economic Forum's&#xD;
Global Cybersecurity Outlook 2024&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
revealed that 81% of large business executives surveyed responded that they feel more or similarly exposed to cybercrime than last year.&#xD;
&#xD;
In addition, the report notes that cyber resilience and CEO confidence are closely related. Some 93% of respondents indicated that their organization is a leader and innovator in cyber resilience and are confident that their CEO can get that message out to the public.&#xD;
&#xD;
This is where the question arises: How resilient is your company to a cyber attack? Having a global cyber resilience strategy implies a comprehensive approach that aligns prevention measures and clear action protocols to generate an agile and planned response that minimizes damage and protects the operation. Cyber resilience allows transforming the response structures of companies, making them more resilient and adaptable to threats that are constantly evolving.&#xD;
&#xD;
In an ideal scenario, a large enterprise may be protected, but what about the ability to withstand attacks from your suppliers and how does it affect the supply chain?&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;How is cyber&#xD;
resilience achieved?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Building a cyber resilient enterprise starts with a mindset of anticipation and constant preparation. This includes updating &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/3dsecure-protocol/"&gt;security systems and protocols&lt;/a&gt;, establishing and simulating Cyber Incident Response Plans (CIRP) that allow organizations to react quickly and accurately.&#xD;
&#xD;
In addition, it is crucial to constantly update and train teams in best practices and early threat detection. It is here where universities and academic institutions, as well as companies, must make a leap in talent development and training of collaborators, in order to generate an increasingly specialized task force.&#xD;
&#xD;
It is important to consider that it is no longer a matter of preventing or resisting an attack, but of maintaining efficiency, reducing the impact on the operation, minimizing losses and protecting the brand image in the eyes of the entire spectrum of customers and public opinion.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;a href="https://soluciones.evertecinc.com/riskcenter360-0" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&#xD;
&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" srcset="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook.jpg 1200w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-300x87.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-1024x298.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-768x223.jpg 768w" alt="" width="1200" height="349" /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Before answering this question, it is necessary to understand what &#x201C;cyber resilience&#x201D; is. This term is directly related to the ability to recover after having suffered or been the victim of a cyber attack. When we grasp this concept, we can ask ourselves how resilient we are as a company and how prepared we are to withstand a major event that could affect not only our operations, but also our public image and that of our customers.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-03-14 17:06:08</post_date><post_name>how-resilient-is-your-company-to-a-cyber-attack</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Es-resiliente-tu-empresa.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag>protecci&#xF3;n empresarial,ciberresiliencia,ciberataques,estrategia de ciberseguridad,resiliencia digital,Evertec,respuesta ante incidentes,Ransomware</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Is your company resilient? %%page%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Discover how prepared your company is to withstand and recover from a cyberattack with an effective cyber resilience strategy.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>business cyber resilience</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Know the keys to protect your online shopping this Black Friday 2024</post_title><ID>63829</ID><post_content>Black Friday, which this year will be celebrated from November 29 to December 2, has its origins in a tradition in the United States as the kick-off for Christmas sales after Thanksgiving Day. Over time, this event has become an important date for &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;online commerce&lt;/a&gt; in Chile. During this day, &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/vas-services/"&gt;retailers and businesses&lt;/a&gt; of all sizes nationwide use this date to boost pre-Christmas sales, consolidating in recent years as an unmissable moment in the country's shopping calendar.&#xD;
&#xD;
According to figures from the Santiago Chamber of Commerce, in 2023, sales generated during Black Friday exceeded USD 500 million, marking a growth of 18% over the previous year.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;For this year, commerce expects a superior performance, hand in hand with new digital payment methods, such as payment links, mobile applications and QR codes, which has facilitated the purchasing process for consumers throughout the country&#x201D;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Pablo Huircapan&#xD;
Director de IT y Operaciones de Evertec Chile &#x2013; Per&#xFA; &#x2013; Uruguay&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
With the increase in &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/electronic-payment-button/"&gt;digital transactions&lt;/a&gt;, the risk of falling victim to online scams is also growing. In general, cybercriminals resort to phishing (messages or emails that mimic those of real businesses), or impersonation of websites in order to steal people's personal and banking information.&#xD;
&#xD;
Given this situation, Huircapan shared a series of recommendations to ensure safe shopping during this event.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Tips for safe shopping&#xD;
during Black Friday&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Check the &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/fraud-monitoring-and-prevention/riskcenter360/"&gt;security&lt;/a&gt; of the website Before making a purchase, make sure that the page is a secure site. That is, the URL begins with &#x201C;https .&#x201D; and displays a padlock icon in the address bar. This indicates that your data is protected by encryption.&#xD;
&#xD;
Use secure connections Make your purchases exclusively from private Wi-Fi networks.&#xD;
&#xD;
Public networks are highly vulnerable to attacks and could compromise the security of your banking data.&#xD;
&#xD;
Be wary of offers that are too attractive If a promotion seems too good to be real, it is probably a scam.&#xD;
&#xD;
These types of fake promotions are often used by scammers to lure unsuspecting victims.&#xD;
&#xD;
Do your research before you buy Verify that websites have clear contact information and a reliable privacy policy.&#xD;
&#xD;
Protect your mobile devices Download apps only from official stores, such as Google Play or the App Store, to minimize the risk of hacking or malware.&#xD;
&#xD;
Keep your software up to date Make sure your browser, operating system and antivirus are up to date.&#xD;
&#xD;
Updates often include security enhancements that protect against known vulnerabilities.&#xD;
&#xD;
Enable two-factor authentication (2FA) Add an extra layer of security to your accounts by enabling 2FA.&#xD;
&#xD;
This will require an additional step to verify your identity before completing any purchases.&#xD;
&#xD;
Monitor your transactions and activate blocks. Don't be impulsive, plan.&#xD;
&#xD;
Huircapan insisted that, if you have doubts before buying, it is advisable to directly contact help channels of merchants and financial institutions, so that they can guide you in a more secure purchase.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;a href="https://soluciones.evertecinc.com/riskcenter360-0" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&#xD;
&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" srcset="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook.jpg 1200w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-300x87.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-1024x298.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-768x223.jpg 768w" alt="" width="1200" height="349" /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>&lt;i&gt;This event not only represents an opportunity to access special offers, but also a key moment to stay alert and protect our online transactions. It is essential to combine the convenience of digital shopping with safe practices that protect our information and our money,&#x201D; said Pablo Huircapan, director of Information Technology and Operations of Evertec Chile, Peru and Uruguay.&lt;/i&gt;</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-11-27 17:15:58</post_date><post_name>know-the-keys-to-protect-your-online-shopping-this-black-friday-2024</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Protege-tus-compras-este-Black-Friday.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag>evitar fraudes Black Friday,Black Friday 2024,seguridad en compras digitales,Evertec,estafas en internet,proteger compras online,pagos seguros online,compras seguras en l&#xED;nea</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Protect your shopping this Black Friday%%page%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Avoid scams this Black Friday 2024 with these security tips to protect your online purchases and digital transactions.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>online shopping security Black Friday</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>CyberMonday 2024: Digital transactions have increased by 15% in the last two years</post_title><ID>63831</ID><post_content>As CyberMonday 2024, to be held from September 30 to October 2, approaches, millions of consumers are already preparing to take advantage of the offers on products and services that will be offered by the more than 700 participating merchants.&#xD;
&#xD;
This event, which has gained relevance in recent years, has also witnessed a considerable increase in &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;digital transactions&lt;/a&gt;, driven by the growing use of new technologies that have simplified payments.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;A few years ago it was common for payment platforms to collapse during massive events, such as CyberMonday. Today, the incorporation of new players in the payment system has strengthened the infrastructure, minimizing errors and improving the shopping experience"&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Pablo Huircapan&#xD;
Director de IT y Operaciones de Evertec Chile &#x2013; Per&#xFA; &#x2013; Uruguay&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
According to figures from the Santiago Chamber of Commerce, 4 million transactions were recorded on Cyber Monday in 2022, a figure that grew by 15% in 2023, when 4.6 million &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;e-commerce&lt;/a&gt; movements were completed. Huircapan indicated that it is possible that this 2024 the figure will rise above 5 million transactions.&#xD;
&#xD;
&#x201C;The increase in transactions reflects the growing confidence of users in payment platforms and in the soundness of banking systems, which have improved significantly in recent years,&#x201D; said the Evertec executive.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Security recommendations&#xD;
for CyberMonday 2024&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Evertec calls on users to take advantage of the offers, but without neglecting the &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/fraud-monitoring-and-prevention/riskcenter360/"&gt;security of banking data&lt;/a&gt;. Given the greater number of payment transactions and the demand of users, it is necessary to be extremely careful and avoid frauds such as phishing or impersonation sites that cybercriminals elaborate on these dates.&#xD;
&#xD;
To avoid scams, Pablo Huircapan gave a series of security measures that consumers should apply:&#xD;
&lt;ol&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Buy on official and reliable sites: Verify that the online store is legitimate. It is preferable to buy on official websites of https://cyber.cl or recognized stores. Also watch out for pop-up windows when shopping.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Check the security padlock (HTTPS): It is key to make sure that the website has an SSL certificate (green padlock and URL starting with &#x201C;https://&#x201D;). This indicates that the connection is secure.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Beware of too-good-to-be-true offers: If an offer seems extremely cheap, it is probably a scam. Research average prices before making an impulse purchase and avoid clicking on links in suspicious emails or messages.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Do not share unnecessary personal information: Only provide the information required for the purchase. Do not share sensitive personal information or passwords.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Avoid using public Wi-Fi networks for purchases: Online purchases should not be made using public Wi-Fi networks, as they can be insecure and vulnerable to hacker attacks.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Use secure payment methods: Opt for credit cards or secure platforms that offer protection to the buyer. Avoid direct bank transfers or payments through money transfer services that do not offer security.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;It is key to verify the seller's return policies and terms: Before making a purchase, you should make sure that the store offers clear and fair return policies. Find out if they have reliable customer service.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Monitor your account statements: It is important to review account statements regularly after making online purchases to detect any unauthorized charges and report them immediately.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Research other users' opinions: If you are unsure, it is best to read reviews and comments from other shoppers to verify the store's reputation. Sites with too many negative comments or no information can be a red flag.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ol&gt;&#xD;
These recommendations will help you reduce risks and enjoy a safer shopping experience during CyberMonday, protecting your finances and taking advantage of the offers in a responsible way.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;a href="https://soluciones.evertecinc.com/riskcenter360-0" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&#xD;
&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" srcset="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook.jpg 1200w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-300x87.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-1024x298.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-768x223.jpg 768w" alt="" width="1200" height="349" /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>&lt;i&gt;In 2023, 4.6 million transactions were made on CyberMonday, and this year the figure could exceed 5 million. &#x201C;Chileans' confidence in electronic means of payment is growing and companies, including banking institutions, have improved their platforms to make them faster and more efficient,&#x201D; emphasized Pablo Huircapan, director of IT and Operations at Evertec Chile - Peru - Uruguay.&lt;/i&gt;</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-09-05 17:24:59</post_date><post_name>cybermonday-2024-digital-transactions-have-increased-by-15-in-the-last-two-years</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Crecen-transacciones-en-CyberMonday-2024.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag>comercio electr&#xF3;nico,CyberMonday 2024,ofertas CyberMonday,Evertec,fraude online,compras online,medios de pago,seguridad en compras,transacciones digitales</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Digital Transactions Grow on CyberMonday 2024%%page%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Digital transactions on CyberMonday have grown by 15% in two years. Discover key figures and security tips.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>digital transactions on CyberMonday 2024</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Fiestas Patrias 2024: Recommendations for the safe use of electronic payments and to avoid bank frauds</post_title><ID>63833</ID><post_content>During long weekends, &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;electronic purchases and payments&lt;/a&gt;, the use of credit cards, bank transfers and payments with QR codes, increase considerably. Evertec, a leading company in the implementation of online payment systems, recommends taking precautions to protect your financial information and avoid bank frauds, which also tend to increase, precisely during the national holidays.&#xD;
&#xD;
Huircapan called not to lower your guard and &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/fraud-monitoring-and-prevention/riskcenter360/"&gt;protect your financial information&lt;/a&gt;, so as not to be exposed to fraud or cyber attacks such as phishing or adulterated POS payments (payment devices).&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;On a personal level, it is important to use means of payment with less contact (chip cards or electronic wallets). It is crucial to protect personal information and passwords, making sure that no one sees them. Always demand receipts and backups of what we do. It is necessary to check the amounts and not to trust when confirming any transaction, either at national level or abroad&#x201D;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Pablo Huircapan&#xD;
Director de IT y Operaciones de Evertec Chile &#x2013; Per&#xFA; &#x2013; Uruguay&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
The specialist also recommended that &#x201C;if we pay in a hotel with free Wi-Fi, it is essential to have a VPN, or to check the security of the network. On vacation, we tend to forget these precautions, which makes us more vulnerable&#x201D;.&#xD;
&#xD;
Evertec provides a series of practical tips to avoid being a victim of scams and attacks by computer criminals during the national holidays.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Tips for the safe use&#xD;
of electronic payments:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;ol&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;When &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/processing/"&gt;making payments by credit or debit card&lt;/a&gt;, make sure the merchant is validated and has recognized security systems.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Avoid entering your data in unknown or unreliable sites.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Always demand payment receipts for each transaction, keep them and verify that the amounts match both in the account statement and in the receipts.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Always verify the website: before entering any financial information, make sure that the page has a security lock (https://) and that it is the merchant's official website. Remember that fraudulent pages may have names very similar to the original ones.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Activate notifications on your accounts: many banking applications allow you to activate real-time notifications. This way, you can be aware of every movement and immediately detect any suspicious transaction.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Avoid sharing financial data through social networks or messaging applications.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Be careful with public Wi-Fi networks: if you need to make transactions abroad using public Wi-Fi networks, use a VPN or check the security system of the network you are connecting to.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ol&gt;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Tips to avoid&#xD;
bank frauds:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
During this season, digital scams carried out by cybercriminals, such as phishing, smishing and QR code scams, tend to increase, due to the fact that people are celebrating and are more distracted.&#xA0; Here are some key recommendations to avoid these instances.&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Beware of fraudulent text messages: be wary of any SMS or email asking you for personal information, codes or passwords. Banks will never ask for confidential data in this way.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Beware of fake QR codes: verify that the QR code you are scanning is from a trusted source.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Avoid codes you find in unofficial places or received by unreliable means.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Do not enter suspicious links: before any message that asks you to enter a link, always verify its authenticity by calling the bank or institution that sent it to you. Remember that many scams are presented with irresistible offers or promotions.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
The Fiestas Patrias are a time for family gatherings and celebrations. With these recommendations, you will be able to enjoy with greater peace of mind, using technology safely.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;a href="https://soluciones.evertecinc.com/riskcenter360-0" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&#xD;
&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" srcset="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook.jpg 1200w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-300x87.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-1024x298.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-768x223.jpg 768w" alt="" width="1200" height="349" /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>&lt;i&gt;We must not let our guard down on this extended September 18. It is key to continue protecting our financial information, insisted Pablo Huircapan, IT - Ops director of Evertec SOLA.&lt;/i&gt;</post_excerpt><post_date>2024-09-01 17:33:30</post_date><post_name>fiestas-patrias-2024-recommendations-for-the-safe-use-of-electronic-payments-and-to-avoid-bank-frauds</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Seguridad-en-pagos-electronicos-2024.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag>evitar fraudes bancarios,pagos con tarjeta,Protecci&#xF3;n de Datos,estafas digitales,Evertec,c&#xF3;digos QR falsos,fiestas patrias 2024,phishing,compras online seguras,pagos electr&#xF3;nicos seguros,seguridad financiera</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Secure Electronic Payments 2024%%page%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Protect your financial information during National Holidays 2024. Follow these tips to avoid fraud and pay safely.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Secure electronic payments on National Holidays 2024</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>What is BIN Sponsorship and How Does It Benefit You When Applying for a Card?</post_title><ID>64126</ID><post_content>Financial institutions have needs to issue debit, prepaid, or credit card programs, and from this need arises the &lt;a href="/en/bin-sponsor/"&gt;BIN Sponsor solution&lt;/a&gt;. Through this model, fintechs, sofipos, and small banks are facilitated access to a regulated, secure, and ready-to-operate environment.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Evertec's Comprehensive&#xD;
BIN Sponsorship Solution&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
With over 16 years of experience in Mexico and regulated by the CNBV, Evertec offers a BIN Sponsorship solution that meets the requirements of the Mexican market and the security standards of brands like Mastercard. This comprehensive offering not only allows the issuance of customized cards with each company's identity but also includes:&#xD;
&lt;ul&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;A Core and Card Management System for physical and digital cards.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Complete back-office services for debit, credit, and prepaid cards.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Fraud monitoring and prevention.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Chargeback management.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
 	&lt;li&gt;Multichannel contact center for customer support.&lt;/li&gt;&#xD;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;Accessing a BIN sponsor through Evertec allows companies to focus on their growth and offer innovative solutions to the market without incurring the high costs and time associated with obtaining their own license"&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Ivan Baquero&#xD;
Country Manager of Evertec in Mexico&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
Additionally, Evertec's platform is flexible and scalable, easily integrating with digital wallets and ensuring that transactions are fast and secure thanks to its tokenization technology. This solution not only facilitates the launch of new products but also guarantees an optimal experience for the end user.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Un aliado estrat&#xE9;gico&#xD;
en el entorno financiero&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
In a dynamic market like Mexico, Evertec works with banks, fintechs, and other institutions to develop innovative products that promote financial inclusion. Their focus on security, regulatory compliance, and operational optimization makes Evertec a reliable partner for companies looking to stand out in the payments industry with cards that carry each company's unique identity and solutions that go beyond linking to encompass the entire &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/processing/"&gt;payment processing.&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;In today's financial environment and in a dynamic market like Mexico, BIN Sponsorship services are essential as they allow new players to enter the market with innovative offerings and benefits for end customers. All this without compromising people's security: to access these financial solutions, it is necessary to comply with all regulations, and we do this with companies of proven quality and reputation, such as Mastercard"&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Ivan Baquero&#xD;
Country Manager of Evertec in Mexico&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
If you are looking for a solution that combines agility, security, and customization, Evertec has the answer you need to grow your business.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;a href="https://soluciones.evertecinc.com/paystudio-2024-0" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&#xD;
&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/paystudio-banner.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" srcset="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/paystudio-banner.jpg 1200w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/01/paystudio-banner-300x87.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/01/paystudio-banner-1024x298.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/01/paystudio-banner-768x223.jpg 768w" alt="" width="1200" height="349" /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Have you noticed that the first digits on your credit or debit cards are repeated on different cards? In the payments industry, the BIN (Bank Identification Number) or IIN (Issuer Identification Number) is key to identifying the card issuer and securely connecting transactions. This identifier, composed of the first digits of a card, is essential for financial institutions to issue payment methods tailored to market needs.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-01-30 11:50:12</post_date><post_name>what-is-bin-sponsorship-and-how-does-it-benefit-you-when-applying-for-a-card</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/BIN-Sponsorship-que-es-y-beneficios.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag>N&#xFA;mero de Identificaci&#xF3;n Bancaria,BIN Sponsorship,Tarjetas de cr&#xE9;dito y d&#xE9;bito,emisi&#xF3;n de tarjetas,Evertec,Fintech y bancos,Seguridad en pagos,Soluciones de pago</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>BIN Sponsorship: What It Is and Benefits %%page%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Discover what BIN Sponsorship is, how it facilitates card issuance, and why it is key for fintechs and banks.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>BIN Sponsorship and Its Benefits</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Shop Safely for Your Valentine&#x2019;s Day Gift Online</post_title><ID>64132</ID><post_content>This season, to enhance the experience, Evertec, a leader in technology and transaction processing, recommends the following 4 practical tips for &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;online shopping&lt;/a&gt;:&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Only buy only&#xD;
from trusted websites:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Verify that the website you're using to buy items is secure. Look for a lock icon next to the URL, which indicates that the site is trustworthy.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Keep&#xD;
devices secure:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Always use your own devices to make online purchases and try to avoid using public Wi-Fi networks for this type of activity.&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Use virtual cards&#xD;
for online shopping:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
Many banks offer temporary virtual cards for online purchases. These cards are only valid for a short period and help protect your main account from potential &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/fraud-monitoring-and-prevention/riskcenter360/"&gt;fraud.&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&amp;nbsp;&#xD;
&lt;h2&gt;Provide only necessary&#xD;
personal information:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;hr /&gt;&#xD;
&#xD;
If you're asked for unusual personal details (such as your cell phone number, names of family members, place of birth, etc.) to make a purchase, don't provide them and check if you're on the correct site.&#xD;
&#xD;
By following these recommendations, users can minimize the risks of fraud. The combination of advanced technology in payment platforms, along with personal responsibility, can ensure a satisfying shopping experience.&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;a href="https://soluciones.evertecinc.com/riskcenter360-0" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&#xD;
&lt;img src="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" srcset="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook.jpg 1200w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-300x87.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-1024x298.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/03/descarga-eBook-768x223.jpg 768w" alt="" width="1200" height="349" /&gt; &lt;/a&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Valentine's Day is a time when the demand for online shopping increases and, according to the Colombian Chamber of Commerce, it&#x2019;s expected to grow by 20% in 2025 in the country. However, along with this special date, the risks of online fraud and scams also rise. Given the preference for online shopping, it&#x2019;s important to keep in mind some tips to ensure secure transactions.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-02-11 12:06:07</post_date><post_name>shop-safely-for-your-valentines-day-gift-online</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Compra-segura-en-San-Valentin-2025.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag>evitar fraudes online,Evertec,protecci&#xF3;n en compras online,regalos seguros en internet,compras seguras en l&#xED;nea,transacciones seguras web,seguridad en pagos electr&#xF3;nicos,San Valent&#xED;n 2025</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Safe Shopping on Valentine&#x2019;s Day 2025 %%page%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Discover 4 key tips for secure online shopping this Valentine&#x2019;s Day 2025 and avoid internet fraud.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>secure online shopping on Valentine&#x2019;s Day</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Innovation in Digital Payment Methods: Technology as a Driver of Competitiveness</post_title><ID>64135</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;Digital payment methods&lt;/a&gt; have undergone significant transformation, driven by the adoption of innovative technologies like digital wallets, payment platforms, and the banking of previously underserved sectors. These technologies are changing the way companies manage their transactions, improving both operational efficiency and the customer experience.&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One of the most notable trends in the digital payment sector for 2025 is the use of artificial intelligence (AI), which has become a transformative tool for industries. The numbers speak for themselves: according to a recent Microsoft report, 82% of companies in Colombia are increasing their use of AI to optimize their operations.&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				Payment solutions are incorporating advanced algorithms to predict consumer behavior and provide faster, more secure options. AI also enables real-time fraud detection, ensuring greater transaction security. As we continue to integrate AI into payment systems, it will become increasingly prevalent, turning into a fundamental element for companies aiming to stay competitive."			&lt;/p&gt;
											&lt;cite&gt;Juliana Grajales&lt;br&gt;Director of &lt;a href="https://placetopay.dev/" title="Placetopay"&gt;&lt;font color="#ff6c0c"&gt;Evertec Placetopay&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/cite&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;However, the adoption of advanced technologies presents significant challenges. Cybersecurity has become a major concern and priority for companies. In a world where cyberattacks are increasingly frequent, it is essential to protect sensitive customer data and payment systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Large industries are adopting payment solutions that enable quick, contactless transactions to mitigate cyberattacks. These solutions not only improve convenience but also enhance security, as transactions are safeguarded by additional layers of encryption.&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;According to a recent report by Symantec, the global cost of cyberattacks could surpass $10 billion annually by 2025, highlighting the urgent need to implement robust protections and constant monitoring solutions on platforms.&#xA0;&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				At Evertec, a leader in technology and transaction processing, we understand the importance of adapting to these technological trends, offering innovative solutions that optimize business operations and improve customer experience. With AI and cybersecurity tools, industries can ensure not only efficiency but also security and competitiveness in this dynamic digital world"			&lt;/p&gt;
											&lt;cite&gt;Juliana Grajales&lt;br&gt;Director of &lt;a href="https://placetopay.dev/" title="Placetopay"&gt;&lt;font color="#ff6c0c"&gt;Evertec Placetopay&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/cite&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;In conclusion, 2025 is shaping up to be a pivotal year for companies aiming to lead the digital transformation with digital payments and remain competitive in an increasingly interconnected world. The challenge lies in staying agile and innovative, incorporating technological advancements to evolve quickly and securely.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>In an increasingly digital business world, companies that don't adapt to new technological trends are falling behind. Among these new technological trends are digital payment methods, which saw an exponential growth of 35% in 2024 according to the "Innovametro" by the Financial Superintendency of Colombia.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-01-30 12:19:43</post_date><post_name>innovation-in-digital-payment-methods-technology-as-a-driver-of-competitiveness</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Innovacion-en-pagos-digitales-2025.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Articles</post_category><post_tag>inteligencia artificial en pagos,billeteras digitales,ciberseguridad en transacciones,medios de pago digitales,tendencias en pagos digitales 2025,transformaci&#xF3;n digital en pagos,comercio electr&#xF3;nico y pagos,Evertec,digitalizaci&#xF3;n financiera,Pagos digitales,pagos electr&#xF3;nicos,pagos sin contacto,innovaci&#xF3;n en pagos,plataformas de pago,seguridad en pagos digitales,tecnolog&#xED;a en pagos</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Digital Payment Innovation 2025 %%page%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Discover how AI and cybersecurity are transforming digital payments in 2025, enhancing efficiency and transaction security.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Digital payment innovation</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec en el Primer "Focal Points" de ChilePay del 2025</post_title><ID>64332</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;Durante el evento, ChilePay present&#xF3; su plan estrat&#xE9;gico para el 2025, en el que destaca su compromiso con la formulaci&#xF3;n y revisi&#xF3;n de pol&#xED;ticas p&#xFA;blicas en el &#xE1;mbito de los medios de pago, la articulaci&#xF3;n de los distintos actores del ecosistema, y la educaci&#xF3;n financiera. Este esfuerzo est&#xE1; dirigido tanto a los comercios como a los consumidores en todo el pa&#xED;s.&lt;/p&gt;		
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				Evertec est&#xE1; totalmente comprometido con ChilePay y haber recibido a las distintas empresas que conf&#xED;an en esta corporaci&#xF3;n en nuestras oficinas es un privilegio, que nos hayan escogido como anfitri&#xF3;n para inaugurar el primer 'Focal Points' de este a&#xF1;o no solo refleja nuestra alianza estrat&#xE9;gica, sino tambi&#xE9;n la importancia de este tipo de espacios de di&#xE1;logo y planificaci&#xF3;n para avanzar en nuestra industria"			&lt;/p&gt;
											&lt;cite&gt;Daniel Barba&lt;br&gt;Country Manager de Chile en Evertec&lt;/cite&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;Daniel a&#xF1;adi&#xF3;, &lt;em&gt;"seguiremos trabajando mano a mano con diversas compa&#xF1;&#xED;as para mejorar la experiencia de pago para todos los usuarios del pa&#xED;s, manteniendo siempre nuestras puertas abiertas a la colaboraci&#xF3;n&#x201D;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;		
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				Esta reuni&#xF3;n fue un encuentro muy importante para presentar a los 'Focal Points' de nuestros miembros el trabajo que tenemos planificado para este a&#xF1;o y para escuchar sus expectativas y propuestas para la corporaci&#xF3;n. Fue una buena instancia de conversaci&#xF3;n donde salieron grandes ideas e iniciativas. Agradecemos a Evertec por recibirnos en sus oficinas y por darnos este espacio de di&#xE1;logo&#x201D;			&lt;/p&gt;
											&lt;cite&gt;Juan Antonio Figueroa&lt;br&gt;Director Ejecutivo de &lt;a href="https://chilepay.org/" title="ChilePay"&gt;&lt;font color="#ff6c0c"&gt;ChilePay&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/cite&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;El evento refuerza la importancia del trabajo en conjunto para impulsar el ecosistema de pagos en Chile y seguir avanzando hacia &lt;a style="color: #ff6600; text-decoration: underline;" href="/comercios/"&gt;soluciones m&#xE1;s eficientes,&lt;/a&gt; seguras y accesibles.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>En una jornada que reuni&#xF3; a los l&#xED;deres clave del ecosistema de pagos en Chile, ChilePay realiz&#xF3; su primer encuentro "Focal Points" del a&#xF1;o en las oficinas de Evertec en Santiago. Esta instancia marc&#xF3; el inicio de una serie de actividades que la organizaci&#xF3;n tiene programada para el a&#xF1;o, con el objetivo de fortalecer su rol en el sector financiero y de los medios de pago en el pa&#xED;s.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-04-08 16:07:22</post_date><post_name>evertec-en-el-primer-focal-points-de-chilepay-del-2025</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/evento-Focal-Points-de-ChilePay.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Noticias</post_category><post_tag>colaboraci&#xF3;n fintech Chile,ecosistema de pagos Chile,evento ChilePay 2025,Evertec,Evertec Chile,Focal Points ChilePay,innovaci&#xF3;n financiera Chile,medios de pago 2025</post_tag><translation_priority>Opcional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec anfitri&#xF3;n de Focal Points %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Evertec fue anfitri&#xF3;n del primer Focal Points de ChilePay 2025, reforzando su compromiso con el ecosistema de pagos en Chile.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>evento Focal Points de ChilePay</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>FinanCard lanza su nueva billetera digital asociada a una tarjeta prepago Mastercard procesada por Evertec</post_title><ID>64348</ID><post_content>En busca de ampliar el acceso a los servicios financieros en Panam&#xE1;, Financiera FinanCard ha lanzado &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://financard.com.pa/easi/"&gt;EASI by Financard&lt;/a&gt;, una &lt;a style="color: #ff6600; text-decoration: underline;" href="/billetera-movil/"&gt;billetera digital&lt;/a&gt; asociada a una tarjeta prepago Mastercard procesada por Evertec. Esta innovadora herramienta les permite a los usuarios recargar fondos f&#xE1;cilmente, realizar compras en comercios f&#xED;sicos y en l&#xED;nea, cargos recurrentes y transferir dinero de manera instant&#xE1;nea a otros usuarios dentro de la aplicaci&#xF3;n.&#xD;
&#xD;
Este lanzamiento no solo expande la oferta de Financiera FinanCard, sino que tambi&#xE9;n impulsa la inclusi&#xF3;n financiera al ofrecer una alternativa accesible y moderna para la poblaci&#xF3;n no bancarizada facilitando transacciones seguras y en tiempo real.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;"La visi&#xF3;n de Financiera FinanCard al implementar EASI by Financard es un paso significativo hacia la inclusi&#xF3;n financiera en Panam&#xE1;. En Evertec, nos enorgullece ser el socio tecnol&#xF3;gico que apoya esta iniciativa, facilitando la aceptaci&#xF3;n de billeteras y medios de pago que hacen las transacciones m&#xE1;s f&#xE1;ciles, seguras y eficientes. Este proyecto refleja nuestro compromiso compartido de transformar el ecosistema de pagos en Panam&#xE1;."&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Jimmy Solano Blanco,&#xD;
Country Manager de Centroam&#xE9;rica para Evertec&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
Felicitamos a Financiera FinanCard por este importante hito y reafirmamos nuestro compromiso de seguir impulsando la digitalizaci&#xF3;n y modernizaci&#xF3;n del sistema financiero en Panam&#xE1; y la regi&#xF3;n.</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2025-04-08 16:44:50</post_date><post_name>financard-lanza-su-nueva-billetera-digital-asociada-a-una-tarjeta-prepago-mastercard-procesada-por-evertec</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/easi-financard.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Historias de exito</post_category><post_tag>billetera digital Panam&#xE1;,EASI by Financard,Evertec,FinanCard Evertec,fintech Panam&#xE1;,inclusi&#xF3;n financiera Panam&#xE1;,modernizaci&#xF3;n financiera,Pagos digitales,recargas digitales,tarjeta prepago Mastercard,transferencias instant&#xE1;neas</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Nueva billetera digital EASI Panam&#xE1; %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>FinanCard lanza EASI, su billetera digital con Mastercard y Evertec, impulsando la inclusi&#xF3;n financiera y pagos digitales en Panam&#xE1;.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>billetera digital EASI by Financard</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>FinanCard launches its new digital wallet linked to a prepaid Mastercard processed by Evertec</post_title><ID>64360</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;Seeking to expand access to financial services in Panama, Financiera FinanCard has launched EASI by Financard, a digital wallet associated with a prepaid Mastercard processed by Evertec. This innovative tool allows users to easily reload funds, make purchases at physical and online merchants, make recurring charges and transfer money instantly to other users within the application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This launch not only expands Financiera FinanCard's offering, but also boosts financial inclusion by offering an accessible and modern alternative for the unbanked population by facilitating secure, real-time transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				&#x201C;Financiera FinanCard's vision in implementing EASI by Financard is a significant step towards financial inclusion in Panama. At Evertec, we are proud to be the technology partner supporting this initiative, facilitating the acceptance of wallets and payment methods that make transactions easier, safer and more efficient. This project reflects our shared commitment to transform the payments ecosystem in Panama.&#x201D;			&lt;/p&gt;
											&lt;cite&gt;Jimmy Solano Blanco,&lt;br&gt;Country Manager de Centroam&#xE9;rica para Evertec&lt;/cite&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;We congratulate Financiera FinanCard on this important milestone and reaffirm our commitment to continue promoting the digitalization and modernization of the financial system in Panama and the region.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt/><post_date>2025-04-08 17:24:00</post_date><post_name>financard-launches-its-new-digital-wallet-linked-to-a-prepaid-mastercard-processed-by-evertec</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/easi-financard.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Success stories</post_category><post_tag>recargas digitales,billetera digital Panam&#xE1;,EASI by Financard,Evertec,FinanCard Evertec,inclusi&#xF3;n financiera Panam&#xE1;,modernizaci&#xF3;n financiera,fintech Panam&#xE1;,transferencias instant&#xE1;neas,Pagos digitales,tarjeta prepago Mastercard</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options/><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>New EASI Digital Wallet Panama %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>FinanCard launches EASI, its digital wallet with Mastercard and Evertec, driving financial inclusion and digital payments in Panama.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>digital wallet EASI by Financard</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec presenta Nubity by Evertec: impulsando la transformaci&#xF3;n digital desde Puerto Rico hacia toda Latinoam&#xE9;rica</post_title><ID>64540</ID><post_content>Evertec, l&#xED;der en tecnolog&#xED;a financiera para Am&#xE9;rica Latina y el Caribe, celebra una nueva etapa de innovaci&#xF3;n al integrar &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/nubity/"&gt;Nubity&lt;/a&gt;, una empresa pionera en soluciones tecnol&#xF3;gicas en la nube. Esta alianza estrat&#xE9;gica representa un paso crucial en la evoluci&#xF3;n de Evertec, ampliando su alcance y fortaleciendo su liderazgo en la regi&#xF3;n.&#xD;
&#xD;
Durante el evento, altos ejecutivos de banca y negocios participaron de demostraciones en tiempo real de las capacidades de &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="/nubity/"&gt;Nubity by Evertec.&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;Con Nubity by Evertec, estamos llevando nuestra visi&#xF3;n de transformaci&#xF3;n digital al siguiente nivel. Por primera vez, Evertec est&#xE1; impulsando soluciones de omnicanalidad y migraci&#xF3;n a la nube a escala regional, ofreciendo a nuestros clientes herramientas tecnol&#xF3;gicas que garantizan eficiencia, agilidad y seguridad en un entorno empresarial din&#xE1;mico&#x201D;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Paola P&#xE9;rez Surillo&#xD;
Group Head de Puerto Rico y el Caribe para Evertec&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;La integraci&#xF3;n de Nubity a Evertec ampl&#xED;a a&#xFA;n m&#xE1;s nuestra capacidad para llevar soluciones tecnol&#xF3;gicas avanzadas, como centros de contacto en la nube, a nuevos mercados, garantizando que las empresas de la regi&#xF3;n puedan operar con mayor eficiencia y productividad al tiempo que afianzamos nuestro liderazgo en Puerto Rico, el Caribe y Latinoam&#xE9;rica&#x201D;&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Jorge De Jes&#xFA;s&#xD;
Head de Business Solutions para Evertec&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
Nubity, especializada en servicios gestionados, pr&#xE1;cticas DevOps e implementaci&#xF3;n en la nube, aporta m&#xE1;s de una d&#xE9;cada de experiencia en el manejo de infraestructura tecnol&#xF3;gica a trav&#xE9;s de Latinoam&#xE9;rica. Reconocida como &lt;em&gt;partner&lt;/em&gt; certificado de Amazon Web Services (AWS), esta integraci&#xF3;n estrat&#xE9;gica brinda a Evertec una ventaja competitiva clave en la regi&#xF3;n, consolidando su capacidad para ofrecer soluciones robustas y seguras que modernizan operaciones empresariales.&#xD;
&#xD;
Evertec, a trav&#xE9;s de la adquisici&#xF3;n de &lt;a href="https://nubity.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Nubity&lt;/a&gt;, establece un nuevo est&#xE1;ndar en tecnolog&#xED;a empresarial, ofreciendo soluciones avanzadas que potencian la modernizaci&#xF3;n, la seguridad y la competitividad de las empresas en Am&#xE9;rica Latina. Este paso estrat&#xE9;gico reafirma el compromiso de Evertec con la innovaci&#xF3;n tecnol&#xF3;gica, marcando un nuevo cap&#xED;tulo en la transformaci&#xF3;n digital de la regi&#xF3;n.</post_content><post_excerpt>L&#xED;deres de la banca y empresas locales tuvieron una mirada exclusiva a las soluciones que impulsan la transformaci&#xF3;n digital en la regi&#xF3;n.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-04-10 11:56:39</post_date><post_name>evertec-presenta-nubity-by-evertec-impulsando-la-transformacion-digital-desde-puerto-rico-hacia-toda-latinoamerica</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Evertec-Lanza-Nubity-Transformacio&#x301;n-Digital.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Noticias</post_category><post_tag>Am&#xE9;rica Latina,AWS,DevOps,Evertec,Evertec Nubity,omnicanalidad,Puerto Rico,servicios gestionados,soluciones nube,tecnolog&#xED;a financiera,transformaci&#xF3;n digital</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec Lanza Nubity: Transformaci&#xF3;n Digital %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Evertec presenta Nubity: Impulsa transformaci&#xF3;n digital con soluciones nube, omnicanal. L&#xED;der en Latinoam&#xE9;rica y Puerto Rico.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Evertec presenta Nubity</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec Presents Nubity by Evertec: Leading Digital Transformation from Puerto Rico to All of Latin America</post_title><ID>64553</ID><post_content>Evertec, a leader in financial technology for Latin America and the Caribbean, is entering a new phase of innovation by integrating Nubity, a pioneer in cloud technology solutions. This strategic acquisition represents a crucial step in Evertec's evolution, allowing the company to expand its reach and strengthen its leadership in the region.&#xD;
&#xD;
Senior banking and business executives took part in real-time demonstrations of Nubity by Evertec during the event.&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;With Nubity by Evertec, we are taking our digital transformation vision to the next level. For the first time, Evertec is promoting omnichannel solutions and migration to the cloud on a regional scale, offering our customers technological tools that guarantee efficiency, agility, and security in a dynamic business environment."&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Paola P&#xE9;rez Surillo&#xD;
Group Head of Puerto Rico, and the Caribbean for Evertec&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
&lt;blockquote&gt;Nubity by Evertec further expands our ability to bring advanced technology solutions, such as cloud contact centers, to new markets, ensuring that companies in the region can operate with greater efficiency and productivity while strengthening our leadership in Puerto Rico, the Caribbean and Latin America."&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;cite&gt;Jorge De Jes&#xFA;s&#xD;
Head of Business Solutions for Evertec&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;
&lt;a href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/nubity/"&gt;Nubity&lt;/a&gt;, which specializes in managed services, DevOps practices, and cloud implementation, brings over a decade of experience managing technology infrastructure throughout Latin America. Recognized as an Amazon Web Services (AWS) Certified Partner, this strategic integration provides Evertec with a key competitive advantage in the region, consolidating its ability to deliver robust and secure solutions that modernize business operations.&#xD;
&#xD;
Through the acquisition of &lt;a href="https://nubity.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Nubity,&lt;/a&gt; Evertec sets a new standard in business technology, offering advanced solutions that enhance the modernization, security, and competitiveness of companies in Latin America. This strategic step reaffirms Evertec's commitment to technological innovation, marking a new chapter in the region's digital transformation.</post_content><post_excerpt>Banking leaders and local companies had an exclusive preview at Nubity by Evertec, a cloud-based solution driving digital transformation in the region.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-04-10 12:15:30</post_date><post_name>evertec-leading-digital-transformation-from-puerto-rico-to-all-of-latin-america</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Evertec-Lanza-Nubity-Transformacio&#x301;n-Digital.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag>AWS,soluciones nube,DevOps,Evertec,Evertec Nubity,Latin America,servicios gestionados,omnicanalidad,Puerto Rico,tecnolog&#xED;a financiera,transformaci&#xF3;n digital</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec Launches Nubity: Digital Transformation %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Evertec presents Nubity: Drives digital transformation with cloud, omnichannel solutions. Leader in Latin America and Puerto Rico.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>Evertec presents Nubity</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Evertec at ChilePay's First "Focal Points" Event of 2025</post_title><ID>64592</ID><post_content>&lt;p&gt;During the event, ChilePay presented its strategic plan for 2025, highlighting its commitment to developing and reviewing public policies in the field of payments, coordinating different actors in the ecosystem, and providing financial education. This effort is aimed at merchants and consumers throughout the country.&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				Evertec is fully committed to ChilePay, and it is a privilege to have hosted several companies that trust in this corporation at our offices. Their choice to kick off the first 'Focal Points' event of the year with us reflects our strategic alliance and underscores the importance of such spaces for dialogue and planning to advance our industry.&#x201D;			&lt;/p&gt;
											&lt;cite&gt;Daniel Barba&lt;br&gt;Country Manager for Chile at Evertec&lt;/cite&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;Daniel added, &lt;em&gt;&#x201C;We will continue to work hand in hand with a diverse range of companies to improve the payment experience for all users in the country, always keeping our doors open to collaboration.&#x201D;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;
				This meeting was very important because we presented to the Focal Points of our members the work we have planned for this year and listened to their expectations and proposals for the corporation. It was a great opportunity for conversation, and many ideas and initiatives emerged. We thank Evertec for receiving us in their offices and providing this space for dialogue."			&lt;/p&gt;
											&lt;cite&gt;Juan Antonio Figueroa&lt;br&gt;Executive Director of &lt;a href="https://chilepay.org/" title="ChilePay"&gt;&lt;font color="#ff6c0c"&gt;ChilePay&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/cite&gt;
					&lt;/blockquote&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;The event reinforces the importance of working together to boost the payments ecosystem in Chile and continue moving towards more efficient, secure, and &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/merchants/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"&gt;accessible solutions&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>In a session that brought together key leaders of the payments ecosystem in Chile, ChilePay held its first &#x201C;Focal Points&#x201D; event of the year at Evertec's offices in Santiago. This event marked the beginning of a series of activities that the organization has scheduled for the year, aiming to strengthen its role in the financial sector and means of payment in the country. </post_excerpt><post_date>2025-04-08 13:19:56</post_date><post_name>evertec-at-chilepays-first-focal-points-event-of-2025</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/evento-Focal-Points-de-ChilePay.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>News</post_category><post_tag>evento ChilePay 2025,Focal Points ChilePay,Evertec,Evertec Chile,innovaci&#xF3;n financiera Chile,colaboraci&#xF3;n fintech Chile,medios de pago 2025,ecosistema de pagos Chile</post_tag><translation_priority>Optional</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Evertec Hosts ChilePay Focal Points %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Evertec hosted the first ChilePay Focal Points 2025, reinforcing its commitment to Chile&#x2019;s growing payments ecosystem.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>ChilePay Focal Points event</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Placetopay by Evertec: ahora con cobro por ACH</post_title><ID>64695</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;&#xBF;Qu&#xE9; es Placetopay y &lt;br /&gt;c&#xF3;mo transforma tu negocio?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Placetopay es una plataforma de pagos digitales que te permite gestionar transacciones electr&#xF3;nicas de manera segura y eficiente desde cualquier dispositivo y canal. Dise&#xF1;ada para comerciantes, facilita la aceptaci&#xF3;n de pagos en l&#xED;nea sin necesidad de contar con un sitio web.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Caracter&#xED;sticas&lt;br /&gt;principales&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Diversidad de m&#xE9;todos de pago&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Acepta tarjetas de cr&#xE9;dito, d&#xE9;bito, pagos locales como ATH, entre otras.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Seguridad avanzada&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cumple con la certificaci&#xF3;n internacional PCI DSS y utiliza autenticaci&#xF3;n 3D-Secure y monitoreo de fraude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Facilidad de integraci&#xF3;n&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ideal para distintos modelos de negocio, incluso para cobros sin tienda en l&#xED;nea, pagos con c&#xF3;digo QR y enlaces de pago.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;An&#xE1;lisis estrat&#xE9;gico&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ofrece informaci&#xF3;n clave sobre tus transacciones para mejorar la toma de decisiones.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Nueva opci&#xF3;n de&lt;br /&gt;cobro por ACH&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Para tu conveniencia, Placetopay incorpora el cobro por &lt;em&gt;Automated Clearing House&lt;/em&gt; (ACH, por sus siglas en ingl&#xE9;s), una opci&#xF3;n que permite recibir pagos directamente desde cuentas bancarias. Este m&#xE9;todo de pago alternativo no solo es m&#xE1;s eficiente, sino tambi&#xE9;n m&#xE1;s seguro.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Beneficios&lt;br /&gt;del cobro por ACH&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Costo menor&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Las transacciones ACH suelen ser m&#xE1;s econ&#xF3;micas que los pagos con tarjeta de cr&#xE9;dito.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Mayor seguridad&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reduce riesgos de fraude y errores relacionados con cheques en papel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Procesamiento eficiente&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Acelera la gesti&#xF3;n del flujo de efectivo.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Pagos simplificados&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Perfecto para suscripciones y facturaci&#xF3;n autom&#xE1;tica.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Servicio de&lt;br /&gt;validaci&#xF3;n de cuentas&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Para garantizar transacciones m&#xE1;s seguras, incluimos el servicio de validaci&#xF3;n de cuentas. Esta herramienta verifica la validez de las cuentas bancarias antes de procesar pagos, evitando errores y mejorando la eficiencia.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Ventajas del&lt;br /&gt;servicio de validaci&#xF3;n&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Reducci&#xF3;n de rechazos&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Minimiza los retornos de ACH por cuentas inv&#xE1;lidas o incorrectas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Flujo de efectivo optimizado&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elimina reprocesos y costos adicionales asociados a pagos fallidos.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Potencia tu negocio&lt;br /&gt;con Placetopay&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Da el siguiente paso hacia una gesti&#xF3;n de pagos m&#xE1;s eficiente. Activa el cobro por ACH hoy mismo y mejora la eficiencia y agilidad en el procesamiento de pagos de tu negocio. Nuestro equipo est&#xE1; listo para ayudarte a implementar esta funcionalidad y maximizar los beneficios de Placetopay by Evertec.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cont&#xE1;ctanos hoy mismo para m&#xE1;s informaci&#xF3;n en &lt;a style="color: #ff6600;" href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/solucion-de-pagos-digitales/"&gt;www.evertecinc.com/solucion-de-pagos-digitales&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h6&gt;*ACH no est&#xE1; disponible en Islas V&#xED;rgenes Brit&#xE1;nicas. &lt;a id="LPlnkOWA545ee28e-8aab-f4ee-8e21-5481fdc1d7f1" style="color: #ff6600;" title="https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsandybrown-hedgehog-798082.hostingersite.com%2Fplacetopay-by-evertec-ahora-con-cobro-por-ach%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CDiego.Jimenez%40evertecinc.com%7Cd67e50d057fd4e65e46f08dd8f05b270%7C2b5b7d77f19b4c6db1805768c09ad43b%7C0%7C0%7C638823976831983654%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=UBmbuFAn2%2Fx1GnOc2wxgymHAQ8srauwhOQLXH2%2F4qrE%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0" href="https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsandybrown-hedgehog-798082.hostingersite.com%2Fplacetopay-by-evertec-ahora-con-cobro-por-ach%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CDiego.Jimenez%40evertecinc.com%7Cd67e50d057fd4e65e46f08dd8f05b270%7C2b5b7d77f19b4c6db1805768c09ad43b%7C0%7C0%7C638823976831983654%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=UBmbuFAn2%2Fx1GnOc2wxgymHAQ8srauwhOQLXH2%2F4qrE%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0" data-outlook-id="2b0bd13b-1930-4bc1-be92-7944959fd627"&gt;Cobro por ACH con Placetopay | Evertec&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;</post_content><post_excerpt>Nuestra misi&#xF3;n es seguir en constante evoluci&#xF3;n para ofrecerte soluciones de pago digitales seguras, eficientes y adaptadas a las necesidades de tu negocio. Nuestra plataforma te permite gestionar transacciones electr&#xF3;nicas a trav&#xE9;s de m&#xFA;ltiples canales, sin necesidad de contar con un sitio web, y ahora hemos incorporado una nueva funcionalidad: el cobro por ACH.</post_excerpt><post_date>2025-04-30 12:43:41</post_date><post_name>placetopay-by-evertec-ahora-con-cobro-por-ach</post_name><post_author>djimenez</post_author><post_status>publish</post_status><featured_image>https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2022/06/Evertec-lanza-nueva-plataforma-de-pagos-en-linea.jpg</featured_image><post_format/><comment_status>open</comment_status><ping_status>open</ping_status><pinged/><post_category>Merchant (boletines)</post_category><post_tag>ACH Colombia,automatizaci&#xF3;n de pagos,cobro por ACH,eficiencia financiera,Evertec,Pagos digitales,pagos electr&#xF3;nicos,Placetopay,plataforma de pagos,validaci&#xF3;n de cuentas bancarias</post_tag><translation_priority>Opcional,Opcional,</translation_priority><eael_transient_elements/><ekit_post_views_count/><geot_options>include|||||||This content is restricted in your region</geot_options><hefo_after/><hefo_before/><rs_page_bg_color/><slide_template/><title>Cobro por ACH con Placetopay %%page%% %%sep%% %%sitename%%</title><meta_desc>Descubre c&#xF3;mo Placetopay ahora permite cobros por ACH, optimizando tus pagos digitales con mayor seguridad, eficiencia y menor costo.</meta_desc><meta-robots-noindex/><meta-robots-nofollow/><meta-robots-adv/><bctitle/><canonical/><redirect/><opengraph-title/><opengraph-description/><opengraph-image/><twitter-title/><twitter-description/><twitter-image/><google-plus-title/><google-plus-description/><google-plus-image/><focus_keyword>cobro por ACH con Placetopay</focus_keyword><schema_page_type/><schema_article_type/><cornerstone-content/><focuskeywords/><keywordsynonyms/></item><item><post_title>Placetopay by Evertec: Now with ACH Payment Processing</post_title><ID>64701</ID><post_content>&lt;h2&gt;What is Placetopay, and&lt;br /&gt;
how can it transform your business?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Placetopay is a digital payment platform that enables secure and efficient handling of electronic transactions from any device or channel. Designed for merchants, it simplifies accepting online payments without needing a website.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key&lt;br /&gt;Features&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Diverse Payment Methods&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Accepts credit cards, debit cards, local payment options like ATH, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Advanced Security&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Complies with international PCI DSS certification and includes 3D-Secure authentication and fraud monitoring.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Ease of Integration&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Suitable for various business models, including transactions without an online store, QR code payments, and payment links.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Strategic Insights&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Offers essential transaction data to aid in better decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;New ACH&lt;br /&gt;
Payment Option&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Placetopay now offers Automated Clearing House (ACH) payment processing to enhance your convenience. This option allows you to receive payments directly from bank accounts. ACH payments are not only more efficient but also provide increased security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits of&lt;br /&gt;ACH Payments&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Lower Costs&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;ACH transactions generally have lower fees than credit card payments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Greater Security&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reduces fraud risks and errors associated with paper checks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Efficient Processing&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Speeds up cash flow management.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Simplified Payments&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Perfect for subscriptions and automated billing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Account&lt;br /&gt;
Validation Service&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure transaction safety, we have added an account validation service. This tool verifies the validity of bank accounts before processing payments, helping prevent errors and improving efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Advantages of the&lt;br /&gt;Validation Service&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Fewer Rejections&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Minimizes ACH returns due to invalid or incorrect accounts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Optimized Cash Flow&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Eliminates reprocessing and additional costs linked to failed payments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Boost Your Business&lt;br /&gt;with Placetopay&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take the next step toward more efficient payment management. Activate ACH payment processing today and enhance your business&#x2019;s efficiency and agility. Our team is ready to help you implement this feature and maximize the benefits of Placetopay by Evertec.&#xA0;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Contact us today for more information at &lt;a href="https://lightpink-turkey-148687.hostingersite.com/en/ecommerce-gateway/"&gt;www.evertecinc.com/en/ecommerce-gateway&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h6&gt;*ACH is not available in British Virgin Islands. &lt;a id="LPlnkOWA51454d3c-be16-25a7-73bb-6d5199ad52bd" style="color: #ff6600;" title="https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsandybrown-hedgehog-798082.hostingersite.com%2Fen%2Fplacetopay-by-evertec-now-with-ach-payment-processing%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CDiego.Jimenez%40evertecinc.com%7Cd67e50d057fd4e65e46f08dd8f05b270%7C2b5b7d77f19b4c6db1805768c09ad43b%7C0%7C0%7C638823976832023433%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=VFB1zB9DtcJTnmWonTixLAqTsxaWcAECEIUby%2BHo67c%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0" href="https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsandybrown-hedgehog-798082.hostingersite.com%2Fen%2Fplacetopay-by-evertec-now-with-ach-payment-processing%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CDiego.Jimenez%40evertecinc.com%7Cd67e50d057fd4e65e46f08dd8f05b270%7C2b5b7d77f19b4c6db1805768c09ad43b%7C0%7C0%7C638823976832023433%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjo